at creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'When Eyeblight Assassin enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', "When Ghirapur Gearcrafter enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying. (A creature with flying can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'When Guardian Automaton dies, you gain 3 life.', 'When Heavy Infantry enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls.', "When Llanowar Empath enters the battlefield, scry 2, then reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it into your hand. (To scry 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)", 'When Meteorite enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to any target.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', "When Nissa, Vastwood Seer enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\nWhenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, if you control seven or more lands, exile Nissa, then return her to the battlefield transformed under her owner's control.", 'When Pia and Kiran Nalaar enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Pia and Kiran Nalaar deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Possessed Skaab enters the battlefield, return target instant, sorcery, or creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\nIf Possessed Skaab would die, exile it instead.', 'When Priest of the Blood Rite enters the battlefield, create a 5/5 black Demon creature token with flying.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 2 life.', 'When Returned Centaur enters the battlefield, target player mills four cards.', 'When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.', 'When Screeching Skaab enters the battlefield, mill two cards.', "When Seismic Elemental enters the battlefield, creatures without flying can't block this turn.", "When Separatist Voidmage enters the battlefield, you may return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'When Shaman of the Pack enters the battlefield, target opponent loses life equal to the number of Elves you control.', "When Subterranean Scout enters the battlefield, target creature with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn.", 'When Thopter Engineer enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\nArtifact creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', 'When Totem-Guide Hartebeest enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Aura card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Undead Servant enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token for each card named Undead Servant in your graveyard.', "When Whirler Rogue enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\\nTap two untapped artifacts you control: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'When Woodland Bellower enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a nonlegendary green creature card with mana value 3 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "When Yeva's Forcemage enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Whenever Thornbow Archer attacks, each opponent who doesn't control an Elf loses 1 life.", 'Whenever a creature an opponent controls becomes the target of a spell or ability you control, gain control of that creature for as long as you control Willbreaker.', 'Whenever a creature an opponent controls dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Malakir Cullblade.', 'Whenever a creature dies, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)\\n{4}{B}: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life. Activate only if there are four or more creature cards in your graveyard.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Angel's Tomb become a 3/3 white Angel artifact creature with flying until end of turn.", 'Whenever a creature with power 3 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', "Whenever a creature you control becomes blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n{1}{G}: Target creature you control gains trample until end of turn. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Whenever a nontoken creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {R}. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that creature. That token gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Whenever equipped creature attacks alone, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each other creature you control.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Whenever you cast a red spell, untap Chandra, Fire of Kaladesh.\\n{T}: Chandra, Fire of Kaladesh deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker. If Chandra has dealt 3 or more damage this turn, exile her, then return her to the battlefield transformed under her owner's control.", 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, you may have target creature get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you draw a card, target opponent mills two cards. If two nonland cards that share a color were milled this way, repeat this process.\\n{5}{U}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', "You have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nIf a creature would deal damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage.", "You may cast Harbinger of the Tides as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it. (You may cast it any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Harbinger of the Tides enters the battlefield, you may return target tapped creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", "Zendikar Incarnate's power is equal to the number of lands you control.", '[+1]: Chandra, Roaring Flame deals 2 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n[−2]: Chandra, Roaring Flame deals 2 damage to target creature.\\n[−7]: Chandra, Roaring Flame deals 6 damage to each opponent. Each player dealt damage this way gets an emblem with "At the beginning of your upkeep, this emblem deals 3 damage to you."', "[+1]: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand.\\n[−2]: Create Ashaya, the Awoken World, a legendary 4/4 green Elemental creature token.\\n[−7]: Untap up to six target lands. They become 6/6 Elemental creatures. They're still lands.", '[+1]: Up to one target creature gets -2/-0 until your next turn.\\n[−3]: You may cast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard this turn. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\\n[−9]: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a spell, target opponent mills five cards."', '[+2]: Each player discards a card.\\n[−X]: Return target nonlegendary creature card with mana value X from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Whenever a creature dies, return it to the battlefield under your control at the beginning of the next end step."', "[+2]: Up to one target creature an opponent controls attacks Gideon, Battle-Forged during its controller's next turn if able.\\n[+1]: Until your next turn, target creature gains indestructible. Untap that creature.\\n[0]: Until end of turn, Gideon, Battle-Forged becomes a 4/4 Human Soldier creature with indestructible that's still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn.", '{1}, Exile an instant or sorcery card from your graveyard: Choose one —\\n• Counter target noncreature spell unless its controller pays {2}.\\n• Disciple of the Ring gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n• Tap target creature.\\n• Untap target creature.', '{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Blazing Hellhound deals 1 damage to any target.', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice Caustic Caterpillar: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{1}{R}: Bellows Lizard gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{2}{R}: Volcanic Rambler deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{2}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{4}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{G}, Sacrifice a creature: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Put that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', '{R}, Discard a land card: Molten Vortex deals 2 damage to any target.', '{R}: Fiery Hellhound gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G}. Spend this mana only to cast an Elf creature spell.\\n{T}: Target attacking Elf you control gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Mage-Ring Network.\\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Mage-Ring Network: Add {C} for each storage counter removed this way.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Foundry of the Consuls: Create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Llanowar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Yavimaya Coast deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Battlefield Forge deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Shivan Reef deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Caves of Koilos deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {R}. When that mana is spent to cast a red instant or sorcery spell, copy that spell and you may choose new targets for the copy.', "{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card. If there are five or more cards in your graveyard, exile Jace, Vryn's Prodigy, then return him to the battlefield transformed under his owner's control.", '{T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{T}: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{U}: Watercourser gets +1/-1 until end of turn.']
flavor: ['"A long and difficult incision revealed that all vital organs are housed in the head, save for a long chain of stomachs, forty in all, leading from its throat to the end of the tail."\\n—Mulak Ffar, *Vastwood Biodiversity*', '"A master of hieromancy can see the advantage in any scenario."\\n—Warden Hixus, to Kytheon', '"A single tree does not a forest make. We are stronger when we stand together."\\n—Numa, Joraga chieftain', '"All dead move to the hollow rhythm of necromancy."\\n—Savra', '"And if I\'m lying," he began . . .', '"Another day. Another avenging angel. Another clump of feathers to toss in the trash."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Arise. You have been anointed by the light. Go forth and fight without fear, for you shall be victorious."', '"As long as each side thinks it can win, the balance holds, and the mage-rings stand."\\n—Alhammarret', '"Bant\'s most gallant knights wear my sigil, and for that I am humbled."', '"Beware an eddy where there should be none or a stretch that flows too fast or too slow."\\n—Old Fishbones, Martyne river guide', '"Boggart blood disgusts me almost as much as the foul creatures themselves."', '"Canyons in the Phoberos badlands are essentially gates to the Underworld."\\n—Mirinthes, Akroan captain', '"Come, my beautiful brothers and sisters. Let us hunt."\\n—Dwynen, Gilt-Leaf daen', '"Don\'t be rude, Beleren. We just want to enjoy the view with you."', '"Drink this, brother. It will bring you rest."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Even from miles away, I could see our eagles circling. That\'s when I knew we were needed at home."\\n—Kanlos, Akroan captain', '"Every death has a web of consequences. Our job is to find the spider."', '"Faith can quicken the stones themselves with life."\\n—Writings of Mikaeus', '"From a tiny sprout, the greatest trees grow and flourish. May the seeds of your mind be equally fruitful."', '"Get up. You\'re not finished yet."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Guilty."', '"Her people angered Zendikar, and they faced the land\'s wrath. That is why Nissa is the last of the animists."\\n—Numa, Joraga chieftain', '"I am the first line of defense. You will not encounter the second."', '"I can think of worse ways to go. On second thought, maybe not."\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"I do not reject the gods. I reject their authority, their pettiness, and their arrogance."', '"I don\'t need your mage-rings or your mana equations. I call, and the sea answers."\\n—Keyta, rebel hydromancer', '"I had hoped to instill in it the loyalty of a guard dog, but with fire\'s power comes its unpredictability."\\n—Maggath, Sardian elementalist', '"I hope to meet Jaya Ballard someday. I think we\'d get along."\\n—Chandra Nalaar', '"I know what you\'re thinking," Jace whispered in the mage\'s mind. "It\'s not going to work."', '"I want to help Zendikar. Show me the way."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"I was not convinced you had a soul until I saw it for myself."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"I was wrong. Zendikar isn\'t after me. It isn\'t after any of us. It\'s not evil or vengeful. It\'s magnificent . . . but it\'s in pain."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"I will be your most demanding master, Liliana. But I have great things in mind for you."', '"I will not rest until the stench of eyeblights is eradicated from these woods."', '"I\'ve already seen so much evil, so much darkness. Why do you insist on adding more?"\\n—Nissa Revane, to Dwynen', '"I\'ve broken three swords, eighteen lances, and countless shields, but this little blade has survived every battle, just like I have."', '"In memories, we can find our deepest reserves of strength."', '"It saddens me to lose a source of inspiration. This one seemed especially promising."\\n—Ashiok', '"It\'s all a game. You shouldn\'t get too attached to the pieces."', '"Let nothing own the skies but the wind."\\n—Dejara, Giltwood druid', '"Master your mind, or I shall master it for you."', '"My scars are my sigils. I will wear them with pride long after you\'re gone."', '"Nature can\'t be stopped. It rips and tears at Ravnica\'s tallest buildings to claim its place in the sun."', '"Not all nightmares can be escaped by waking."\\n—Ashiok', '"People\'s thoughts just come to me. Sometimes I don\'t know if it\'s them or me thinking."', '"Pick not the rotten fruit, but neither touch the best. Leave those as an offering for our unseen guests."\\n—Radwick, farmer of Gatstaf', '"Ribbit."', '"Seal the gate. This is our fight now."', '"The bloodlust shall not control me, for my oath is my greatest compulsion."', '"The cathars have their swords, the inquisitors their axes. I prefer the \'diplomatic\' approach."\\n—Terhold, archmage of Drunau', '"The cathars killed my skaabs down below. Let\'s see how high their swords can reach."\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"The desire for its magic horn inspires such bloodthirsty greed that all who see the unicorn will kill to possess it."\\n—Dionus, elvish archdruid', '"The entire murder scene was covered in dripping, oozing slime. No need for a soothsayer to solve that one."\\n—Pel Javya, Wojek investigator', '"The rare and beautiful butterflies inspire the design of our thopters. The larvae, however, are a different story entirely."\\n—Kiran Nalaar, Ghirapur inventor', '"The soul sheds light, and death is its shadow. When the light dims, life and death embrace."\\n—Nantuko teaching', '"The southern fortress taken by invaders? Heh, sure . . . when elephants fly."\\n—Brezard Skeinbow, captain of the guard', '"There is power in abandon, but far more in control."\\n—Warden Hixus, to Kytheon', '"They started it."', '"This is our land. We will not allow eyeblights to poison its beauty."', '"To be a knight, Gideon, is to be the shield for the meek against the cruel."', '"Trying to stop it would be foolish. If you feel it coming—run!"\\n—Sergeant Ryda', '"Well, this got out of hand."', '"When you are felled by my mace, you shall know it was divine fate."', '"Where\'s the fun in an escape if it\'s not at least a little daring?"', '"Why does everything the Golgari touch end up sticky?"\\n—Arrester Lavinia, Tenth Precinct', '"You were defeated the moment you declared your aggression."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"You\'ve never considered the implications of dealing with another telepath, Jace."', '"Your flesh is unprepared for my gifts."', '"Your swords and wards have no power here."', "A stitcher's attempt at a skaab with a soul.", 'A true scribe devotes an entire lifetime to the creation of a single volume, a masterpiece as unique as its maker.', 'A weapon best suited for those with good aim and steady hands.', "Accustomed to battling before an audience in the arena, Iroas's champions know how to put on a good show.", 'After stripping the sunken ships, it rises to the surface for another helping.', 'Alhammarret rose to his feet, and the full force of his mind hit Jace like a storm front.', 'All around the foundry, automatons unhitched themselves from their mounts and pivoted to face Chandra.', 'As the price of wood and coal rose, smiths found creative ways to keep their forges burning.', 'As unstoppable as it is unsteerable.', 'Blessed by the gods. Coveted by mortals. Beholden to neither.', 'Born from the slaughter of an entire army, it bears the wrath of a hundred souls.', "Chandra's gift set her apart and others aflame.", 'Chief among the tenets of Purphoros is that one must destroy in order to create.', 'Creatures of darkness instinctively hide from the light.', 'Destiny is a flickering path among tangled possibilities.', 'Doors, walls, skulls . . . it matters not. All barriers will be broken.', "Drakes can swerve to avoid a single arrow, but they can't dodge the whole sky.", 'Driven away by his living kin, he wanders mourning through the wilderness, seeking the dead city of Asphodel.', 'Each cut stains his blade with fresh blood that he samples to increase his strength.', 'Eidren, perfect of Lys Alana, ordered hundreds of trees uprooted and rearranged into a pattern he deemed beautiful. Thus the Gilt-Leaf Wood was born.', 'Empires rise and fall, but evil is eternal.', "Ending her life won't end the infestation.", 'Energy surges in Izzet labs are opportunities for experimentation.', 'Follow the light. In its absence, follow her.', 'Four claws, two wings, one beak, no fear.', "Goblins journey to the sacrificial peaks in pairs so that the rare survivor might be able to relate the details of the other's grisly demise.", 'Grixis is a world where the only things found in abundance are death and decay. Corpses, whole or in part, are the standard currency among necromancers and demons.', 'He ensures escape attempts are just that—attempts.', 'He grants endless wishes, as long as you always wish for a blade.', "He has the biggest bashing stick, so it's a safe bet he's the leader.", "If you can't take the heat . . . well, that's going to be a problem.", "If you stare at the sun for too long, you'll lose your ability to see clearly.", 'In the moment before her execution, she realized what it meant to be a pyromancer, to be alive, to be Chandra.', 'In time, not even the fire monks could keep up with Chandra.', "It contains the totality of Alhammarret's notes, theories, and ponderings.", 'It is hunted, but not for the kill. The magic within draws others to its presence.', 'It moves through lava with the force of an erupting volcano.', 'It tears the flesh from your bones and then swallows the ash with its fiery maw.', 'It was in fields of grain, not fields of battle, that the Champion learned to bear the yoke of duty to the gods. She worked the land long before she was called on to defend it.\\n—*The Theriad*', "It's pointless to hold on when you have nothing to hold on with.", "It's the favored mount of military commanders as well as anyone with a flair for the dramatic.", 'Its blessings are as numerous as the stars of Nyx.', 'Its screeching is the sound of you losing your mind.', "Jenrik's tower is served by those who once sought to enter it uninvited.", "Kruphix hid the most dire prophecies about humankind where humans would never find them and tritons wouldn't care to read them.", 'Kytheon and his irregulars worked outside the law to bring justice to the streets of Akros.', 'Life is such a fragile thing.', 'Liliana viewed the attention of the angels as a testament to her power. Even so, they were an annoyance.', "Loyal to a fault, it heeds its master's every command.", 'Masters of the arcane savor a delicious irony. Their study of deep and complex arcana leads to such a simple end: the ability to say merely yes or no.', 'Nissa found that the vines of the marsh could ensnare just as well as forest vines could—maybe even better.', 'Nissa had only the space of a heartbeat to react, her instincts steering her blade.', 'Not all heroes die in armor.', 'Not all spiders need webs to catch their prey.', 'Nothing of nature nor of mortals can stand forever.', 'Of royal blood among the spirits of the air, the Mahamoti djinn rides on the wings of the winds. As dangerous in the gambling hall as he is in battle, he is a master of trickery and misdirection.', 'On Innistrad, Liliana embraced necromancy, honing her powers by practicing on scores of undead—and sometimes the living.', 'Once he gets up and going, he will forever shamble on.', 'One faerie distracts the judge while a second steals the law.', 'One orb to guard the body, one to protect the mind, and one to shield the soul.', 'One who is marked by a demon in life is sure to be remembered as one in death.', 'Proud Alkmenos, who would not bow to Erebos in death, is now bowed by his own hubris for all eternity.', 'Rats and vultures devour. It desecrates.', 'Ravnica would be safer if mere coin was all the Dimir could steal.', "Ravnica's most ancient streets take on a life of their own. A few have decided to move to nicer neighborhoods.", 'Rumors quickly spread among thieves about a labyrinth without walls and a prize beyond all measures of worth.', 'Scholars had puzzled for centuries over the ruins at Tal Terig. Its secrets had always lived within one rune-carved head.', 'She haunts the streets, wings spread wide, with carrion on her breath and blood in her eyes.', "She learned a tragic lesson that day: even the purest can be corrupted when the heart's emotions are twisted.", 'She will not be content until hers is the highest head in the sky.', 'Six feet of earth muffled his cries.', 'Some will sacrifice everything for but a taste of power.', 'Sometimes violent earthquakes, hurtling boulders, and unseasonable dust storms are wrongly attributed to the Roil.', 'Stray into the Morkrut and it may rise to claim you.', 'The Boros legionnaire saw a noble sacrifice, the Rakdos thug a blazing suicide, and the Izzet alchemist an experiment gone awry.', "The Joraga elves never need ask a troll to leave their territory. They merely grant it their combined strength, and it can't resist embarking on a merry rampage.", 'The artificers of Kaladesh strive ceaselessly for perfection, progress, and the ultimate expression of elegance.', "The blade glows only for Zendikar's chosen.", 'The city of Ghirapur is a living thing, and living things defend themselves.', "The dead know lessons the living haven't learned.", "The distinction of bearing the gods' banner is nothing compared to the glory of being closer to Nyx.", 'The essence of nature is change.', 'The ethereal touch brings relief. The physical touch brings peace.', 'The evil inside the mountain pulsed at Nissa in a shock wave of madness.', 'The foundries of Kaladesh run like clockwork under the supervision of their formidable overseers.', "The giant Tarvik dreamed that trinkets and machines caused all the world's woe. When he awoke from his troubled sleep, he took the name Tarvik Relicsmasher.", 'The harpies descended without mercy upon Akros, only to find their attack put them within range of the javelineers.', 'The histories speak of two feuding rulers whose deaths were celebrated and whose monuments symbolized the end of their wars. In truth they were peaceful lovers, their story lost to the ages.', 'The massive dominate through might. The tiny survive with guile. Beware the tiny who become massive.', 'The metal must be pure. The hand must be steady. The product must be perfect.', 'The only thing more ill-tempered than a griffin in a web is the spider that must subdue it.', 'The owls learn of mana from the mages who know it best.', 'The portcullis is superfluous.', "The reverberations course through the warriors' veins, beat with their hearts, and pound with their footfalls as they charge into battle.", 'The sea respects no boundaries, least of all the coast.', "The spear thrown by Kytheon's own hand was the weapon that felled his friends.", 'The thunder of its hooves beats dreams into despair.', 'The undisputed master of the mountains of Shiv.', 'The wealthy in the city of Ghirapur outfit their lives with grand machines, entrusting even their children to filigree and gears.', 'The wise pay as much attention to what they throw away as to what they keep.', 'Their strength is no mere numbers game. An intangible force augments the wolves when they run together.', 'They became a single entity, a phalanx in the Temple of Triumph standing against a host of enemies.', 'Three heads are better than one.', "Thunder doesn't always mean rain. Sometimes it means ruin.", 'To stand as a guardian of the sea, one must possess the resolve of a mounting wave.', 'To the elves, her spear is a compass; to the boggarts, a harbinger of doom.', 'True faith is letting the blade fall without parry. True cunning is using that moment to strike a deadly blow.', 'Unpredictable as a storm and destructive as a tidal wave.', "War after war, a healer's enemy is always the same—death itself.", 'Waste follows want.', 'Wear it on your dominant hand and it will follow your lead.', 'When Asha left Bant, she ensured that the world would have protection and order in her absence.', 'When the shadow of the aven falls across the battlefield, hope rises in the hearts of the soldiers.', 'When things get ugly above ground, goblins resort to alternate routes of passage.', 'With each honor he earns, Gideon paves the path to his redemption.', 'Without the interfering hands of civilization, nature will always shape itself to its own needs.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Allen Williams', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Frazier', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Gaillet', 'David Palumbo', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Donato Giancola', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Velhagen', 'Erica Yang', 'Eytan Zana', 'Filip Burburan', 'Goran Josic', 'Greg Staples', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jakub Kasper', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'James Zapata', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jasper Sandner', 'Jeff Simpson', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Severin Brassell', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Julie Dillon', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Karla Ortiz', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Larry Elmore', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lindsey Look', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Marco Nelor', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Miles Johnston', 'Min Yum', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Peter Mohrbacher', 'Philip Straub', 'Quinton Hoover', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Burley', 'Sam Wood', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Luke', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Ted Galaday', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Titus Lunter', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Torstein Nordstrand', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wesley Burt', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yan Li', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros', 'rk post']
