rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The number of Goblins is counted when this ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire deals nonlethal damage to a creature and then a different effect or damage source causes that creature to be put into a graveyard later in the turn, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger and it will get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Each time a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, check whether Sengir Vampire had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger. It doesn\'t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire and a creature it dealt damage to are both put into a graveyard at the same time, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger, but it will do nothing when it resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you control 0 swamps, then the Nightmare has 0 toughness and will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action right before the next player gains priority.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s power and toughness changes as the number of Swamps you control changes.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s ability counts all lands you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability that defines Nightmare’s power and toughness works everywhere, not just on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "Knight of the White Orchid\'s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless any one of your opponents controls more lands than you, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control at least as many lands as each of your opponents by the time it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The Plains you search for doesn\'t have to be basic. For example, you could put a Sacred Foundry onto the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Destroying a blocking creature won\'t cause any of the creatures it was blocking to become unblocked. They won\'t deal combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker (unless they have trample)."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Terra Stomper can be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Cancel). Those spells will resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Terra Stomper won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'A Gaea’s Revenge spell can be targeted by spells and abilities that would counter it. The part of their effect that would counter Gaea’s Revenge won’t do anything, but any other effects those spells or abilities may have will still happen, if applicable.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Gaea’s Revenge’s first ability works only while it’s a spell on the stack. Gaea’s Revenge’s last ability works only while it’s on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Gaea’s Revenge’s last ability applies to all nongreen spells and abilities from nongreen sources, including ones you control. For example, you can’t target it with the equip ability of an Equipment you control (unless the Equipment is somehow green).'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a spell is one or more colors, and one of those colors is green, that spell can target Gaea’s Revenge.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If there’s only one card in your library when Tower Geist enters the battlefield, you’ll look at that card and put it into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Aegis Angel and the permanent would be destroyed simultaneously, only Aegis Angel will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Aegis Angel leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Aegis Angel, the permanent will no longer have indestructible, even if you regain control of Aegis Angel.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The number of cards put into the graveyard is based on the number of lands you control when Dreadwaters resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Chandra’s Fury targets only the player, not any creature. Chandra’s Fury will deal 1 damage to a creature with hexproof, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Yeva’s Forcemage’s ability is mandatory, although you can choose Yeva’s Forcemage as the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If another player gains control of either Murder Investigation or the enchanted creature (but not both), Murder Investigation will be enchanting an illegal permanent. The Aura will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'To determine how many Soldier tokens are created, use the power of the enchanted creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Blightcaster’s ability will resolve before the enchantment spell that caused it to trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If you are the only player who controls a creature when Blightcaster’s ability triggers, you must choose one as the target, although you can choose not to give it -2/-2.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you are the only player who controls a creature when Blightcaster’s ability triggers, you must choose one of those creatures as the target, although you can choose to not give it -2/-2.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Celestial Flare targets only a player, not any creature. A creature with hexproof or protection from white can be sacrificed this way.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Creatures continue to be attacking or blocking creatures through the end of combat step. It is possible to cast Celestial Flare within combat but after combat damage is dealt (specifically, during the combat damage step or the end of combat step). Only attacking and blocking creatures that survived combat damage can be sacrificed at this time.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the player sacrifices a blocking creature, any attacking creature it was blocking remains blocked. Unless that attacking creature has trample or is being blocked by another creature, it won’t assign or deal combat damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "The loss of life is part of the spell\'s effect. It\'s not an additional cost. If Read the Bones doesn\'t resolve, you won\'t lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The targeted player will discard a number of cards equal to the power of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrifice to stop you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast Tormented Thoughts. You can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one of the Theros block Gods is affected by Turn to Frog, it will be a legendary 1/1 blue Frog enchantment creature with no abilities. If it stops being a creature, perhaps because your devotion to its color(s) decreased, it will be a legendary blue enchantment with no abilities. The way continuous effects work, the God’s type-changing ability is applied before the effect that removes that ability is applied.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Turn to Frog resolves, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creature will lose all other colors and creature types, but it will retain any other card types (such as artifact) or supertypes (such as legendary) it may have.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog doesn’t counter abilities that have already triggered or been activated. In particular, there is no way to cast this spell to stop a creature’s ability that says “At the beginning of your upkeep,” “When this creature enters the battlefield,” or similar from triggering.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Turn to Frog resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "A creature attacks alone if it\'s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step (including creatures controlled by your teammates, if applicable). For example, Sigil of Valor\'s ability won\'t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Count the number of creatures you control other than the equipped creature as Sigil of Valor\'s ability resolves to determine the amount of the bonus. Once the ability resolves, the bonus won\'t change, even if the number of creatures you control does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Acolyte of the Inferno\'s last ability triggers and resolves before combat damage is dealt. If that causes each creature blocking Acolyte of the Inferno to be destroyed, Acolyte of the Inferno will remain blocked and neither deal nor be dealt combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Acolyte of the Inferno\'s last ability will trigger once for each creature that blocks it. Each of those creatures will be dealt 2 damage."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If a creature with renown deals combat damage to its controller because that damage was redirected, renown will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If a renown ability triggers, but the creature leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, the creature doesn\\\'t become renowned. Any ability that triggers "whenever a creature becomes renowned" won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Renown won\'t trigger when a creature deals combat damage to a planeswalker or another creature. It also won\'t trigger when a creature deals noncombat damage to a player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Any spell you cast that doesn\'t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won\'t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won\'t cause prowess to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the card, it will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Once it triggers, prowess isn\'t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Playing the card exiled with Abbot of Keral Keep\'s ability follows the normal rules for playing that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if the card is a creature card, you can cast that card by paying its mana cost only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The card exiled by Abbot of Keral Keep\'s ability is exiled face up."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Unless an effect allows you to play additional lands that turn, you can play a land card exiled with Abbot of Keral Keep\'s ability only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'You may play that card that turn even if Abbot of Keral Keep is no longer on the battlefield or under your control.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "If some (but not all) of the targets become illegal before Aerial Volley tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies, but no damage is dealt to illegal targets. If all targets become illegal, Aerial Volley won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'You choose how many targets Aerial Volley has and how the damage is divided as you cast the spell. Each target must receive at least 1 damage.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "If the creature becomes an illegal target by the time Chandra\'s Ignition tries to resolve (perhaps because another player controls it or it\'s left the battlefield), Chandra\'s Ignition won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The creature is the source of the damage, not Chandra\'s Ignition. For example, Chandra\'s Ignition can have a white creature deal damage to a creature with protection from red."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Use the power of the target creature as Chandra\'s Ignition resolves to determine how much damage it deals to each other creature and each opponent."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled the permanent when it was put into a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The triggered ability is mandatory. You can\'t decline to draw the card and lose life, even if you want to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Managorger Hydra\'s last ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Once an attacking creature with menace is legally blocked by two or more creatures, removing one or more of those blockers from combat won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The power and toughness of the target non-Elf creature are checked again as Gilt-Leaf Winnower\'s triggered ability would resolve. If that creature\'s power and toughness are equal at that time, the ability doesn\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The last ability will trigger, at most, once per combat damage step per player. However, if at least one artifact creature you control has first strike and others don\'t, or if an artifact creature you control has double strike, the ability could trigger twice per combat: once in each combat damage step."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Thopter Spy Network\'s first ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless you control an artifact as your upkeep begins, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you don\'t control an artifact as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You must discard exactly one land card to cast Magmatic Insight. You can\'t cast it without discarding a land card, and you can\'t discard additional cards."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A Magic Origins planeswalker that enters the battlefield because of the ability of its front face will enter with loyalty counters as normal.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A double-faced card enters the battlefield with its front face up by default, unless a spell or ability instructs you to put it onto the battlefield transformed, in which case it enters with its back face up.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Chandra, Fire of Kaladesh’s activated ability will count any damage Chandra has dealt during the turn to any permanent or player, including combat damage.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Each face of a double-faced card has its own set of characteristics: name, types, subtypes, power and toughness, loyalty, abilities, and so on. While a double-faced card is on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of the face that’s currently up. The other set of characteristics is ignored. While a double-faced card isn’t on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Each player who gets Chandra’s emblem is the owner of that emblem. In multiplayer games, that emblem will remain in the game as long as its owner does, even if Chandra’s owner leaves the game.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down (this is also true if it’s put onto the battlefield face down some other way). Note that “face down” is not synonymous with “with its back face up.” A manifested double-faced card is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of a manifested double-faced card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced card on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In some rare cases, a spell or ability may cause one of these five cards to transform while it’s a creature (front face up) on the battlefield. If this happens, the resulting planeswalker won’t have any loyalty counters on it and will subsequently be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Only players actually dealt damage by the third ability of Chandra, Roaring Flame will get an emblem. If all of that damage to a player is prevented, that player won’t get an emblem. If any of that damage is redirected to Chandra’s controller, that player will get an emblem.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card (in the case of Magic Origins, the planeswalker face) can’t be cast.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The emblem created by Chandra, Roaring Flame is colorless. The damage it deals is from a colorless source.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The last sentence of Chandra, Fire of Kaladesh’s activated ability isn’t a separate ability. The check happens only as that activated ability resolves. You must activate the ability in order to exile Chandra and return her to the battlefield transformed, even if Chandra has already dealt 3 or more damage during the turn.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The mana value of a double-faced card not on the battlefield is the mana value of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can activate one of the planeswalker’s loyalty abilities the turn it enters the battlefield. However, you may do so only during one of your main phases when the stack is empty. For example, if the planeswalker enters the battlefield during combat, there will be an opportunity for your opponent to remove it before you can activate one of its abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card doesn’t have a mana cost. A double-faced permanent with its back face up has a mana value equal to the mana value of its front face. Each back face has a color indicator that defines its color.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You can control two of this permanent, one front-face up and the other back-face up, at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A Magic Origins planeswalker that enters the battlefield because of the ability of its front face will enter with loyalty counters as normal.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A double-faced card enters the battlefield with its front face up by default, unless a spell or ability instructs you to put it onto the battlefield transformed, in which case it enters with its back face up.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Each face of a double-faced card has its own set of characteristics: name, types, subtypes, power and toughness, loyalty, abilities, and so on. While a double-faced card is on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of the face that’s currently up. The other set of characteristics is ignored. While a double-faced card isn’t on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Gideon’s first ability causes a creature to attack him if able. If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, that creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under its controller’s control continuously since that player’s turn began, then that creature doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If they don’t, the creature doesn’t have to attack.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Gideon’s third ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: Gideon is just a planeswalker type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Gideon becomes a creature due to his third ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Gideon was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Gideon can’t be attacked, perhaps because he has left the battlefield before the creature’s controller’s next combat, the creature targeted by Gideon’s first ability can attack you or another planeswalker you control, or its controller can choose to have it not attack at all.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down (this is also true if it’s put onto the battlefield face down some other way). Note that “face down” is not synonymous with “with its back face up.” A manifested double-faced card is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of a manifested double-faced card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced card on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the creature targeted by Gideon’s first ability changes controllers before it has the chance to attack Gideon, the ability will apply to it during its new controller’s next turn.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you activate Gideon’s third ability and then damage is dealt to him that can’t be prevented, that damage has all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). If Gideon has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard as a state-based action. (As long as he still has indestructible, the marked damage won’t cause him to be destroyed.)'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In some rare cases, a spell or ability may cause one of these five cards to transform while it’s a creature (front face up) on the battlefield. If this happens, the resulting planeswalker won’t have any loyalty counters on it and will subsequently be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Kytheon’s first ability will count creatures that attacked but are no longer on the battlefield (perhaps because they didn’t survive combat damage being dealt). It will not count any creatures that were put onto the battlefield attacking, as those creatures were never declared as attackers.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Say you activate Gideon’s third ability, then an opponent gains control of him before combat. You may have any of your creatures attack Gideon (since he’s still a planeswalker). Then Gideon may block (since he’s a creature). He may block any eligible attacking creature, including one that’s attacking him. During combat, he behaves as an attacked planeswalker and/or a blocking creature, as appropriate. For example, he deals combat damage to any creatures he’s blocking, but he doesn’t deal combat damage to any unblocked creatures that are attacking him.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card (in the case of Magic Origins, the planeswalker face) can’t be cast.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a double-faced card not on the battlefield is the converted mana cost of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can activate one of the planeswalker’s loyalty abilities the turn it enters the battlefield. However, you may do so only during one of your main phases when the stack is empty. For example, if the planeswalker enters the battlefield during combat, there will be an opportunity for your opponent to remove it before you can activate one of its abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card doesn’t have a mana cost. A double-faced permanent with its back face up has a converted mana cost equal to the converted mana cost of its front face. Each back face has a color indicator that defines its color.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You can control two of this permanent, one front-face up and the other back-face up, at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A Magic Origins planeswalker that enters the battlefield because of the ability of its front face will enter with loyalty counters as normal.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A double-faced card enters the battlefield with its front face up by default, unless a spell or ability instructs you to put it onto the battlefield transformed, in which case it enters with its back face up.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Each face of a double-faced card has its own set of characteristics: name, types, subtypes, power and toughness, loyalty, abilities, and so on. While a double-faced card is on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of the face that’s currently up. The other set of characteristics is ignored. While a double-faced card isn’t on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down (this is also true if it’s put onto the battlefield face down some other way). Note that “face down” is not synonymous with “with its back face up.” A manifested double-faced card is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of a manifested double-faced card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced card on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a land becomes a creature but hasn’t continuously been under its controller’s control since that player’s most recent turn began, it won’t be able to attack and its abilities with {T} in the cost (including mana abilities) won’t be able to be activated. In other words, look at how long the permanent itself has been under your control, not how long it’s been a creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In some rare cases, a spell or ability may cause one of these five cards to transform while it’s a creature (front face up) on the battlefield. If this happens, the resulting planeswalker won’t have any loyalty counters on it and will subsequently be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Nissa, Vastwood Seer is exiled as a result of her second triggered ability. If she enters the battlefield while you control seven or more lands, she won’t automatically be exiled and transform.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card (in the case of Magic Origins, the planeswalker face) can’t be cast.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a double-faced card not on the battlefield is the converted mana cost of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can activate Nissa, Sage Animist’s second ability even if you already control an Ashaya, the Awoken World. Just after the second token is created, you’ll choose one to remain on the battlefield. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can activate one of the planeswalker’s loyalty abilities the turn it enters the battlefield. However, you may do so only during one of your main phases when the stack is empty. For example, if the planeswalker enters the battlefield during combat, there will be an opportunity for your opponent to remove it before you can activate one of its abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card doesn’t have a mana cost. A double-faced permanent with its back face up has a converted mana cost equal to the converted mana cost of its front face. Each back face has a color indicator that defines its color.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You can control two of this permanent, one front-face up and the other back-face up, at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A Magic Origins planeswalker that enters the battlefield because of the ability of its front face will enter with loyalty counters as normal.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A double-faced card enters the battlefield with its front face up by default, unless a spell or ability instructs you to put it onto the battlefield transformed, in which case it enters with its back face up.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Each face of a double-faced card has its own set of characteristics: name, types, subtypes, power and toughness, loyalty, abilities, and so on. While a double-faced card is on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of the face that’s currently up. The other set of characteristics is ignored. While a double-faced card isn’t on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down (this is also true if it’s put onto the battlefield face down some other way). Note that “face down” is not synonymous with “with its back face up.” A manifested double-faced card is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of a manifested double-faced card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced card on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If multiple nontoken creatures you control die, then Liliana, Heretical Healer’s ability will trigger that many times. However, since Liliana can be exiled and returned to the battlefield only once, only the first ability to resolve will create a Zombie token. The other abilities will resolve but won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In some rare cases, a spell or ability may cause one of these five cards to transform while it’s a creature (front face up) on the battlefield. If this happens, the resulting planeswalker won’t have any loyalty counters on it and will subsequently be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card (in the case of Magic Origins, the planeswalker face) can’t be cast.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a double-faced card not on the battlefield is the converted mana cost of its front face.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'When Liliana, Defiant Necromancer’s first ability resolves, first you choose a card to discard, then each other player in turn order chooses a card to discard, then all those cards are discarded simultaneously. No one sees what the other players are discarding before deciding which card to discard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can activate one of the planeswalker’s loyalty abilities the turn it enters the battlefield. However, you may do so only during one of your main phases when the stack is empty. For example, if the planeswalker enters the battlefield during combat, there will be an opportunity for your opponent to remove it before you can activate one of its abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The back face of a double-faced card doesn’t have a mana cost. A double-faced permanent with its back face up has a converted mana cost equal to the converted mana cost of its front face. Each back face has a color indicator that defines its color.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You can control two of this permanent, one front-face up and the other back-face up, at the same time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'A Magic Origins planeswalker that enters the battlefield because of the ability of its front face will enter with loyalty counters as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'A double-faced card enters the battlefield with its front face up by default, unless a spell or ability instructs you to put it onto the battlefield transformed, in which case it enters with its back face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Each face of a double-faced card has its own set of characteristics: name, types, subtypes, power and toughness, loyalty, abilities, and so on. While a double-faced card is on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of the face that’s currently up. The other set of characteristics is ignored. While a double-faced card isn’t on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of its front face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down (this is also true if it’s put onto the battlefield face down some other way). Note that “face down” is not synonymous with “with its back face up.” A manifested double-faced card is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of a manifested double-faced card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced card on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If you activate the second ability of Jace, Telepath Unbound, you must follow the timing rules for the card’s types. For example, if you target a sorcery card, you may cast it during your main phase when the stack is empty. You pay all the spell’s costs.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If you don’t cast the card that turn, nothing happens. It remains in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'In some rare cases, a spell or ability may cause one of these five cards to transform while it’s a creature (front face up) on the battlefield. If this happens, the resulting planeswalker won’t have any loyalty counters on it and will subsequently be put into its owner’s graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'The activated ability of Jace, Vryn’s Prodigy checks to see if there are five or more cards in your graveyard after you discard a card. Putting a fifth card into your graveyard at other times won’t cause Jace to be exiled, nor will Jace entering the battlefield while there are five or more cards in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'The back face of a double-faced card (in the case of Magic Origins, the planeswalker face) can’t be cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'The card is exiled only if it’s cast from the graveyard and put back into the graveyard (either by resolving or being countered). If, at any time, the card goes to a hidden zone (such as your hand or your library), the effect loses track of the card. It won’t be exiled, even if that card is put into your graveyard later that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'The converted mana cost of a double-faced card not on the battlefield is the converted mana cost of its front face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'You can activate one of the planeswalker’s loyalty abilities the turn it enters the battlefield. However, you may do so only during one of your main phases when the stack is empty. For example, if the planeswalker enters the battlefield during combat, there will be an opportunity for your opponent to remove it before you can activate one of its abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If you discard a card with madness while resolving the ability of Jace, Vryn’s Prodigy, you’ll need to already have five other cards in your graveyard to satisfy that ability’s condition. You can’t choose to put the card directly into your graveyard to satisfy it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The back face of a double-faced card doesn’t have a mana cost. A double-faced permanent with its back face up has a converted mana cost equal to the converted mana cost of its front face. Each back face has a color indicator that defines its color.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-17\', \'text\': "Jace, Vryn\'s Prodigy is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You can control two of this permanent, one front-face up and the other back-face up, at the same time.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the first ability returns an Aura card to the battlefield, you choose what that Aura will enchant as it enters the battlefield. If the Aura can’t legally enchant anything, it stays in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Note that if an Aura is returned to the battlefield this way, whatever the Aura enchants isn’t a target of Starfield of Nyx’s ability, nor is it a target of the Aura card itself. You could put an Aura onto the battlefield this way enchanting a creature with hexproof controlled by an opponent, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A single player must have cast two or more spells during the previous turn for Call of the Full Moon’s last ability to trigger. If multiple players each cast just one spell during that turn, the ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Call of the Full Moon’s last ability will look at the entire previous turn, even if Call of the Moon wasn’t on the battlefield for some or all of that turn. For example, if you cast Call of the Full Moon and another spell on the same turn, you’ll have to sacrifice Call of the Full Moon at the beginning of the upkeep of the following turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A token has converted mana cost 0 unless it’s a copy of something else, in which case it has the mana cost of whatever it’s copying.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a permanent has an {X} in its mana cost, that X is 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A token is owned by the player under whose control it entered the battlefield. Tokens shuffled into a library count toward the number of cards drawn, though they cease to exist upon becoming part of a library. Regardless of what you’re using to represent tokens, you won’t shuffle that physical object into your library.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'As The Great Aurora resolves, first you choose any number of land cards in your hand to put onto the battlefield, and then each other player in turn order does the same. The lands enter the battlefield simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a player is required to draw more cards than their library contains, that player loses the game. If all players lose the game this way, the game is a draw.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The number of cards you draw is equal to the number of permanents on the battlefield that you shuffle into your library plus the number of cards from your hand that you shuffle into your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts. The loyalty abilities of planeswalkers are activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Suppression Bonds can enchant any nonland permanent, not just a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Activating the last ability of Alchemist’s Vial targeting a creature that’s already attacking or blocking won’t cause that creature to stop attacking or blocking. It will prevent that creature from attacking or blocking in any additional combat phases the turn may have (although this is unusual).'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'After Hallowed Moonlight resolves, if a creature token would be put onto the battlefield, it’s put into exile instead and then ceases to exist. Creature tokens are never cast, even if the spell that created them was.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Hallowed Moonlight won’t affect any creature that was cast, no matter which zone it was cast from and whether or not its mana cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Alhammarret’s second ability happens as Alhammarret enters the battlefield. No one can cast spells or activate abilities between the time a card is named and the time that Alhammarret’s last ability starts to work.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Although spells with the chosen name can’t be cast, permanent cards with that name can still be put onto the battlefield by a spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If your opponents have no nonland cards in their hands, you can’t choose a card name. Alhammarret’s last ability won’t stop any spells from being cast in that case.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You choose one card name, not one name per opponent.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Your opponents can still cast a card with the chosen name face down if it has a morph ability. A card with the chosen name can also be manifested.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Although Bonded Construct can’t attack alone, other attacking creatures don’t have to attack the same player or planeswalker. For example, Bonded Construct could attack an opponent and another creature could attack a planeswalker that opponent controls.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Bonded Construct can be declared as an attacker only if another creature is declared as an attacker at the same time.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a creature that can’t attack alone also must attack if able, its controller must attack with it and another creature if able.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you control more than one creature that can’t attack alone, they can attack together, even if no other creatures attack.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game (or in another format using the shared team turns option), Bonded Construct can attack with a creature controlled by your teammate, even if no other creatures you control attack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "If another creature becomes or enters the battlefield as a copy of the token, that creature won\'t have haste and it won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "If the ability resolves during a turn\'s end step, the token will be exiled at the beginning of the next turn\'s end step."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else when the ability resolves, then the token enters the battlefield as a copy of whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "If the token isn\'t exiled at the beginning of the next end step (perhaps because the delayed triggered ability is countered), it remains on the battlefield indefinitely. It continues to have haste."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what\'s printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'The token is exiled at the beginning of the next end step regardless of who controls it at that time.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any red instant or sorcery spell you spend the mana on will be copied, not just one that requires targets.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a copy is created, you control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If more than one red mana produced by a Pyromancer’s Goggles is spent to cast a single red instant or sorcery spell, the delayed triggered ability associated with each mana spent will trigger. That many copies will be created. It doesn’t matter if this red mana was produced by one Pyromancer’s Goggles or by multiple Pyromancer’s Goggles.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one –” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copy says that it affects “you,” it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an “opponent,” it affects an opponent of the copy’s controller, not an opponent of the original spell’s controller.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The delayed triggered ability will trigger whether Pyromancer’s Goggles is still on the battlefield or not.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The mana produced by Pyromancer’s Goggles can be spent on anything, not just a red instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if you sacrifice a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause Soulblade Djinn’s ability to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause the ability to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause it to trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Soulblade Djinn’s ability goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, Mage-Ring Bully is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then Mage-Ring Bully doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If they don’t, Mage-Ring Bully doesn’t have to attack.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any “at the beginning of the next end step” triggered abilities won’t get the chance to trigger that turn because the end step is skipped. Those abilities will trigger at the beginning of the end step of the next turn. The same is true of abilities that trigger at the beginning of other phases or steps.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Ending the turn this way means the following things happen in order: 1) All spells and abilities on the stack are exiled. This includes spells and abilities that can’t be countered. 2) If there are any attacking and blocking creatures, they’re removed from combat. 3) State-based actions are checked. No player gets priority, and no triggered abilities are put onto the stack. 4) The current phase and/or step ends. The game skips straight to the cleanup step. 5) The cleanup step happens in its entirety.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If any triggered abilities do trigger during the process of ending the turn, they’re put onto the stack during the cleanup step. If this happens, players will have a chance to cast spells and activate abilities, then there will be another cleanup step before the turn ends.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If both your hand and graveyard are empty as Day’s Undoing starts resolving, you’ll still shuffle your library before drawing seven cards.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Though other spells and abilities that are exiled won’t get a chance to resolve, they don’t count as being countered.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If any abilities trigger while players are shuffling cards into their library or drawing seven cards, those abilities cease to exist when the turn ends. They won’t be put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Hixus’s ability causes a zone change with a duration, a style of ability that’s somewhat reminiscent of older cards like Oblivion Ring. However, unlike Oblivion Ring, cards like Hixus have a single ability that creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the creature when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after Hixus leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Hixus leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the creature that dealt combat damage to you won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Hixus’s owner leaves the game, the exiled cards will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the cards isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The exiled cards return to the battlefield immediately after Hixus leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Because Alhammarret’s Archive is legendary, it’s unlikely that one player will control two. However, if that happens, life gained by that player will be multiplied by four. Three Archives will multiply that life gain by eight, and so on.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If an effect would set your life total to a specific number that’s higher than your current life total, that effect would cause you to gain life equal to the difference. Alhammarret’s Archive will then double the amount of life that effect would cause you to gain. For example, if you have 3 life and an effect says that your life total “becomes 10,” your life total will actually become 17.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If two or more replacement effects would apply to a card-drawing event, the player drawing the card chooses the order in which to apply them.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, only the controller of Alhammarret’s Archive is affected by it. If that player’s teammate gains life, Alhammarret’s Archive will have no effect, even when that life gain is applied to the team’s shared life total.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Similarly, the effects of the last abilities of multiple Archives are cumulative. If you control two, you’ll draw four times the number of cards, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Blessed Spirits’s ability will resolve before the enchantment spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check the power of each creature as it would deal combat damage to determine if that damage is prevented. It doesn’t matter what any creature’s power is as Vine Snare resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Psychic Rebuttal creates a copy of the spell, you control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one –” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copy says that it affects “you,” it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an “opponent,” it affects an opponent of the copy’s controller, not an opponent of the original spell’s controller.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies, you’ll create a copy of the instant or sorcery spell only if Psychic Rebuttal counters that spell. If that spell can’t be countered by spells or abilities, you won’t get a copy.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The target instant or sorcery spell can have other targets as long as one of them is you.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if a player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies, you’ll cast the two cards in order. The one you cast last will be the one that resolves first.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you can’t cast any instant or sorcery cards (perhaps because there are no legal targets available) or if you choose not to cast one, then Talent of the Telepath finishes resolving. Any of the revealed cards you didn’t cast will be put into that player’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The cards will be put into their owner’s graveyard after they resolve, not yours.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You cast the instant and/or sorcery card(s) from your opponent’s library as Talent of the Telepath is resolving. Ignore timing restrictions based on the card’s type. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this card] only during combat,” must be followed.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the creature becomes an illegal target by the time Ravaging Blaze tries to resolve, Ravaging Blaze won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt to the creature or its controller.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Ravaging Blaze targets only the creature. It doesn’t target any player, even if the spell mastery ability applies.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies and a creature affected by Send to Sleep changes controllers before its old controller’s next untap step, Send to Sleep will prevent it from becoming untapped during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you chose two targets and one is an illegal target when Send to Sleep resolves, that creature won’t become tapped and it won’t be stopped from untapping during its controller’s next untap step (if the spell mastery ability applies). It won’t be affected by Send to Sleep in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Send to Sleep can target tapped creatures. If a targeted creature is already tapped when the spell resolves (and the spell mastery ability applies), that creature remains tapped and doesn’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies, and you find three basic Forest cards, one of them will be put onto the battlefield tapped and two of them will be put into your hand.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you only find one basic Forest card, you’ll put it onto the battlefield tapped. You won’t be able to put it into your hand, even if you want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies, the four Knight tokens will also gain indestructible until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies, you untap only the lands put onto the battlefield with Animist’s Awakening.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you have X or less cards in your library, you’ll reveal all the cards from your library, put all land cards from among them onto the battlefield tapped, and then put the rest of the cards back in your library in a random order. (This is effectively the same as shuffling your library, although it’s still not technically a shuffle.)'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'No player will know the order of the cards put on the bottom of your library. Practically speaking, the cards should be shuffled (although this is not the game action of “shuffling”).'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies, you’ll scry 2 even if the controller of the spell pays {3}.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In one unusual situation, you can cast Calculated Dismissal targeting an instant or sorcery spell you control while there is one instant or sorcery card in your graveyard. In this situation, if you decline to pay {3}, the spell will be countered and put into your graveyard. The spell mastery ability will then apply and you’ll scry 2.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You draw a card as Dark Dabbling resolves, not as the creature actually regenerates.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Dark Dabbling is still on the stack while you count the number of instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard. It doesn’t count itself.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Dark Dabbling’s spell mastery ability is a normal spell effect, not a replacement effect. This means that if you replace drawing a card for Dark Dabbling’s effect with dredging a card from your graveyard, the cards put into your graveyard this way may enable the additional regeneration.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Dark Dabbling tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card and no creatures are regenerated.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast Swift Reckoning from your graveyard, you need two other instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard to cast it as though it had flash.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The number of instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard matters only as you begin to cast Swift Reckoning. Once it’s cast, that number doesn’t matter and will have no effect on Swift Reckoning resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Exquisite Firecraft. When that spell or ability resolves, Exquisite Firecraft won’t be countered if its spell mastery ability applies, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Claustrophobia can target and enchant a tapped or untapped creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The enchanted creature can still be untapped in other ways. Claustrophobia will remain attached, and the creature will continue to not untap during its controller’s untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Colorless is not a color, so putting two colorless cards into a graveyard won’t cause the process to repeat.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The process will keep repeating as long as both cards share a color and neither is a land card.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Count the number of artifacts you control as Reclusive Artificer’s triggered ability resolves to determine how much damage it deals.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you are the only player who controls a creature when Reclusive Artificer’s second ability triggers, you must choose one of those creatures as the target, although you can choose to not deal it damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Count the number of attacking Elves you control as Dwynen’s last ability resolves to determine how much life to gain.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Count the number of creature cards in your graveyard as the ability resolves to determine how much life is lost. Notably, this could include any other creature you owned that died in combat, and perhaps even Graveblade Marauder itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Damage dealt to a creature with indestructible remains marked on that creature. If Erebos’s Titan has lethal damage marked on it and it loses indestructible (perhaps because your opponent controlled no creatures and then gained control of one), Erebos’s Titan will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, the last ability won’t trigger when a player with a creature card in their graveyard leaves the game.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The last ability triggers only if Erebos’s Titan is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Deep-Sea Terror’s ability only checks as attackers are declared. After Deep-Sea Terror legally attacks, reducing the number of cards in your graveyard won’t cause it to stop attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Effects setting Angel’s Tomb’s base power and toughness to specific values that begin to apply after Angel’s Tomb has become a creature will override the effect of Angel’s Tomb. For example, if an effect causes a 3/3 Angel’s Tomb to become 0/1, it will remain 0/1 until another effect (such as triggering the ability of Angel’s Tomb a second time or targeting it with Titanic Growth) causes those values to change.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Angel’s Tomb is already a creature when a creature enters the battlefield under your control, its ability will override any effects that set its base power and toughness to specific values, but other changes to its power and toughness (such as the one created by Titanic Growth) will still apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Embermaw Hellion’s last ability doesn’t cause Embermaw Hellion to deal damage; it affects the amount of damage dealt by the original red source.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the player or permanent being dealt damage is also affected by a damage prevention effect, that player or the controller of that permanent can apply that effect and Embermaw Hellion’s effect in any order. If all of the damage is prevented, Embermaw Hellion’s effect can’t apply to it.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Multiple Embermaw Hellions are cumulative. If you control two of them, you’ll add 2 to the damage dealt by another red source you control. In this case, you would also add 1 to the damage dealt by either Embermaw Hellion.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Having more than one Tainted Remedy on the battlefield doesn’t have any noticeable effect on life gain. Once the effect of one Tainted Remedy applies, there is no life gain for the others to apply to.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If more than one replacement effect tries to apply to a life gain event, the player who would gain life chooses the order in which they apply. For example, if a player who controls Alhammarret’s Archive would gain 3 life while Tainted Remedy is on the battlefield, that player may choose to have the 3 life become doubled to 6 life and then lose 6 life. The player may also choose to apply Tainted Remedy first, turning “gain 3 life” into “lose 3 life.” Alhammarret’s Archive would then not apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Herald of the Pantheon can reduce alternative costs such as bestow costs.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Herald of the Pantheon’s first ability can’t reduce the colored mana requirement of an enchantment spell.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast an enchantment spell, apply those before applying cost reductions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Guardian Automaton dies at the same time as your life total is reduced to 0 or less, you’ll lose the game before the triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Mizzium Meddler leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the targets remain unchanged.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Mizzium Meddler’s triggered ability targets a spell or ability with no targets, nothing happens.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a spell or ability has a variable number of targets, you can’t change the number of targets.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If changing one target of a spell or ability to Mizzium Meddler would make other targets of that spell or ability illegal, the targets remain unchanged.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell or ability has multiple instances of the word “target,” you choose which target you’re changing to Mizzium Meddler as Mizium Meddler’s ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Mizzium Meddler’s triggered ability can target a spell or ability even if Mizzium Meddler wouldn’t be a legal target for that spell or ability. However, the target of that spell or ability will remain unchanged.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The target of the spell or ability won’t change unless Mizzium Meddler fulfills all the targeting criteria. If a spell or ability has multiple targets, such as Send to Sleep, you can change only one of the targets to Mizzium Meddler.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If Willbreaker leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it, and its control-change effect ends.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Willbreaker, its control-change effect ends. Regaining control of Willbreaker won’t cause you to regain control of the creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you lose control of Willbreaker before its ability resolves, you won’t gain control of the creature at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If a creature with renown deals combat damage to its controller because that damage was redirected, renown will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'If a renown ability triggers, but the creature leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, the creature doesn\\\'t become renowned. Any ability that triggers "whenever a creature becomes renowned" won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Renown won\'t trigger when a creature deals combat damage to a planeswalker or another creature. It also won\'t trigger when a creature deals noncombat damage to a player."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a creature with renown deals combat damage to its controller because that damage was redirected, renown will trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a renown ability triggers, but the creature leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, the creature doesn’t become renowned. Any ability that triggers “whenever a creature becomes renowned” won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Once an attacking creature with menace is legally blocked by two or more creatures, removing one or more of those blockers from combat won’t change or undo that block.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Renown won’t trigger when a creature deals combat damage to a planeswalker or another creature. It also won’t trigger when a creature deals noncombat damage to a player.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a creature with renown deals combat damage to its controller because that damage was redirected, renown will trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a renown ability triggers, but the creature leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, the creature doesn’t become renowned. Any ability that triggers “whenever a creature becomes renowned” won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Renown won’t trigger when a creature deals combat damage to a planeswalker or another creature. It also won’t trigger when a creature deals noncombat damage to a player.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a permanent has more than one of the affected types, it can count for any of them. For example, you could choose an artifact creature as the artifact you’re sparing, another creature as the creature, and an enchantment creature as the enchantment. Similarly, you could choose an enchantment creature as both the creature and the enchantment that you’re sparing, even if the player controls another creature and/or another enchantment.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'None of the chosen permanents are targets of Tragic Arrogance.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Hangarback Walker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many Thopter tokens you get. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Hangarback Walker and it gets four -1/-1 counters, you’ll get three Thopter tokens. That’s because Hangarback Walker’s triggered ability checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The value of each X in Hangarback Walker’s mana cost must be equal. For example, if X is 2, you’ll pay {4} to cast Hangarback Walker and it will enter the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If multiple attacking creatures must be blocked if able, the defending player must assign at least one blocker to each of them if possible. For example, if two such creatures were attacking and there were two potential blockers, they couldn’t both be assigned to block the same attacker.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Joraga Invocation doesn’t force any specific creature to block any specific attacking creature. The defending player still chooses how creatures they control block.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the ability doesn’t resolve (either for having its target become illegal or because a spell or ability counters it), the mode chosen for that instance of the ability still counts as being chosen.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In some very unusual situations, you may not be able to choose a mode, either because all modes have previously been chosen or the only remaining modes require targets and there are no legal targets available. In this case, the ability is simply removed from the stack with no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter who has chosen any particular mode. For example, say you control Demonic Pact and have chosen the first two modes. If an opponent gains control of Demonic Pact, that player can choose only the third or fourth mode.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The phrase “that hasn’t been chosen” refers only to that specific Demonic Pact. If you control one and cast another one, you can choose any mode for the second one the first time its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Yes, if the fourth mode is the only one remaining, you must choose it. You read the whole contract, right?'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You choose the mode as the triggered ability goes on the stack. You can choose a mode that requires targets only if there are legal targets available.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the creature an opponent controls is an illegal target as Wild Instincts tries to resolve, but the creature you control is still a legal target, the creature you control will get +2/+2, but the creatures won’t fight. Neither creature will deal or be dealt damage during the resolution of Wild Instincts.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You must target both a creature you control and a creature an opponent controls to cast Wild Instincts.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the regeneration ability is activated before combat damage is dealt, the two creatures you sacrifice won’t deal combat damage. However, you must regenerate a creature before it would be destroyed, so if you wait for combat damage to be dealt, the enchanted creature may be destroyed by that damage before it has the chance to regenerate.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the top card of your library isn’t a creature card or it’s a creature card with power 0 or less, you won’t draw any cards. Otherwise, the first card you draw will be the card you revealed.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast an instant or sorcery spell, apply those before applying cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Jace’s Sanctum can reduce alternative costs such as miracle or overload costs.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Jace’s Sanctum’s scry ability will resolve before the instant or sorcery spell that caused it to trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The first ability of Jace’s Sanctum can’t reduce the colored mana requirement of an instant or sorcery spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you cast an Aura spell targeting a creature controlled by an opponent, you still control that Aura. It will count for Blood-Cursed Knight’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you cast an Aura spell targeting a permanent controlled by an opponent, you still control that Aura. It will count toward the bonus given by Helm of the Gods.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you control an untapped Archangel of Tithes, your opponents can choose to not attack with a creature that must attack if able. The same is true with respect to an attacking Archangel of Tithes and a creature that must block if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you control at least one artifact as Artificer’s Epiphany resolves, you can’t discard a card, even if you want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you don’t choose a nonland card for the player to discard, that player chooses which two cards they will discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, Ramroller is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then Ramroller doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If they don’t, Ramroller doesn’t have to attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, the enchanted creature is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then that creature doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If they don’t, the creature doesn’t have to attack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'No creature without flying will be able to block that turn, including creatures that lose flying after Seismic Elemental’s ability resolves and creatures without flying that enter the battlefield after that ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Once an attacking creature with menace is legally blocked by two or more creatures, removing one or more of those blockers from combat won’t change or undo that block.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Once you legally activate the last ability, it doesn’t matter how many creature cards are in your graveyard as it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Possessed Skaab’s last ability will apply no matter what caused it to die (lethal damage, being sacrificed, enough -1/-1 counters, and so on). Possessed Skaab won’t go to the graveyard. It will be put from the battlefield into exile. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature dies won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Separatist Voidmage’s ability can target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Smash to Smithereens targets only the artifact, not any player. If that artifact becomes an illegal target by the time Smash to Smithereens tries to resolve, Smash to Smithereens won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Somberwald Alpha’s first ability will give each creature you control that becomes blocked +1/+1 until end of turn. It doesn’t matter how many of your opponent’s creatures are blocking each of your creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The ability defining Zendikar Incarnate’s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield. Zendikar Incarnate’s power changes as the number of lands you control does.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The controller of the creature dealt damage by the target creature is the one who loses 2 life, not the controller of the target creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The creature must have power 3 or greater as it enters the battlefield, or Elemental Bond’s ability won’t trigger. Static abilities that raise (or lower) a creature’s power are taken into account. However, you can’t have a creature with power 2 or less enter the battlefield and try to raise its power with a spell, an activated ability, or a triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The damage prevention effects of multiple Orbs of Warding are cumulative.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The enchanted creature is the source of the triggered ability it gains, not Grasp of the Hieromancer. If the enchanted creature isn’t white, that ability can target a creature with protection from white, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The triggered ability granted to the enchanted creature will tap the creature before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The last ability triggers and resolves before blockers are declared. If the target creature is destroyed by the damage, it won’t be on the battlefield to block.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Throwing Knife is the source of the damage dealt because of its triggered ability. For example, you could sacrifice Throwing Knife to deal 2 damage to a creature with protection from red, even if Throwing Knife is equipped to a red creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Throwing Knife’s triggered ability triggers before blockers are declared. If you use the ability and destroy the targeted creature with lethal damage, it won’t be on the battlefield to block.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Nantuko Husk itself to activate its own ability. However, the only thing that will do is put Nantuko Husk into the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You may cast Hydrolash even if there aren’t any attacking creatures simply to draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Count the number of Elves you control as Shaman of the Pack’s ability resolves, including Shaman of the Pack if it’s still on the battlefield, to determine how much life is lost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Timberpack Wolf may become lethal if other Timberpack Wolves leave the battlefield during that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Enthralling Victor\'s ability can target a creature that\'s already untapped. You\'ll still gain control of it and it will gain haste."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Once Enthralling Victor\'s ability resolves and you gain control of a creature, raising its power above 2 won\'t cause you to lose control of it. Similarly, it doesn\'t matter if Enthralling Victor leaves the battlefield or you lose control of Enthralling Victor. You\'ll keep control of the creature that was the target of the ability until the end of the turn."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Giving a creature flying after it’s already been blocked won’t change or undo that block. If you want to affect what can block the creature, you must cast Mighty Leap during the declare attackers step at the latest.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Knightly Valor tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You need a creature for Knightly Valor to target as you cast it. There’s no way to have it enter the battlefield attached to the Knight token it’ll create.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have no other cards in hand, you’ll have to discard one of the creature cards you return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You may cast Macabre Waltz targeting one or zero creature cards. You’ll still discard a card, even if you target no creature cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A creature spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for Bone to Ash. The creature spell won’t be countered when Bone to Ash resolves, but you’ll still draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Count the number of Undead Servants in your graveyard as the ability resolves to determine how many tokens to put onto the battlefield. If Undead Servant dies in response to its own triggered ability and is in your graveyard as that ability resolves, it will count toward the number of Zombies you get.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Faerie Miscreant’s triggered ability checks to see if you control another creature named Faerie Miscreant at the time the new Faerie Miscreant enters the battlefield. If you don’t, the ability won’t trigger at all. The ability will check again as it tries to resolve. If, at that time, you don’t control another creature named Faerie Miscreant, the ability will have no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a creature the defending player controls can’t block Prized Unicorn for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t block Prized Unicorn. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature block Prized Unicorn, the defending player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to block.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If more than one Prized Unicorn is attacking, creatures that could block must block one Prized Unicorn, but they don’t all have to block the same Prized Unicorn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The ability affects each spell that\'s not a creature spell, including your own. Creature spells with another type, such as artifact creature spells, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases (such as that of Vryn Wingmare), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If Infernal Scarring and the enchanted creature are destroyed at the same time, the player will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'The player who controlled the creature when it died is the one who will draw a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Valor in Akros\'s ability affects only creatures you control at the time the ability resolves, including the creature that caused it to trigger. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +1/+1."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to an artifact creature you control may become lethal if Chief of the Foundry leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you target a creature you control with Might of the Masses, remember to count that creature when determining the amount of the bonus.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The size of the bonus is determined as Might of the Masses resolves; it won\'t change if the number of creatures you control changes later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "As Fleshbag Marauder\'s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature to sacrifice, then each other player in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all those creatures are sacrificed simultaneously."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "When its ability resolves, you may sacrifice Fleshbag Marauder itself. If you control no other creatures, you\'ll have to sacrifice Fleshbag Marauder."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Eyeblight Massacre affects only creatures that aren\'t Elves at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2, and creatures that become Elves or stop being Elves won\'t get or lose -2/-2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'As long as Revenant is in your graveyard, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Revenant is dealt lethal damage at the same time as another creature you control, both die at the same time. The other creature won\'t die in time to raise Revenant\'s toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Revenant\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal a creature card, you\'ll reveal all the cards from your library and then put them back in your library in a random order."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because it’s not on the battlefield yet, casting Sigil of the Empty Throne won’t cause its own ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Count the number of creatures named Cleric of the Forward Order you control as the ability resolves to determine how much life you gain. If the Cleric of the Forward Order with the ability that triggered is still on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Erebos\' Titan", \'text\': \'Solange deine Gegner keine Kreaturen kontrollieren, hat Erebos\\\' Titan Unzerstörbarkeit. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören ihn nicht.)Immer wenn eine Kreaturenkarte den Friedhof eines Gegners verlässt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, bringe Erebos\\\' Titan aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399415&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f9af154-139d-4071-8714-5227ae1b0a43\', \'multiverseId\': 399415}, \'multiverseid\': 399415}, {\'name\': \'Titán de Erebos\', \'text\': \'Mientras tus oponentes no controlen ninguna criatura, el Titán de Erebos tiene la habilidad de indestructible. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no lo destruyen.)Siempre que una carta de criatura deje el cementerio de un oponente, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, regresa el Titán de Erebos de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5271c704-fcee-49ef-9bd7-a3f1e4aa1337\', \'multiverseId\': 401354}, \'multiverseid\': 401354}, {\'name\': "Titan d\'Érébos", \'text\': "Tant que vos adversaires ne contrôlent pas de créature, le Titan d\'Érébos a l\'indestructible. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne le détruisent pas.)À chaque fois qu\'une carte de créature quitte le cimetière d\'un adversaire, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez le Titan d\'Érébos depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399692&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6f024c-70bc-4e8a-a017-e9edafe6ccbf\', \'multiverseId\': 399692}, \'multiverseid\': 399692}, {\'name\': \'Titano di Erebos\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che i tuoi avversari non controllano creature, il Titano di Erebos ha indistruttibile. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non lo distruggono.)Ogniqualvolta una carta creatura lascia il cimitero di un avversario, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano il Titano di Erebos dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68642bb3-edf6-4b13-a01d-e888362d9d44\', \'multiverseId\': 399969}, \'multiverseid\': 399969}, {\'name\': \'エレボスのタイタン\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がクリーチャーをコントロールしていない限り、エレボスのタイタンは破壊不能を持つ。（ダメージや「破壊する」と書かれた効果では、これは破壊されない。）対戦相手の墓地からクリーチャー・カードが１枚離れるたび、あなたはカードを１枚捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地にあるエレボスのタイタンをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb14770-d494-4b08-b986-84fd355d4c37\', \'multiverseId\': 400246}, \'multiverseid\': 400246}, {\'name\': \'에레보스의 거신\', \'text\': \'당신의 상대들이 생물을 조종하지 않는 한, 에레보스의 거신은 무적을 가진다. (피해 또는 "파괴"라고 써있는 효과에 의해 파괴당할 수 없다.)생물 카드가 상대의 무덤을 떠날 때마다, 당신은 카드 한 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 에레보스의 거신을 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea9c48b-72a0-4506-b9b5-aa0a7c0cb5d5\', \'multiverseId\': 400523}, \'multiverseid\': 400523}, {\'name\': \'Titã de Érebo\', \'text\': \'Enquanto seus oponentes não controlarem criaturas, Titã de Érebo terá indestrutível. (O dano e os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não a destroem.)Toda vez que um card de criatura deixar o cemitério de um oponente, você poderá descartar um card. Se fizer isso, devolva Titã de Érebo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727f15f9-7562-42bb-a9ef-ef310a41868b\', \'multiverseId\': 400800}, \'multiverseid\': 400800}, {\'name\': \'Титан Эреба\', \'text\': \'Пока у ваших оппонентов под контролем нет существ, Титан Эреба имеет Неразрушимость. (Повреждения и эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают его.)Каждый раз, когда карта существа покидает кладбище оппонента, вы можете сбросить карту. Если вы это делаете, верните Титана Эреба из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0ed4f18-2e01-4746-ba6b-c9c3c16a013d\', \'multiverseId\': 401077}, \'multiverseid\': 401077}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的泰坦\', \'text\': \'只要所有对手均未操控任何生物，厄睿柏斯的泰坦便具有不灭异能。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）每当一张生物牌离开对手的坟墓场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则将厄睿柏斯的泰坦从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be86b357-4363-451e-aef9-9fa5d65fb483\', \'multiverseId\': 398861}, \'multiverseid\': 398861}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的泰坦\', \'text\': \'只要所有對手均未操控任何生物，厄睿柏斯的泰坦便具有不滅異能。（傷害與註明「消滅」的效應不會將它消滅。)每當一張生物牌離開對手的墳墓場時，你可以棄一張牌。若你如此作，則將厄睿柏斯的泰坦從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90e4cdd-4f4c-4ad3-a850-b5c6d9bbd278\', \'multiverseId\': 399138}, \'multiverseid\': 399138}]', '[{\'name\': "Ketos\' Zauberbuch", \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein wahrer Autor widmet sein ganzes Leben der Schöpfung eines einzigen Buches, eines Meisterwerks, das so einzigartig ist wie sein Erschaffer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399361&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e42e79a-38a1-4a8f-b98e-ca3134c287ad\', \'multiverseId\': 399361}, \'multiverseid\': 399361}, {\'name\': \'Volumen de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un auténtico escriba dedica toda su vida a la creación de un único volumen, una obra maestra tan singular como su creador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69754964-57d6-474e-a56b-c3d0dfd25f20\', \'multiverseId\': 401300}, \'multiverseid\': 401300}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Un véritable scribe dédie sa vie entière à la création d\'un seul volume, un chef d\'œuvre aussi unique que son artiste.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399638&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'412ecdbd-7614-4eeb-86ab-cf093e641881\', \'multiverseId\': 399638}, \'multiverseid\': 399638}, {\'name\': \'Tomo di Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Un vero scrivano dedica l\'intera esistenza alla creazione di un unico volume, un capolavoro unico come il suo creatore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dffd6cd-bd87-4865-86f0-2a64f85c2e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 399915}, \'multiverseid\': 399915}, {\'name\': \'ジェイムデー秘本\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'真の写字官は生涯を一冊の書の完成に捧げる。それは生みの親に等しい独自性を持つ傑作である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76befcc3-006e-4635-8fa6-a85ddc1168c1\', \'multiverseId\': 400192}, \'multiverseid\': 400192}, {\'name\': \'야임디 고서\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'진정한 문인은 자신처럼 유일무이한 단 한 권의 걸작을 만들기 위해 일생을 바친다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92fa3ad9-6692-42dd-9519-09d8168a0a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 400469}, \'multiverseid\': 400469}, {\'name\': \'Livro de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Um verdadeiro escriba devota a vida inteira à criação de um único volume, uma obra-prima tão única quanto seu criador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d51665c5-7f6a-409c-b490-bb3f6d0e4a8f\', \'multiverseId\': 400746}, \'multiverseid\': 400746}, {\'name\': \'Том Джейэмди\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Истинный писец посвящает всю жизнь созданию одного фолианта — шедевра, такого же уникального, как и его создатель.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7473e50-0334-4e73-95e8-8f72be40a4bd\', \'multiverseId\': 401023}, \'multiverseid\': 401023}, {\'name\': \'神秘巨著\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'真正的誊写人将终生都奉献给了仅仅一部作品，与其创作者同样独一无二的巨著。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1faa3029-0554-4bf8-b72d-13e1435be67f\', \'multiverseId\': 398807}, \'multiverseid\': 398807}, {\'name\': \'神秘巨著\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'真正的謄寫人將終生都奉獻給了僅僅一部作品，與其創作者同樣獨一無二的巨著。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09838133-3ae4-4135-9ec4-fa7bb5b4c5ba\', \'multiverseId\': 399084}, \'multiverseid\': 399084}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Wind soll die Luft beherrschen."—Dejara, Druide aus dem Güldenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6d0bf0d-d218-4b78-9ad4-40b1f815fbaa\', \'multiverseId\': 401513}, \'multiverseid\': 401513}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que no haya nada en los cielos, salvo el viento".—Dejara, druida de Madera Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4534fc4a-6096-4fa3-b688-62f2dac74344\', \'multiverseId\': 401625}, \'multiverseid\': 401625}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Seul le vent doit contrôler les cieux. »—Dejara, druide de Boisdoré\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8d2a83-fc98-4a98-8367-c49215b1c707\', \'multiverseId\': 401529}, \'multiverseid\': 401529}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare che nulla possieda i cieli se non il vento."—Dejara, druida di Boscodorato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670471d4-1499-4025-bf42-8df6e6e28b8a\', \'multiverseId\': 401545}, \'multiverseid\': 401545}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「空にあるべきは風のみとしよう。」――黄金森のドルイド、デジャーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'884d749c-74ee-4e7a-b9ae-36c8fff882fc\', \'multiverseId\': 401561}, \'multiverseid\': 401561}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"바람 외에는 그 무엇도 하늘을 날지 못하게 하라."—금박숲 드루이드 데자라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9ed80d-7d43-4b49-bdc8-374f798947aa\', \'multiverseId\': 401577}, \'multiverseid\': 401577}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não deixe que nada além do vento domine o céu."— Dejara, druida de Bosque Dourado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3aab676-9455-464a-8a37-1a6313fb74ff\', \'multiverseId\': 401593}, \'multiverseid\': 401593}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть ничто не владеет небесами, кроме ветра».— Дежара, друид Золоченого Леса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'164def08-78b5-4a64-81f3-4afdb34dbaf6\', \'multiverseId\': 401609}, \'multiverseid\': 401609}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「风该是天空唯一的主人。」～金林德鲁伊笛贾拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3907f5ee-4ac7-4b47-96f4-bed7e85c4cda\', \'multiverseId\': 401481}, \'multiverseid\': 401481}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「風該是天空唯一的主人。」～金林德魯伊笛賈拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6eafc39-5d27-4950-82f6-443973c920be\', \'multiverseId\': 401497}, \'multiverseid\': 401497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abt des Keralberg-Klosters\', \'text\': \'Bravour (Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)Wenn der Abt des Keralberg-Klosters ins Spiel kommt, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du diese Karte spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399242&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65dd0e8c-54fd-4825-bfd9-d4ef26ee49fe\', \'multiverseId\': 399242}, \'multiverseid\': 399242}, {\'name\': \'Abad de la Fortaleza Keral\', \'text\': \'Destreza. (Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)Cuando el Abad de la Fortaleza Keral entre al campo de batalla, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80b19e94-db34-4d52-932a-bf0dd8840959\', \'multiverseId\': 401181}, \'multiverseid\': 401181}, {\'name\': \'Abbé de la Forteresse de Keral\', \'text\': "Prouesse (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)Quand l\'Abbé de la Forteresse de Keral arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9207f833-5f09-4af1-93c1-49317eac9bb5\', \'multiverseId\': 399519}, \'multiverseid\': 399519}, {\'name\': \'Abate del Torrione Keral\', \'text\': "Prodezza (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, questa creatura prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)Quando l\'Abate del Torrione Keral entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare quella carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad0a3c2-ff19-4c1d-9f13-6fa1ee55d6f7\', \'multiverseId\': 399796}, \'multiverseid\': 399796}, {\'name\': \'ケラル砦の修道院長\', \'text\': \'果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を１つ唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）ケラル砦の修道院長が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5025cfe-77aa-4905-ba5c-bb485f997d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 400073}, \'multiverseid\': 400073}, {\'name\': \'케랄 요새 수도원장\', \'text\': \'기량 (당신이 생물이 아닌 주문을 발동할 때마다, 이 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)케랄 요새 수도원장이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다. 턴종료까지, 당신은 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 승려\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'974389b0-3e4e-42e8-8b90-1d3485b49fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 400350}, \'multiverseid\': 400350}, {\'name\': \'Abade da Fortaleza Keral\', \'text\': \'Destreza (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica que não seja de criatura, esta criatura recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)Quando Abade da Fortaleza Keral entrar no campo de batalha, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você poderá jogar aquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fdecfe4-e84d-4cc5-8537-345c95467d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 400627}, \'multiverseid\': 400627}, {\'name\': \'Аббат Крепости Керал\', \'text\': \'Искусность (Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете не являющееся существом заклинание, это существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)Когда Аббат Крепости Керал выходит на поле битвы, изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть ту карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Монах\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1983bc0-6679-4423-b067-6124a1450fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 400904}, \'multiverseid\': 400904}, {\'name\': \'科瑞尔要塞僧长\', \'text\': \'灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）当科瑞尔要塞僧长进战场时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b736deb1-492e-4f0c-8d83-7579614fd243\', \'multiverseId\': 398688}, \'multiverseid\': 398688}, {\'name\': \'科瑞爾要塞僧長\', \'text\': \'靈技（每當你施放非生物咒語時，此生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）當科瑞爾要塞僧長進戰場時，放逐你的牌庫頂牌。直到回合結束，你可以使用該牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／修行僧\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2bb2b34-671f-4448-b9c1-b2ca6b08b665\', \'multiverseId\': 398965}, \'multiverseid\': 398965}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adler der Wache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)Wachsamkeit (Diese Kreatur wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst aus vielen Meilen Entfernung konnte ich sehen, wie unsere Adler am Himmel Kreise zogen. Da wusste ich, dass wir in der Heimat gebraucht werden."—Kanlos, akroischer Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'211c69c7-0cf6-4420-8d39-aea8c2e2d177\', \'multiverseId\': 401502}, \'multiverseid\': 401502}, {\'name\': \'Águila de la Guardia\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)Vigilancia. (Esta criatura no se gira al atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Vi a nuestras águilas volar en círculos a varios estadios de distancia. Así fue como supe que nos necesitaban en casa".—Kanlos, capitán akroniense\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6044e0c3-1371-495e-a601-db919077e11c\', \'multiverseId\': 401614}, \'multiverseid\': 401614}, {\'name\': \'Aigle des veilleurs\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)Vigilance (Attaquer avec cette créature ne la fait pas s\'engager.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "« Même à des lieues d\'ici, je pouvais voir nos aigles tournoyer. C\'est là que j\'ai su que notre cité avait besoin de nous. »—Kanlos, capitaine akroen", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401518&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'762c2998-bb5c-487b-bdae-91a3e8fdac81\', \'multiverseId\': 401518}, \'multiverseid\': 401518}, {\'name\': \'Aquila della Guardia\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)Cautela (Questa creatura attacca senza TAPpare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Anche a miglia di distanza, distinguevo le nostre aquile volare in cerchio. Fu allora che capii che la nostra patria aveva bisogno di noi."—Kanlos, capitano di Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a940f9cf-fa6d-4014-a670-be9cce1be047\', \'multiverseId\': 401534}, \'multiverseid\': 401534}, {\'name\': \'警備隊の鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。）警戒（このクリーチャーは攻撃してもタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「数マイル先からも、我々の鷲が円を描いている姿が見えた。故郷が我々を必要としていることを理解したからだ。」――アクロスの隊長、カンロス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522624f4-b99d-444a-a766-2b24785a150e\', \'multiverseId\': 401550}, \'multiverseid\': 401550}, {\'name\': \'경비대 독수리\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)경계 (이 생물은 공격하면서 탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': \'\\\'멀리서도 우리 독수리들이 선회하는 걸 볼 수 있었다. 그걸 보고 고향이 위험에 처했다는 걸 알았다."—아크로스 대장 칸로스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f71d672-6d1c-498e-93b6-fdb09bb3e76a\', \'multiverseId\': 401566}, \'multiverseid\': 401566}, {\'name\': \'Águia da Vigia\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)Vigilância (Atacar não faz com que esta criatura seja virada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Pude ver nossas águias circulando mesmo a quilômetros de distância. Foi quando eu soube que estavam precisando de nós em casa."— Kanlos, capitão acrosano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf28e34-7cfe-4ff7-bed2-7b6457afed48\', \'multiverseId\': 401582}, \'multiverseid\': 401582}, {\'name\': \'Сторожевой Орел\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)Бдительность (Атакуя, это существо не поворачивается.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'«Я еще издали заметил, как кружат наши орлы. Тогда я понял, что мы были нужны дома».— Канл, акросский капитан\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6373ada2-f713-409f-bf5d-bd6d278fdef9\', \'multiverseId\': 401598}, \'multiverseid\': 401598}, {\'name\': \'守望雄鹰\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）警戒（此生物攻击时不需横置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'「从数哩外，就看得到雄鹰在天空盘旋。我立即明白，家乡正需要我们。」～阿喀洛斯队长坎罗斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375bdb92-5419-41fb-ab71-da176e8b8d3e\', \'multiverseId\': 401470}, \'multiverseid\': 401470}, {\'name\': \'守望雄鷹\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）警戒（此生物攻擊時不需橫置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「從數哩外，就看得到雄鷹在天空盤旋。我立即明白，家鄉正需要我們。」～阿喀洛斯隊長坎羅斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92cef943-bbda-4d18-beac-da15dfb94072\', \'multiverseId\': 401486}, \'multiverseid\': 401486}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akroischer Feldwebel\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt Kampfschaden vor Kreaturen ohne Erstschlag zu.)Ruhm 1 (Wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und falls sie nicht ruhmvoll ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und sie wird ruhmvoll.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399435&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19036b3d-bcbe-43dc-961e-a49bf051b9c3\', \'multiverseId\': 399435}, \'multiverseid\': 399435}, {\'name\': \'Sargento akroniense\', \'text\': \'Daña primero. (Esta criatura hace daño de combate antes que las criaturas sin la habilidad de dañar primero.)Prestigio 1. (Cuando esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, si no tiene prestigio, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y gana prestigio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3853dbe-3ffd-46ac-9366-acac573806b5\', \'multiverseId\': 401374}, \'multiverseid\': 401374}, {\'name\': \'Sergent akroen\', \'text\': "Initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat avant les créatures sans l\'initiative.)Réputation 1 (Quand cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, si elle n\'est pas réputée, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient réputée.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b235eeef-cd02-447a-823a-a037ae48427f\', \'multiverseId\': 399712}, \'multiverseid\': 399712}, {\'name\': \'Sergente di Akros\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso (Questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento prima delle creature senza attacco improvviso.)Rinomare 1 (Quando questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, se non è rinomata, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e diventa rinomata.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ebe1667-b155-4fd3-8e9c-8cf63311c048\', \'multiverseId\': 399989}, \'multiverseid\': 399989}, {\'name\': \'アクロスの兵長\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃（このクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持たないクリーチャーよりも先に戦闘ダメージを与える。）高名１（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これが高名でない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これは高名になる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a5da43a-96c5-43a4-8d8e-b15cf82b9356\', \'multiverseId\': 400266}, \'multiverseid\': 400266}, {\'name\': \'아크로스 부사관\', \'text\': \'선제공격 (이 생물은 선제공격이 없는 생물보다 먼저 전투피해를 입힌다.)명성 1 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때, 이 생물에 명성이 없다면 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 이 생물은 명성을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd910b84-03c7-40a9-aaae-f156a72672c6\', \'multiverseId\': 400543}, \'multiverseid\': 400543}, {\'name\': \'Sargento Acrosano\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa (Esta criatura causa dano de combate antes das criaturas sem iniciativa.)Renome 1 (Quando esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, se ela não for renomada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará renomada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b426fffd-05ef-4ff8-b27a-cea6528cf068\', \'multiverseId\': 400820}, \'multiverseid\': 400820}, {\'name\': \'Акросский Сержант\', \'text\': \'Первый удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения раньше существ без Первого удара.)Прославленность 1 (Когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, если оно не прославлено, положите на него один жетон +1/+1, и оно становится прославленным.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738bad95-e80c-420a-a384-d9111a309c43\', \'multiverseId\': 401097}, \'multiverseid\': 401097}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯士官\', \'text\': \'先攻（此生物会比不具先攻异能的生物提前造成战斗伤害。）铭勇1（当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若它未铭勇，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它已铭勇。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719e5411-5281-4b42-a061-8d2f958c63f8\', \'multiverseId\': 398881}, \'multiverseid\': 398881}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯士官\', \'text\': \'先攻（此生物會比不具先攻異能的生物提前造成戰鬥傷害。）銘勇1（當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，若它未銘勇，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物且它已銘勇。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9486412-49a7-4515-80da-4b15a6a9cabc\', \'multiverseId\': 399158}, \'multiverseid\': 399158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akroischer Kerkermeister\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Er sorgt dafür, dass es bei einem Fluchtversuch genau dabei bleibt — dem Versuch.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399487&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40682ba1-1071-4a6e-af8b-a46bc1d79247\', \'multiverseId\': 399487}, \'multiverseid\': 399487}, {\'name\': \'Carcelero akroniense\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Se asegura de que los intentos de fuga sean solo eso: intentos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b07739-65bd-4b7d-908a-ee99303aa5fa\', \'multiverseId\': 401426}, \'multiverseid\': 401426}, {\'name\': \'Gardien de prison akroen\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T} : Engagez la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Son rôle, c\'est d\'assurer que les tentatives d\'évasion n\'aboutissent jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399764&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bdfb5fd-487f-475e-96a1-9734c5367d68\', \'multiverseId\': 399764}, \'multiverseid\': 399764}, {\'name\': \'Carceriere di Akros\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Assicura che i tentativi di fuga rimangano tali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'927c22e7-9a7f-4762-a097-09b6e0ef34cf\', \'multiverseId\': 400041}, \'multiverseid\': 400041}, {\'name\': \'アクロスの看守\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'彼は脱走計画が単なる計画で終わることを確実にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bea425-aaf0-4684-929d-733b8e8b4d88\', \'multiverseId\': 400318}, \'multiverseid\': 400318}, {\'name\': \'아크로스 간수\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'그는 죄수들의 탈출 시도를 말 그대로 시도에서 그치게 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fb3cf5-4a02-4025-b201-97c77d4d284f\', \'multiverseId\': 400595}, \'multiverseid\': 400595}, {\'name\': \'Carcereiro Acrosano\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: Vire a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Ele garante que as tentativas de fuga sejam apenas tentativas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc15210-1e92-450f-bc36-b6ef2a8884f3\', \'multiverseId\': 400872}, \'multiverseid\': 400872}, {\'name\': \'Акросский Тюремщик\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: поверните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Он следит за тем, чтобы попытки бегства оставались попытками.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7d86720-e72f-4d57-b9ad-530e931b8a42\', \'multiverseId\': 401149}, \'multiverseid\': 401149}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯狱卒\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}，{T}：横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'他的职责是让尝试逃狱的人仅止于尝试。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcbde9b0-835a-4454-aba5-0a54469c6e82\', \'multiverseId\': 398933}, \'multiverseid\': 398933}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯獄卒\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}，{T}：橫置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'他的職責是讓嘗試逃獄的人僅止於嘗試。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ccebec-4686-4989-a88d-daad8358c0b6\', \'multiverseId\': 399210}, \'multiverseid\': 399210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alhammarret, Hoher Schlichter\', \'text\': \'FliegendSowie Alhammarret, Hoher Schlichter, ins Spiel kommt, zeigt jeder Gegner die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst den Namen einer auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karte, die kein Land ist.Deine Gegner können keine Zaubersprüche mit dem bestimmten Namen wirken (solange diese Kreatur im Spiel ist).\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14528b72-7d8f-4d18-b851-30b2225069c7\', \'multiverseId\': 399267}, \'multiverseid\': 399267}, {\'name\': \'Alhammarret, árbitro supremo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Cuando Alhammarret, árbitro supremo entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente muestra su mano. Eliges el nombre de una carta que no sea tierra mostrada de esta manera.Tus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos con el nombre elegido (mientras esta criatura esté en el campo de batalla).\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d641a49-fd2b-4c35-8e38-d273d296a250\', \'multiverseId\': 401206}, \'multiverseid\': 401206}, {\'name\': \'Alhammarret, grand arbitre\', \'text\': "VolAu moment où Alhammarret, grand arbitre arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire révèle sa main. Vous choisissez le nom d\'une carte non-terrain révélée de cette manière.Vos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts du nom choisi (tant que cette créature est sur le champ de bataille).", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b7f1d7-8398-4033-bf27-367ea2a8fea2\', \'multiverseId\': 399544}, \'multiverseid\': 399544}, {\'name\': \'Alhammarret, Sommo Giudice\', \'text\': \'VolareMentre Alhammarret, Sommo Giudice entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario rivela la propria mano. Scegli il nome di una carta non terra rivelata in questo modo.I tuoi avversari non possono lanciare magie con il nome scelto (fintanto che questa creatura è sul campo di battaglia).\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'957b9be5-8829-494f-92b0-7687304c2a28\', \'multiverseId\': 399821}, \'multiverseid\': 399821}, {\'name\': \'高位調停者、アルハマレット\', \'text\': \'飛行高位調停者、アルハマレットが戦場に出るに際し、各対戦相手はそれぞれ自分の手札を公開する。あなたはこれにより公開された土地でないカードの名前を１つ選ぶ。（このクリーチャーが戦場に出ているかぎり）あなたの対戦相手は選ばれた名前を持つカードを唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66fd003e-f80f-47f6-9e9e-5d067b058bb5\', \'multiverseId\': 400098}, \'multiverseid\': 400098}, {\'name\': \'재판장 알함마렛\', \'text\': \'비행재판장 알함마렛이 전장에 들어올 때, 각 상대는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 당신은 이렇게 공개된 카드 중 대지가 아닌 카드의 이름을 선택한다.당신의 상대들은 선택한 이름의 주문을 발동할 수 없다(이 생물이 전장에 있는 동안에만 적용된다).\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 스핑크스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48caad66-504c-4083-8266-dc27e931cf7f\', \'multiverseId\': 400375}, \'multiverseid\': 400375}, {\'name\': \'Alhammarret, Juiz Supremo\', \'text\': \'VoarConforme Alhammarret, Juiz Supremo, entra no campo de batalha, cada oponente revela a própria mão. Você escolhe o nome de um card que não seja terreno revelado desta forma.Seus oponentes não podem conjurar mágicas com o nome escolhido (enquanto esta criatura estiver no campo de batalha).\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02281523-a049-4d72-b724-e06c9830c2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 400652}, \'multiverseid\': 400652}, {\'name\': \'Альхаммарет, Верховный Судья\', \'text\': \'ПолетПри выходе Альхаммарета, Верховного Судьи на поле битвы каждый оппонент показывает свою руку. Вы выбираете имя не являющейся землей карты, показанной таким образом.Ваши оппоненты не могут разыгрывать заклинания с выбранным именем (пока это существо находится на поле битвы).\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5b661c7-012c-4e2a-a72f-119689cf82c9\', \'multiverseId\': 400929}, \'multiverseid\': 400929}, {\'name\': \'高等仲裁者阿哈玛瑞特\', \'text\': \'飞行于高等仲裁者阿哈玛瑞特进战场时，每位对手各展示其手牌。你选择一个以此法展示之非地牌的名称。所有对手都不能施放具该名称的咒语。（只要此生物在战场上，对手就不能如此作。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caa92497-878f-498b-86d5-5129760bccb3\', \'multiverseId\': 398713}, \'multiverseid\': 398713}, {\'name\': \'高等仲裁者阿哈瑪瑞特\', \'text\': \'飛行於高等仲裁者阿哈瑪瑞特進戰場時，每位對手各展示其手牌。你選擇一個以此法展示之非地牌的名稱。所有對手都不能施放具該名稱的咒語（只要此生物在戰場上，對手就不能如此作）。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d64c4d-ae94-4277-9981-fcf7cca737c9\', \'multiverseId\': 398990}, \'multiverseid\': 398990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alhammarrets Archiv\', \'text\': \'Falls du Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten würdest, erhältst du stattdessen doppelt so viele Lebenspunkte dazu.Falls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, abgesehen von der ersten, die du in jedem deiner Ziehsegmente ziehst, ziehe stattdessen zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es enthält die Gesamtheit aller Notizen, Theorien und Erwägungen von Alhammarret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8647ff7d-1893-4f9e-b632-3cf35f5ec0c4\', \'multiverseId\': 399395}, \'multiverseid\': 399395}, {\'name\': \'Archivo de Alhammarret\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a ganar vidas, en vez de eso, ganas el doble de esas vidas.Si fueras a robar una carta, excepto la primera que robas en tus pasos de robar, en vez de eso, roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Contiene las notas, teorías y reflexiones de Alhammarret en su totalidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f606f803-e229-49c7-a72f-0fa3b45e95c2\', \'multiverseId\': 401334}, \'multiverseid\': 401334}, {\'name\': "Archives d\'Alhammarret", \'text\': \'Si vous deviez gagner des points de vie, vous gagnez deux fois ce nombre de points de vie à la place.Si vous deviez piocher une carte, excepté la première que vous piochez pendant chacune de vos étapes de pioche, piochez deux cartes à la place.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Elles contiennent la totalité des notes, des théories et des réflexions d\'Alhammaret.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf76f49b-2750-4bf0-ab29-41346cb63c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 399672}, \'multiverseid\': 399672}, {\'name\': \'Archivio di Alhammarret\', \'text\': \'Se stai per guadagnare punti vita, ne guadagni invece il doppio.Se stai per pescare una carta, tranne la prima che peschi in ognuna delle tue sottofasi di acquisizione, pesca invece due carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Custodisce ogni singolo appunto, teoria e riflessione di Alhammarret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7866c51b-c2b1-45a3-8934-edbfa6b1ca90\', \'multiverseId\': 399949}, \'multiverseid\': 399949}, {\'name\': \'アルハマレットの書庫\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るなら、代わりにあなたはその２倍の点数のライフを得る。あなたが自分の各ドロー・ステップで引く１枚目のカード以外にカードを１枚引くなら、代わりにカードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それにはアルハマレットのメモや理論、そして考えのすべてが収められている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4df1c3b8-0404-469a-ad5a-aad4c91ac854\', \'multiverseId\': 400226}, \'multiverseid\': 400226}, {\'name\': \'알함마렛의 기록보관소\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻으려고 하면, 대신에 그 두 배만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.당신이 당신의 각 뽑기단에 뽑는 첫 카드 이외에 카드를 한 장 뽑는다면, 대신에 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'기록보관소에는 알함마렛의 모든 메모, 이론과 생각이 보관되어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85cfa72f-48b6-471d-bbec-df37376bc5ac\', \'multiverseId\': 400503}, \'multiverseid\': 400503}, {\'name\': \'Arquivo de Alhammarret\', \'text\': \'Se você for ganhar pontos de vida, em vez disso, ganhará o dobro daquela quantidade em pontos de vida.Se você for comprar um card além do primeiro que você compra em cada uma das suas etapas de compra, em vez disso, compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Ele contém todas as anotações, teorias e reflexões de Alhammarret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd96e2c2-46f5-4007-9d68-d99fb1673c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 400780}, \'multiverseid\': 400780}, {\'name\': \'Архив Альхаммарета\', \'text\': \'Если вы должны получить определенное количество жизней, вы получаете их вдвое больше вместо этого.Если вы должны взять карту помимо первой карты, которую вы берете в каждом вашем шаге взятия карты, вместо этого возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Полное собрание заметок, теорий и размышлений Альхаммарета.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a8b48ba-8173-4a08-b65c-dcfdce591e05\', \'multiverseId\': 401057}, \'multiverseid\': 401057}, {\'name\': \'阿哈玛瑞特的档案库\', \'text\': \'如果你将获得生命，则改为你获得该数量两倍的生命。如果你将抓一张牌，且这不是你于自己的每个抓牌步骤中所抓的第一张牌，则改为抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'它包含阿哈玛瑞特全部的笔记、理论和思考。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb23f94f-d145-4324-ac37-e576e3c7f42e\', \'multiverseId\': 398841}, \'multiverseid\': 398841}, {\'name\': \'阿哈瑪瑞特的檔案庫\', \'text\': \'如果你將獲得生命，則改為你獲得該數量兩倍的生命。如果你將抽一張牌，且這不是你於自己的每個抽牌步驟中所抽的第一張牌，則改為抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'它包含阿哈瑪瑞特全部的筆記、理論與思考。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3330eb77-a493-4330-be92-ed9fe997923c\', \'multiverseId\': 399118}, \'multiverseid\': 399118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ampryn-Taktiker\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ampryn-Taktiker ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist alles bloß ein Spiel. Man sollte nicht allzu sehr an einzelnen Spielsteinen hängen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399434&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83e5ab58-165a-47c2-8f64-d3d86ebcf9e7\', \'multiverseId\': 399434}, \'multiverseid\': 399434}, {\'name\': \'Estratega amprynio\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Estratega amprynio entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No es más que un juego. No hay que tomarles demasiado apego a las piezas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e84bb95b-229f-4353-93d4-df154db072f2\', \'multiverseId\': 401373}, \'multiverseid\': 401373}, {\'name\': \'Tacticien ampryn\', \'text\': "Quand le Tacticien ampryn arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est qu\'un jeu. Vous ne devriez pas vous attacher aux pions. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399711&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d827e92-d652-4bdf-b787-be929e852bb5\', \'multiverseId\': 399711}, \'multiverseid\': 399711}, {\'name\': \'Stratega di Ampryn\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Stratega di Ampryn entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"È tutto un gioco. L\\\'importante è non affezionarsi troppo alle pedine."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94be60a-92f8-4584-997c-d1d9727aa7a1\', \'multiverseId\': 399988}, \'multiverseid\': 399988}, {\'name\': \'アンプリンの戦術家\', \'text\': \'アンプリンの戦術家が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「これは単なるゲームだ。駒に愛着を持ちすぎてはならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a453b73d-1d96-41bf-9ff0-7c3e41de5575\', \'multiverseId\': 400265}, \'multiverseid\': 400265}, {\'name\': \'앰프린 전술가\', \'text\': \'앰프린 전술가가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"이건 다 게임일 뿐이야. 말 하나하나에 너무 집착하지 마."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edab9f9c-bf6d-4e2f-a4c3-196044c17a56\', \'multiverseId\': 400542}, \'multiverseid\': 400542}, {\'name\': \'Estrategista Ampryn\', \'text\': \'Quando Estrategista Ampryn entra no campo de batalha, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Tudo é apenas um jogo. Você não deveria se apegar às peças."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8862efe2-bd0f-42f9-aaf4-2b272dadc4ea\', \'multiverseId\': 400819}, \'multiverseid\': 400819}, {\'name\': \'Ампринский Тактик\', \'text\': \'Когда Ампринский Тактик выходит на поле битвы, существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Все это — лишь игра. Не стоит слишком привязываться к фигурам».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16823007-0dd2-4960-8d1c-b9a1f670fe33\', \'multiverseId\': 401096}, \'multiverseid\': 401096}, {\'name\': \'安普林策士\', \'text\': \'当安普林策士进战场时，由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「这只是场棋局，别对棋子动感情。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2210c03e-89af-439d-955e-94545d5c1a84\', \'multiverseId\': 398880}, \'multiverseid\': 398880}, {\'name\': \'安普林策士\', \'text\': \'當安普林策士進戰場時，由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「這只是場棋局，別對棋子動感情。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4bdb2e-ca53-4ea7-bbf4-847bab33c0cc\', \'multiverseId\': 399157}, \'multiverseid\': 399157}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffslustiger Greif\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)Immer wenn der Angriffslustige Greif angreift, erhält er +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'Vier Klauen, zwei Schwingen, ein Schnabel, keine Furcht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf1d6b9-79d0-4235-b127-2e7f2c35c2dd\', \'multiverseId\': 399391}, \'multiverseid\': 399391}, {\'name\': \'Grifo a la carga\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)Siempre que el Grifo a la carga ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuatro garras, dos alas, un pico y nada de miedo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7bcc9d-8e1a-4f9e-9510-201f2c7ace2a\', \'multiverseId\': 401330}, \'multiverseid\': 401330}, {\'name\': \'Griffon chargeur\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)À chaque fois que le Griffon chargeur attaque, il gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : griffon\', \'flavor\': \'Quatre serres, deux ailes, un bec, zéro peur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399668&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eaf00be-794b-4c97-a4cf-9275ca6ed86f\', \'multiverseId\': 399668}, \'multiverseid\': 399668}, {\'name\': \'Grifone alla Carica\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)Ogniqualvolta il Grifone alla Carica attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'Quattro artigli, due ali, un becco, nessuna paura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ce018c-8da6-41e2-a8fb-78fe8e1ddc87\', \'multiverseId\': 399945}, \'multiverseid\': 399945}, {\'name\': \'突進するグリフィン\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）突進するグリフィンが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'爪は四つ、翼は二つ、嘴は一つ、躊躇は無し。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b78928d-edca-4241-9c7e-229d27de0e4a\', \'multiverseId\': 400222}, \'multiverseid\': 400222}, {\'name\': \'돌격하는 그리핀\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)돌격하는 그리핀이 공격할 때마다, 돌격하는 그리핀은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그리핀\', \'flavor\': \'네 개의 발톱, 두 개의 날개, 한 개의 부리, 두려움은 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff30bdb-b44e-4d95-ab8b-4e6a4a5d40ab\', \'multiverseId\': 400499}, \'multiverseid\': 400499}, {\'name\': \'Grifo Atacante\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)Toda vez que Grifo Atacante ataca, ele recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Quatro garras, duas asas, um bico, nenhum medo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc62ae8-cf01-4ebc-8f1a-5633fbf96640\', \'multiverseId\': 400776}, \'multiverseid\': 400776}, {\'name\': \'Нападающий Грифон\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)Каждый раз, когда Нападающий Грифон атакует, он получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Грифон\', \'flavor\': \'Четыре когтя, два крыла, один клюв и полное отсутствие страха.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39a2c1a2-889c-4d48-b6ed-8c5a849e4c78\', \'multiverseId\': 401053}, \'multiverseid\': 401053}, {\'name\': \'冲锋狮鹫\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）每当冲锋狮鹫攻击时，它得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～狮鹫\', \'flavor\': \'四爪，双翼，一个尖喙，无所畏惧。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf409ee-aee9-4626-8506-45c085884186\', \'multiverseId\': 398837}, \'multiverseid\': 398837}, {\'name\': \'衝鋒獅鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）每當衝鋒獅鷲攻擊時，它得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～獅鷲\', \'flavor\': \'四爪，雙翼，一個尖喙，無所畏懼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc78d4c-fe64-4589-ab19-be21da0545cb\', \'multiverseId\': 399114}, \'multiverseid\': 399114}]', "[{'name': 'Ansteckender Blutdurst', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine KreaturDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+1, hat Eile und greift in jedem Zug an, falls möglich.Wenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Ansteckender Blutdurst durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399413&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1093208-dfbe-4e3d-8513-5c991aa2d4f1', 'multiverseId': 399413}, 'multiverseid': 399413}, {'name': 'Sed de sangre contagiosa', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.La criatura encantada obtiene +2/+1, tiene la habilidad de prisa y ataca cada turno si puede.Cuando la criatura encantada muera, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Sed de sangre contagiosa, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401352&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '333b57d6-5fed-432f-9b11-c92eadfd6fd7', 'multiverseId': 401352}, 'multiverseid': 401352}, {'name': 'Soif de sang infectieuse', 'text': 'Enchanter : créatureLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+1, a la célérité et attaque à chaque tour si possible.Quand la créature enchantée meurt, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte appelée Soif de sang infectieuse, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399690&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30057d93-074c-4fb4-bb7d-87410099a72d', 'multiverseId': 399690}, 'multiverseid': 399690}, {'name': 'Sete di Sangue Contagiosa', 'text': 'Incanta creaturaLa creatura incantata prende +2/+1, ha rapidità e attacca ogni turno, se può farlo.Quando la creatura incantata muore, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Sete di Sangue Contagiosa, rivelarla, aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399967&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2db90b5-513a-44b3-8806-b582a71d9d33', 'multiverseId': 399967}, 'multiverseid': 399967}, {'name': '伝染性渇血症', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）エンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受けるとともに速攻を持つ。毎ターンそれは可能なら攻撃する。エンチャントされているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから「伝染性渇血症」という名前のカードを１枚探してもよい、そうしたなら、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400244&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4df10b78-7336-4c2b-b51b-d417d7eb7608', 'multiverseId': 400244}, 'multiverseid': 400244}, {'name': '전염되는 광기', 'text': '생물에 부여부여된 생물은 +2/+1을 받고, 신속을 가지며, 가능하면 매 턴마다 공격한다.부여된 생물이 죽을 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 이름이 전염되는 광기인 카드를 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 그러고 나서 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400521&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '686cb1e7-4287-417e-b21a-adffcb0e4034', 'multiverseId': 400521}, 'multiverseid': 400521}, {'name': 'Sede de Sangue Infecciosa', 'text': 'Encantar criaturaA criatura encantada recebe +2/+1, tem ímpeto e ataca a cada turno se estiver apta.Quando a criatura encantada morrer, você poderá procurar em seu grimório um card com o nome de Sede de Sangue Infecciosa, revelá-lo, colocá-lo em sua mão e, depois, embaralhar seu grimório.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400798&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31590b32-3b97-461e-b739-19948b407ff8', 'multiverseId': 400798}, 'multiverseid': 400798}, {'name': 'Заразная Кровожадность', 'text': 'Зачаровать существоЗачарованное существо получает +2/+1, имеет Ускорение и атакует в каждом ходу, если может.Когда зачарованное существо умирает, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Заразная Кровожадность, показать ее, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401075&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ae08afc-da1c-4f15-b50c-91fbe7bbd683', 'multiverseId': 401075}, 'multiverseid': 401075}, {'name': '流布嗜血欲', 'text': '结附于生物所结附的生物得+2/+1，具有敏捷异能，且每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。当所结附的生物死去时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张名称为流布嗜血欲的牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398859&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d5daa93-fb55-429c-94d3-576ee1e1902b', 'multiverseId': 398859}, 'multiverseid': 398859}, {'name': '流佈嗜血慾', 'text': '結附於生物所結附的生物得+2/+1，具有敏捷異能，且每回合若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。當所結附的生物死去時，你可以從你牌庫中搜尋一張名稱為流佈嗜血慾的牌，展示該牌，將之置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399136&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5276e2ad-465e-4b04-89ed-d3ce21a88f8d', 'multiverseId': 399136}, 'multiverseid': 399136}]", "[{'name': 'Auf Wolken wandeln', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine KreaturWenn Auf Wolken wandeln ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.Die verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit. (Sie kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)Die verzauberte Kreatur kann nur fliegende Kreaturen blocken.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399380&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cce3ce5-3aa3-41e9-989d-4ed1dfdb00c5', 'multiverseId': 399380}, 'multiverseid': 399380}, {'name': 'Levitación estratosférica', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.Cuando la Levitación estratosférica entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.La criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de volar. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)La criatura encantada solo puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401319&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cedaebcc-8aa8-4334-af07-7ec4913caefe', 'multiverseId': 401319}, 'multiverseid': 401319}, {'name': 'Tour de stratus', 'text': 'Enchanter : créatureQuand le Tour de stratus arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.La créature enchantée a le vol. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)La créature enchantée ne peut bloquer que les créatures avec le vol.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399657&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6a57d97-c804-4d2a-a8b8-4cdd0220fd46', 'multiverseId': 399657}, 'multiverseid': 399657}, {'name': 'Camminare sui Nembi', 'text': 'Incanta creaturaQuando Camminare sui Nembi entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.La creatura incantata ha volare. (Non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)La creatura incantata può bloccare solo creature con volare.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399934&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9584097b-f091-4e5e-a0c0-af46614f37c4', 'multiverseId': 399934}, 'multiverseid': 399934}, {'name': '層雲歩み', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）層雲歩みが戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。エンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。（それは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）エンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーのみをブロックできる。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400211&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '305d8ebe-cb8f-49fb-87df-d8c7088862fb', 'multiverseId': 400211}, 'multiverseid': 400211}, {'name': '구름 걷기', 'text': '생물에 부여구름 걷기가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.부여된 생물은 비행을 가진다. (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)부여된 생물은 비행을 가진 생물만 방어할 수 있다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400488&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '856ecfca-0d1f-483f-b8e1-c9f719d4c30d', 'multiverseId': 400488}, 'multiverseid': 400488}, {'name': 'Caminhar nos Estratos', 'text': 'Encantar criaturaQuando Caminhar nos Estratos entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.A criatura encantada tem voar. (Ela só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)A criatura encantada só pode bloquear criaturas com voar.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400765&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c23e9ae-5c98-4d94-ac54-2317a8cf02af', 'multiverseId': 400765}, 'multiverseid': 400765}, {'name': 'Прогулка по Облакам', 'text': 'Зачаровать существоКогда Прогулка по Облакам выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.Зачарованное существо имеет Полет. (Оно может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)Зачарованное существо может блокировать только существа с Полетом.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401042&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '843fd45c-4ac2-46f0-b889-a9564e037fb3', 'multiverseId': 401042}, 'multiverseid': 401042}, {'name': '漫步云端', 'text': '结附于生物当漫步云端进战场时，抓一张牌。所结附的生物具有飞行异能。（它只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）所结附的生物只能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398826&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '243e2f84-715f-41bf-9d89-885ff2c5b356', 'multiverseId': 398826}, 'multiverseid': 398826}, {'name': '漫步雲端', 'text': '結附於生物當漫步雲端進戰場時，抽一張牌。所結附的生物具有飛行異能。（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）所結附的生物只能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399103&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e4ab6e7-4828-4b1d-9225-77ffe3b8b108', 'multiverseId': 399103}, 'multiverseid': 399103}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufstrebender Aeronaut\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)Wenn der Aufstrebende Aeronaut ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399505&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0e8fc55-a920-453a-9934-7ee21f41bab3\', \'multiverseId\': 399505}, \'multiverseid\': 399505}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante a aeronauta\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)Cuando el Aspirante a aeronauta entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7dd9416-7ad6-4ad0-abed-c756495f130b\', \'multiverseId\': 401444}, \'multiverseid\': 401444}, {\'name\': \'Aéronaute aspirant\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)Quand l\'Aéronaute aspirant arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c40bc7df-d37f-46ba-a202-1144bb93589c\', \'multiverseId\': 399782}, \'multiverseid\': 399782}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante Aeronauta\', \'text\': "Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)Quando l\'Aspirante Aeronauta entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea212485-e33d-41d3-b488-19369aa3b563\', \'multiverseId\': 400059}, \'multiverseid\': 400059}, {\'name\': \'飛空士志願者\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）飛空士志願者が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92f4168-143b-4226-aeaf-5b4dc566c4e7\', \'multiverseId\': 400336}, \'multiverseid\': 400336}, {\'name\': \'비행병 지망생\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)비행병 지망생이 전장에 들어올 때, 비행을 가진 1/1 무색 날틀 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d072c6d2-52b1-4190-a19c-998de28a7ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 400613}, \'multiverseid\': 400613}, {\'name\': \'Aeronauta Aspirante\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)Quando Aeronauta Aspirante entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d72c1f50-a2d5-479f-9f9c-86f02f5a5d65\', \'multiverseId\': 400890}, \'multiverseid\': 400890}, {\'name\': \'Воспаривший Аэронавт\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)Когда Воспаривший Аэронавт выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43a9717-a701-4076-80ff-141da211090b\', \'multiverseId\': 401167}, \'multiverseid\': 401167}, {\'name\': \'雄心空行师\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）当雄心空行师进战场时，将一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'878726f2-1992-4276-a51e-e132fc0dc0a1\', \'multiverseId\': 398951}, \'multiverseid\': 398951}, {\'name\': \'雄心空行師\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）當雄心空行師進戰場時，將一個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e1f049-1ca1-4b31-915c-b50a1550e70e\', \'multiverseId\': 399228}, \'multiverseid\': 399228}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augenweh-Massaker\', \'text\': \'Nicht-Elf-Kreaturen erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe schon so viel Böses gesehen, so viel Dunkelheit. Warum beharrst du darauf, es zu mehren?"—Nissa Revane zu Dwynen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08aeb00a-e3bd-4d59-91c8-1bb7b8f54348\', \'multiverseId\': 399476}, \'multiverseid\': 399476}, {\'name\': \'Masacre de desgracias visuales\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que no sean Elfo obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya he visto demasiada maldad, demasiada oscuridad. ¿Por qué insistes en añadir aún más?".—Nissa Revane, a Dwynen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10021a40-7785-4119-ae07-2210fb16f771\', \'multiverseId\': 401415}, \'multiverseid\': 401415}, {\'name\': \'Massacre du dysmèle\', \'text\': "Les créatures non-Elfe gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y a déjà tant de mal, tant de ténèbres dans le monde. Pourquoi en rajouter ? »—Nissa Revane, à Dwynen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399753&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113c775d-d3a7-4c19-aca3-65e8abaf1b6f\', \'multiverseId\': 399753}, \'multiverseid\': 399753}, {\'name\': "Massacro di Mal\'Occhi", \'text\': \'Le creature non Elfo prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho visto così tanto male, così tanta oscurità. Perché vi ostinate a causarne ancora?"—Nissa Revane, a Dwynen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a027c4-2714-4267-aa5c-e2f8a19471e8\', \'multiverseId\': 400030}, \'multiverseid\': 400030}, {\'name\': \'眼腐りの虐殺\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、エルフでないクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私はこれまで、多くの邪悪と闇をこの目で見てきたわ。どうして、あんたはそれを増やすことに固執するのよ？」――ニッサ・レヴェインからドゥイネンへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fa2f567-8f5b-4864-a6c9-fee61b5bd7ce\', \'multiverseId\': 400307}, \'multiverseid\': 400307}, {\'name\': \'추물 학살\', \'text\': \'엘프가 아닌 생물들은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"세상은 이미 악과 어둠으로 가득하다. 왜 굳이 악과 어둠을 더하려고 하지?"—니사 레베인이 드위넨에게\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6685fc2a-2a81-4b0b-bc63-b92ecd7edaf8\', \'multiverseId\': 400584}, \'multiverseid\': 400584}, {\'name\': \'Massacre dos Seca-olho\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que não sejam do tipo Elfo recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu já vi tanto mal, tanta escuridão. Por que vocês insistem em adicionar mais?— Nissa Revane, para Dwynen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f489d50-2388-440a-b5dd-c4ea309d0e33\', \'multiverseId\': 400861}, \'multiverseid\': 400861}, {\'name\': \'Истребление Порчеглазов\', \'text\': \'Не являющиеся Эльфами существа получают -2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я уже видела так много тьмы, так много зла. Зачем ты его приумножаешь?» — Нисса Ревейн, обращаясь к Двайнен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba385938-e801-446d-a3e5-f1c846d07b58\', \'multiverseId\': 401138}, \'multiverseid\': 401138}, {\'name\': \'屠戮碍眼\', \'text\': \'非妖精的生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我看过太多邪恶与黑暗，你为什么还要添加一笔？」～妮莎瑞文怒斥德维恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64041fc6-f839-4be6-828b-ce79b1698530\', \'multiverseId\': 398922}, \'multiverseid\': 398922}, {\'name\': \'屠戮礙眼\', \'text\': \'非妖精的生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我看過太多邪惡與黑暗，妳為什麼還要添加一筆？」～妮莎瑞文怒斥德維恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d48fc856-a357-4b14-9a73-039a134d5774\', \'multiverseId\': 399199}, \'multiverseid\': 399199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augenweh-Meuchlerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Augenweh-Meuchlerin ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'„Boggart-Blut widert mich fast genauso an wie die stinkenden Kreaturen selbst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8abc5197-32af-414c-8d83-16090ad2fc34\', \'multiverseId\': 399366}, \'multiverseid\': 399366}, {\'name\': \'Asesina de desgracias visuales\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Asesina de desgracias visuales entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La sangre de boggart me da casi tanto asco como esas mismas criaturas hediondas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cd2a767-8975-468c-a533-083dfd7b8d00\', \'multiverseId\': 401305}, \'multiverseid\': 401305}, {\'name\': \'Assassin du dysmèle\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Assassin du dysmèle arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et assassin\', \'flavor\': \'« Le sang des boggarts me dégoûte presque autant que ces créatures fétides. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399643&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b666e693-8dbb-44d5-988b-439b714eae99\', \'multiverseId\': 399643}, \'multiverseid\': 399643}, {\'name\': "Assassina di Mal\'Occhi", \'text\': "Quando l\'Assassina di Mal\'Occhi entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il sangue dei boggart mi disgusta quasi quanto quelle ripugnanti creature."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee6711d4-4f45-4c5f-81e8-869182d9fdb0\', \'multiverseId\': 399920}, \'multiverseid\': 399920}, {\'name\': \'眼腐りの暗殺者\', \'text\': \'眼腐りの暗殺者が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'「クリーチャーとしても十分汚らわしいけれど、ボガートの血はそれ以上に汚らわしいものね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2081265d-97e7-4a29-9211-59f374b10dca\', \'multiverseId\': 400197}, \'multiverseid\': 400197}, {\'name\': \'추물 암살자\', \'text\': \'추물 암살자가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -1/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 암살자\', \'flavor\': \'"역겨운 보가트는 피조차도 구역질나는군."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d27aa7a-9578-4324-9abf-18cc62434ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 400474}, \'multiverseid\': 400474}, {\'name\': \'Assassino de Seca-olho\', \'text\': \'Quando Assassino de Seca-olho entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Assassino\', \'flavor\': \'"O sangue de papão me enoja quase tanto quanto as próprias criaturas imundas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a991178-cae7-4e18-b764-f4793780595b\', \'multiverseId\': 400751}, \'multiverseid\': 400751}, {\'name\': \'Убийца Порчеглазов\', \'text\': \'Когда Убийца Порчеглазов выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -1/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Убийца\', \'flavor\': \'«Кровь боггартов вызывает у меня почти такое же отвращение, как сами эти омерзительные твари».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c75ad61-d1af-4aad-8486-41bd98c789bf\', \'multiverseId\': 401028}, \'multiverseid\': 401028}, {\'name\': \'碍眼杀手\', \'text\': \'当碍眼杀手进战场时，目标由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'「波尬的鲜血就跟这些污秽生物本身一样令我厌恶。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d42dd013-e8f5-4dc8-874e-bcec8abb0daf\', \'multiverseId\': 398812}, \'multiverseid\': 398812}, {\'name\': \'礙眼殺手\', \'text\': \'當礙眼殺手進戰場時，目標由對手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／殺手\', \'flavor\': \'「波尬的鮮血就跟這些污穢生物本身一樣令我厭惡。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3228779c-ed53-4670-937a-144f73227b23\', \'multiverseId\': 399089}, \'multiverseid\': 399089}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auraschöpfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Auraschöpfer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„In unseren Erinnerungen finden wir die besten Stärkereserven."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e03a173d-c5be-4e46-94a5-0b3a1f3ec9e3\', \'multiverseId\': 399509}, \'multiverseid\': 399509}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Auramante entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"En los recuerdos podemos encontrar las mejores reservas de fuerza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'023c8411-7407-4c36-b849-1fffde99b2c2\', \'multiverseId\': 401448}, \'multiverseid\': 401448}, {\'name\': \'Auramancienne\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Auramancienne arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est dans les souvenirs que nous trouvons nos réserves de force les plus profondes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399786&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa23aa7-bc2d-4092-bc26-8ced3a4d8b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 399786}, \'multiverseid\': 399786}, {\'name\': \'Animago\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Animago entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nei ricordi, possiamo trovare le nostre più profonde riserve di forze."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a925238-bf45-411b-8468-543f54e0c8fb\', \'multiverseId\': 400063}, \'multiverseid\': 400063}, {\'name\': \'オーラ術師\', \'text\': \'オーラ術師が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは、それをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「最も深くに蓄えられている力は、記憶の中にあります。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee4fd79-3f05-4f81-8e4d-026402c10c97\', \'multiverseId\': 400340}, \'multiverseid\': 400340}, {\'name\': \'부여술사\', \'text\': \'부여술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 부여마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"인간의 가장 큰 힘은 기억에서 나온다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8e904e-2e62-40e1-a0f8-c979c526e555\', \'multiverseId\': 400617}, \'multiverseid\': 400617}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Quando Auramante entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o card de encantamento alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"É nas memórias que encontramos nossas reservas mais profundas de energia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522c3f2a-466c-415d-a7fb-02ba71680c65\', \'multiverseId\': 400894}, \'multiverseid\': 400894}, {\'name\': \'Ауромант\', \'text\': \'Когда Ауромант выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевую карту чар из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«В воспоминаниях можно найти глубочайшие запасы силы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb423fed-5676-468c-a474-a42da9b4552c\', \'multiverseId\': 401171}, \'multiverseid\': 401171}, {\'name\': \'灵气法师\', \'text\': \'当灵气法师进战场时，你可以将目标结界牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「在记忆中，我们能找到自己珍藏的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41bfc886-c4ca-4b6b-b742-ba85e942455c\', \'multiverseId\': 398955}, \'multiverseid\': 398955}, {\'name\': \'靈氣法師\', \'text\': \'當靈氣法師進戰場時，你可以將目標結界牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「在記憶中，我們能找到自己珍藏的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cfe7099-f327-4acd-a3dc-19df3589aa34\', \'multiverseId\': 399232}, \'multiverseid\': 399232}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus den Knochen lesen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte. (Betrachte für Hellsicht 2 die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Tod kennt ein paar Tricks, die die Lebenden noch nicht gelernt haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'958e404e-176b-4a50-9140-5b7614c78af9\', \'multiverseId\': 399468}, \'multiverseid\': 399468}, {\'name\': \'Lectura de huesos\', \'text\': \'Adivina 2, luego roba dos cartas. Pierdes 2 vidas. (Para adivinar 2, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los muertos saben lecciones que los vivos no han aprendido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce2e0ede-5e65-4889-af9a-18f2b325a2e1\', \'multiverseId\': 401407}, \'multiverseid\': 401407}, {\'name\': \'Lire dans les os\', \'text\': "Regard 2, puis piochez deux cartes. Vous perdez 2 points de vie. (Pour appliquer regard 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les morts connaissent les leçons que les vivants n\'ont jamais apprises.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edaf615d-d3b1-4148-90f4-b9a4d8b616ce\', \'multiverseId\': 399745}, \'multiverseid\': 399745}, {\'name\': \'Leggere le Ossa\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 2, poi pesca due carte. Perdi 2 punti vita. (Per profetizzare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I morti conoscono lezioni che i vivi non hanno ancora imparato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71fcf91e-f4c4-48af-840b-3859699d58de\', \'multiverseId\': 400022}, \'multiverseid\': 400022}, {\'name\': \'骨読み\', \'text\': \'占術２を行い、その後カードを２枚引く。あなたは２点のライフを失う。（占術２を行うには、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードを望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'死んだことでしか学べないこともある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb7533e-507b-4f3e-bcfa-aa7fb0354350\', \'multiverseId\': 400299}, \'multiverseid\': 400299}, {\'name\': \'뼈로 친 점\', \'text\': \'점술 2를 하고 카드 두 장을 뽑는다. 당신은 생명 2점을 잃는다. (점술 2를 하려면 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드들 중 원하는 만큼을 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고 나머지를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서대로 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'죽은 자만 알 수 있는 지식도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0295c832-7e50-44b8-b50c-4b32390686b3\', \'multiverseId\': 400576}, \'multiverseid\': 400576}, {\'name\': \'Leia os Ossos\', \'text\': \'Use vidência 2 e depois compre dois cards. Você perde 2 pontos de vida. (Para usar vidência 2, olhe os dois cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo do seu grimório e o restante no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os mortos conhecem lições que os vivos não aprenderam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5259009c-1d1b-45af-977c-911167917e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 400853}, \'multiverseid\': 400853}, {\'name\': \'Гадание по Костям\', \'text\': \'Предскажите 2, затем возьмите две карты. Вы теряете 2 жизни. (Чтобы предсказать 2, посмотрите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите любое количество из них в низ вашей библиотеки, а остальные на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Мертвые знают то, что неведомо живым.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d443c185-2d11-4a1e-84ee-cec14ae8c27a\', \'multiverseId\': 401130}, \'multiverseid\': 401130}, {\'name\': \'解读骨卦\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然后抓两张牌。你失去2点生命。（占卜2的流程是检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'逝者晓得生者尚未领悟的教训。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'224bb167-70a1-4b9d-86bd-f39cc80b893e\', \'multiverseId\': 398914}, \'multiverseid\': 398914}, {\'name\': \'解讀骨卦\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然後抽兩張牌。你失去2點生命。（占卜2的流程是檢視你牌庫頂的兩張牌，然後將其中任意數量的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫頂。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'逝者曉得生者尚未領悟的教訓。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08f648ff-6d13-4f8f-989e-509afa13ad65\', \'multiverseId\': 399191}, \'multiverseid\': 399191}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Kampfpriester\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)Wenn der Avior-Kampfpriester ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn der Schatten des Aviors auf das Schlachtfeld fällt, schöpfen die Soldaten neue Hoffnung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399458&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25fd8449-d579-4019-b708-59c255faf28d\', \'multiverseId\': 399458}, \'multiverseid\': 399458}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote guerrero aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)Cuando el Sacerdote guerrero aven entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo ave\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando la sombra de los aven cae sobre el campo de batalla, se eleva la esperanza en los corazones de los soldados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc47166c-a7c2-48f6-984d-7ec695a19330\', \'multiverseId\': 401397}, \'multiverseid\': 401397}, {\'name\': \'Prêtre de bataille avemain\', \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)Quand le Prêtre de bataille avemain arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Lorsque l\'ombre des avemains s\'abat sur le champ de bataille, l\'espoir monte dans le cœur des soldats.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2249daa6-a942-40b9-a3d1-b7c447fbca9b\', \'multiverseId\': 399735}, \'multiverseid\': 399735}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote Guerriero Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)Quando il Sacerdote Guerriero Aviano entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Uccello\', \'flavor\': "Quando l\'ombra degli aviani si profila sul campo di battaglia, nei cuori dei soldati rinasce la speranza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ccd4cb-eed5-459d-9316-518dc6a4cce1\', \'multiverseId\': 400012}, \'multiverseid\': 400012}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの戦僧侶\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）エイヴンの戦僧侶が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'エイヴンの影が戦場を覆うとき、兵士たちの心に希望が湧き出す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7933e89b-ea5d-4eb3-a0e4-ecc9648e700e\', \'multiverseId\': 400289}, \'multiverseid\': 400289}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 전투 사제\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)에이븐 전투 사제가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'에이븐의 그림자가 전장을 가로질러 떨어지면 병사들의 마음에 희망이 싹튼다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e7783aa-f61e-4b18-aa30-e848f9d9f458\', \'multiverseId\': 400566}, \'multiverseid\': 400566}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote de Batalha Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)Quando Sacerdote de Batalha Aviano entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a sombra dos avianos recai sobre o campo de batalha, a esperança renasce nos corações dos soldados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b61b3275-7fd0-48d8-8b59-2c38914ea916\', \'multiverseId\': 400843}, \'multiverseid\': 400843}, {\'name\': \'Боевой Жрец Авенов\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)Когда Боевой Жрец Авенов выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Когда на поле битвы падают тени авенов, в сердцах солдат пробуждается надежда.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dcc9d67-203d-4e5d-b87f-c9fe7308599e\', \'multiverseId\': 401120}, \'multiverseid\': 401120}, {\'name\': \'艾文战斗僧侣\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）当艾文战斗僧侣进战场时，你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'当艾文的影子空降战场时，士兵的心中燃起了希望。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6faa3722-92a5-4a7c-a721-ae6647804da5\', \'multiverseId\': 398904}, \'multiverseid\': 398904}, {\'name\': \'艾文戰鬥僧侶\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）當艾文戰鬥僧侶進戰場時，你獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'當艾文的影子空降戰場時，士兵的心中燃起了希望。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ad022d-7b4d-4673-a8d9-ca0586373d3f\', \'multiverseId\': 399181}, \'multiverseid\': 399181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balgwaran\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Der Balgwaran erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Preise für Holz und Kohlen stiegen, fanden die Schmiede kreative Lösungen, um ihr Schmiedefeuer in Gang zu halten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba999e9-198a-4795-b2fc-8a0513b91142\', \'multiverseId\': 399270}, \'multiverseid\': 399270}, {\'name\': \'Lagarto rugiente\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: El Lagarto rugiente obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme subía el precio de la madera y el carbón, los herreros encontraron formas creativas de mantener sus forjas ardiendo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eecffa29-05bb-4d9c-abcf-4fca39689681\', \'multiverseId\': 401209}, \'multiverseid\': 401209}, {\'name\': \'Lézard à soufflets\', \'text\': "{1}{R} : Le Lézard à soufflets gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': "Quand le prix du bois et du charbon s\'est mis à flamber, les forgerons ont trouvé des combustibles créatifs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8349600-93da-416d-aaaf-ae5ac92b0709\', \'multiverseId\': 399547}, \'multiverseid\': 399547}, {\'name\': \'Lucertola a Soffietto\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: La Lucertola a Soffietto prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': \'Con il crescere dei prezzi del legno e del carbone, i fabbri trovarono modi alternativi per mantenere accese le forge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f22c26c-e6ae-4d0a-903c-c472cf770ba8\', \'multiverseId\': 399824}, \'multiverseid\': 399824}, {\'name\': \'ふいごトカゲ\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、ふいごトカゲは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'木や石炭の価格が上昇したことで、鍛冶屋は創造的な手段を用いて工房の火を燃やし続けるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e57e336-8569-4e3c-8599-fdf5380efbf3\', \'multiverseId\': 400101}, \'multiverseid\': 400101}, {\'name\': \'풀무 도마뱀\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: 풀무 도마뱀은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'땔감과 석탄의 가격이 오르자 대장장이들은 대장간에 불을 계속 지필 수 있는 다른 방법을 찾았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29f1cb33-1f00-4718-8f6b-e39d607a6dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 400378}, \'multiverseid\': 400378}, {\'name\': \'Lagarto de Fole\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Lagarto de Fole recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme os preços da madeira e do carvão subiam, os ferreiros encontravam formas criativas de manter suas forjas ardendo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6ac350-671b-4c4c-ba79-b038ea43aab7\', \'multiverseId\': 400655}, \'multiverseid\': 400655}, {\'name\': \'Ящер Кузнечных Мехов\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Ящер Кузнечных Мехов получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'С ростом цен на древесину и уголь кузнецы стали находить другие способы поддерживать огонь в своих топках.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3ac54e0-e3a2-4f5c-b98d-de786eaa9c36\', \'multiverseId\': 400932}, \'multiverseid\': 400932}, {\'name\': \'嚎吼蜥蜴\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：嚎吼蜥蜴得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'由于木材和煤炭涨价，工匠找到了维持熔炉运作的创新方式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2146ef70-cc0b-4ba0-8953-cf77613e17e3\', \'multiverseId\': 398716}, \'multiverseid\': 398716}, {\'name\': \'嚎吼蜥蜴\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：嚎吼蜥蜴得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'由於木材和煤炭漲價，工匠找到了維持熔爐運作的創新方式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ccea48-0dfc-43dc-b379-81eadac50c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 398993}, \'multiverseid\': 398993}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behütender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)Wenn der Behütende Engel ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl solange Unzerstörbarkeit, wie du den Behütenden Engel kontrollierst. (Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht. Eine Kreatur mit Unzerstörbarkeit kann nicht von Schaden zerstört werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc1703d-1683-4d88-897c-a6cb69353232\', \'multiverseId\': 401500}, \'multiverseid\': 401500}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la égida\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)Cuando el Ángel de la égida entre al campo de batalla, otro permanente objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible mientras controles el Ángel de la égida. (Los efectos que dicen "destruye" no lo destruyen. Una criatura con la habilidad de indestructible no puede ser destruida por daño.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeefa67c-aa0d-45d0-a2ec-8a6b93a523d9\', \'multiverseId\': 401612}, \'multiverseid\': 401612}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'égide", \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)Quand l\'Ange de l\'égide arrive sur le champ de bataille, un autre permanent ciblé acquiert l\'indestructible tant que vous contrôlez l\'Ange de l\'égide. (Les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne détruisent pas ce permanent. Une créature avec l\'indestructible ne peut pas être détruite par des blessures.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401516&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa9e106-0872-43b1-9e42-3c561805fa70\', \'multiverseId\': 401516}, \'multiverseid\': 401516}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Egida", \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)Quando l\\\'Angelo dell\\\'Egida entra nel campo di battaglia, un altro permanente bersaglio ha indistruttibile fintanto che controlli l\\\'Angelo dell\\\'Egida. (Gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non lo distruggono. Una creatura con indistruttibile non può essere distrutta dal danno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f18d50a9-877f-48f9-b770-d704d435081f\', \'multiverseId\': 401532}, \'multiverseid\': 401532}, {\'name\': \'神盾の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。）神盾の天使が戦場に出たとき、他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたが神盾の天使をコントロールし続けているかぎり、それは破壊不能を得る。（「破壊する」効果では、それは破壊されない。破壊不能を持つクリーチャーはダメージによって破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61691ba-87ac-490d-8e17-b3ab4060b7f0\', \'multiverseId\': 401548}, \'multiverseid\': 401548}, {\'name\': \'보호의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)보호의 천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 다른 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물은 당신이 보호의 천사를 조종하는 한 무적을 얻는다. ("파괴"라고 명시된 효과로 파괴되지 않는다. 무적을 가진 생물은 피해를 입어 파괴될 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80414939-5959-4fad-b89c-a67a97790a0a\', \'multiverseId\': 401564}, \'multiverseid\': 401564}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Égide\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)Quando Anjo da Égide entrar no campo de batalha, outra permanente alvo ganhará indestrutível enquanto você controlar Anjo da Égide. (Os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não a destroem. Uma criatura com indestrutível não pode ser destruída por dano.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e50fbe69-5335-4475-b380-10ed45089976\', \'multiverseId\': 401580}, \'multiverseid\': 401580}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Эгиды\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)Когда Ангел Эгиды выходит на поле битвы, другой целевой перманент получает Неразрушимость, пока вы контролируете Ангела Эгиды. (Эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают его. Существо с Неразрушимостью нельзя уничтожить повреждениями.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91a98de5-95d5-46fe-8f6d-04a3c2754459\', \'multiverseId\': 401596}, \'multiverseid\': 401596}, {\'name\': \'庇护天使\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）当庇护天使进战场时，于你操控庇护天使的时段内，另一个目标永久物获得不灭异能。（注明「消灭」的效应不会消灭它。伤害无法消灭具不灭异能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb542756-289f-4e77-be7e-8f894dd7def1\', \'multiverseId\': 401468}, \'multiverseid\': 401468}, {\'name\': \'庇護天使\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）當庇護天使進戰場時，於你操控庇護天使的時段內，另一個目標永久物獲得不滅異能。（註明「消滅」的效應不會消滅它。傷害無法消滅具不滅異能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e02d44-e192-4abe-b906-07b2e6ff31d8\', \'multiverseId\': 401484}, \'multiverseid\': 401484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belehrung der Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, legt ein Gegner deiner Wahl die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek in seinen Friedhof. Falls beide Karten eine Farbe gemeinsam haben und keine Länderkarten sind, wiederhole diesen Vorgang.{5}{U}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast niemals die Konsequenzen bedacht, die eine Auseinandersetzung mit einem anderen Telepathen nach sich zieht, Jace."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beee59ad-e16f-48bb-b3ca-d7232dae5e67\', \'multiverseId\': 399351}, \'multiverseid\': 399351}, {\'name\': \'Tutela de la esfinge\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes una carta, el oponente objetivo pone las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio. Si ambas cartas no son de tierra y comparten un color, repite este proceso.{5}{U}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca has pensado en las implicaciones de vértelas con otro telépata, Jace".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e74286-a50b-4607-87b7-a60ca15d426d\', \'multiverseId\': 401290}, \'multiverseid\': 401290}, {\'name\': \'Tutelle du sphinx\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, l\'adversaire ciblé met les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière. Si ce sont deux cartes non-terrain qui partagent une couleur, répétez ce processus.{5}{U} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Tu n\'as jamais songé aux implications d\'une rencontre avec un autre télépathe, Jace. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399628&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bf9ce3d-0d92-42cd-9e6b-26abdc22d36c\', \'multiverseId\': 399628}, \'multiverseid\': 399628}, {\'name\': \'Tutela della Sfinge\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi una carta, un avversario bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero le prime due carte del suo grimorio. Se sono entrambe carte non terra che condividono un colore, ripeti questo procedimento.{5}{U}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non hai mai considerato le implicazioni di avere a che fare con un altro telepate, Jace."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63c5da3-b2d7-49c0-93ca-4eb17ea0e99f\', \'multiverseId\': 399905}, \'multiverseid\': 399905}, {\'name\': \'スフィンクスの後見\', \'text\': \'あなたがカードを１枚引くたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。それら２枚がともに土地でないカードであり共通の色を持つなら、この手順を繰り返す。{5}{U}：カードを１枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ジェイスよ、お前は別のテレパスを相手にすることが、どのような結果を引き起こすのか考えたことがあるまい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac77bb6f-676a-4e97-b553-3e1a828279cb\', \'multiverseId\': 400182}, \'multiverseid\': 400182}, {\'name\': \'스핑크스의 지도\', \'text\': \'당신이 카드를 뽑을 때마다, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다. 무덤에 넣은 카드가 모두 대지가 아니고 색을 공유한다면, 이 과정을 반복한다.{5}{U}: 카드 한 장을 뽑은 후 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"다른 정신술사를 상대하는 것이 어떤 결과를 초래할지 생각해본 적이 없겠지, 제이스."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d558130c-390a-49aa-95f4-84208aab319f\', \'multiverseId\': 400459}, \'multiverseid\': 400459}, {\'name\': \'Tutela da Esfinge\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você compra um card, o oponente alvo coloca os dois cards do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério. Se ambos forem cards que não sejam terrenos com uma cor em comum, repita o processo.{5}{U}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Você nunca pensou nas consequências de lidar com outro telepata, Jace."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'781e2c93-5774-4f40-bcdf-96ed39de0a62\', \'multiverseId\': 400736}, \'multiverseid\': 400736}, {\'name\': \'Наставничество Сфинкса\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы берете карту, целевой оппонент кладет две верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище. Если обе карты не являются землями и у них есть один и тот же цвет, повторите этот процесс.{5}{U}: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты никогда не задумывался о том, к каким последствиям может привести конфликт с другим телепатом, Джейс».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca980ba3-9668-4e4f-a686-9f8948d7f2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 401013}, \'multiverseid\': 401013}, {\'name\': \'史芬斯的指导\', \'text\': \'每当你抓一张牌时，目标对手将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。若这两张牌都为非地牌，且两者之间具共通的颜色，则重复此流程。{5}{U}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「杰斯，你从没想过对抗其他读心者会有什么后果。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48360652-6f2f-4a9e-b678-5509fb914cba\', \'multiverseId\': 398797}, \'multiverseid\': 398797}, {\'name\': \'史芬斯的指導\', \'text\': \'每當你抽一張牌时，目標對手將其牌庫頂的兩張牌置入其墳墓場。若這兩張牌都為非地牌，且兩者之間具共通的顏色，則重複此流程。{5}{U}：抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「傑斯，你從沒想過對抗其他讀心者會有什麼後果。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff44dd4e-e181-4990-b197-db00310e5254\', \'multiverseId\': 399074}, \'multiverseid\': 399074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berserkerin aus dem Schorf-Clan\', \'text\': \'EileRuhm 1 (Wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und falls sie nicht ruhmvoll ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und sie wird ruhmvoll.)Immer wenn ein Gegner einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkt und falls die Berserkerin aus dem Schorf-Clan ruhmvoll ist, fügt sie diesem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2d62f58-50be-4327-a08c-febcefc5ef6e\', \'multiverseId\': 399292}, \'multiverseid\': 399292}, {\'name\': \'Berserker del clan Scab\', \'text\': \'Prisa.Prestigio 1. (Cuando esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, si no tiene prestigio, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y gana prestigio.)Siempre que un oponente lance un hechizo que no sea de criatura, si la Berserker del clan Scab tiene prestigio, la Berserker del clan Scab hace 2 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32be8699-ef19-4f32-88e2-70a5ae03d284\', \'multiverseId\': 401231}, \'multiverseid\': 401231}, {\'name\': \'Berserker du clan Psora\', \'text\': "CéléritéRéputation 1 (Quand cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, si elle n\'est pas réputée, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient réputée.)À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort non-créature, si la Berserker du clan Psora est réputée, la Berserker du clan Psora inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399569&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7114ec32-d9ea-4a44-a4b0-787d916f2e05\', \'multiverseId\': 399569}, \'multiverseid\': 399569}, {\'name\': \'Berserker del Clan Scab\', \'text\': \'RapiditàRinomare 1 (Quando questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, se non è rinomata, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e diventa rinomata.)Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia non creatura, se la Berserker del Clan Scab è rinomata, la Berserker del Clan Scab infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f67064b-68aa-4546-a661-c4462c3e529c\', \'multiverseId\': 399846}, \'multiverseid\': 399846}, {\'name\': \'瘡蓋族の狂戦士\', \'text\': \'速攻高名１（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これが高名でない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これは高名になる。）対戦相手がクリーチャーでない呪文を１つ唱えるたび、瘡蓋族の狂戦士が高名である場合、瘡蓋族の狂戦士はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'962b81de-180d-4942-b8ec-6fba8979f736\', \'multiverseId\': 400123}, \'multiverseid\': 400123}, {\'name\': \'딱지 부족 광전사\', \'text\': \'신속명성 1 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때, 이 생물에 명성이 없다면 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 이 생물은 명성을 얻는다.)상대가 생물이 아닌 주문을 발동할 때마다, 딱지 부족 광전사에 명성이 있다면, 딱지 부족 광전사는 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 광전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24420a15-8394-4f3d-a048-e26a7d92f988\', \'multiverseId\': 400400}, \'multiverseid\': 400400}, {\'name\': \'Amoque do Clã Scab\', \'text\': \'Ímpet{R}enome 1 (Quando esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, se ela não for renomada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará renomada.)Toda vez que um oponente conjura uma mágica que não seja de criatura, se Amoque do Clã Scab for renomado, Amoque do Clã Scab causa 2 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Amoque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b76886-4daf-4f18-a943-38e6e5771e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 400677}, \'multiverseid\': 400677}, {\'name\': \'Берсерк из Клана Скаб\', \'text\': \'УскорениеПрославленность 1 (Когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, если оно не прославлено, положите на него один жетон +1/+1, и оно становится прославленным.)Каждый раз, когда оппонент разыгрывает не являющееся существом заклинание, если Берсерк из Клана Скаб прославлен, он наносит 2 повреждения тому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Берсерк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bdd2824-9615-431c-9ae4-05023ce8e114\', \'multiverseId\': 400954}, \'multiverseid\': 400954}, {\'name\': \'司凯族狂战士\', \'text\': \'敏捷铭勇1（当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若它未铭勇，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它已铭勇。）每当任一对手施放非生物咒语时，若司凯族狂战士已铭勇，则司凯族狂战士对该牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狂战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d588ac3-6e88-4da7-9637-99529771e15f\', \'multiverseId\': 398738}, \'multiverseid\': 398738}, {\'name\': \'司凱族狂戰士\', \'text\': \'敏捷銘勇1（當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，若它未銘勇，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物且它已銘勇。）每當任一對手施放非生物咒語時，若司凱族狂戰士已銘勇，則司凱族狂戰士對該玩家造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae7594e2-16a4-4d18-81c2-553216282f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 399015}, \'multiverseid\': 399015}]', '[{\'name\': \'Besessener Skaab\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Besessene Skaab ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Spontanzauber-, Hexerei- oder Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.Falls der Besessene Skaab sterben würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Der Versuch eines Leichenflickers, einem Skaab eine Seele zu verleihen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399488&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4ff841d-84c9-40fb-b09a-0ad349d8ed22\', \'multiverseId\': 399488}, \'multiverseid\': 399488}, {\'name\': \'Skaab poseído\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Skaab poseído entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de instantáneo, de conjuro o de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.Si el Skaab poseído fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'El intento de un suturador por crear un skaab con alma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d46497d0-95fe-4932-8a27-5a211e12b96f\', \'multiverseId\': 401427}, \'multiverseid\': 401427}, {\'name\': \'Skaab possédé\', \'text\': "Quand le Skaab possédé arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère, de rituel ou de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.Si le Skaab possédé devait mourir, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'La tentative par un raccommodeur de créer un skaab avec une âme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea6c33d0-b3c1-4524-b5ae-4132824a6c85\', \'multiverseId\': 399765}, \'multiverseid\': 399765}, {\'name\': \'Skaab Posseduto\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Skaab Posseduto entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano dal tuo cimitero una carta istantaneo, stregoneria o creatura bersaglio.Se lo Skaab Posseduto sta per morire, invece esilialo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Il tentativo di un cucitore di creare uno skaab con un\'anima.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1191065-4d06-4580-b35c-de526ab8dfc0\', \'multiverseId\': 400042}, \'multiverseid\': 400042}, {\'name\': \'取り憑かれたスカーブ\', \'text\': \'取り憑かれたスカーブが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー・カード１枚かクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。取り憑かれたスカーブが死亡するなら、代わりにこれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'魂を持ったスカーブを作ろうとした縫い師の試み。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'270f94a3-e18b-496c-acce-8069a3fc9441\', \'multiverseId\': 400319}, \'multiverseid\': 400319}, {\'name\': \'귀신들린 스캅\', \'text\': \'귀신들린 스캅이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법, 집중마법 또는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.귀신들린 스캅이 죽으려 한다면, 대신에 귀신들린 스캅을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'이 녀석은 스캅에 영혼을 가두려 했던 봉합술사의 실험 결과이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099589a0-796b-48a3-811d-34cb4a28adf5\', \'multiverseId\': 400596}, \'multiverseid\': 400596}, {\'name\': \'Skaab Possuído\', \'text\': \'Quando Skaab Possuído entrar no campo de batalha, devolva o card de mágica instantânea, feitiço ou criatura alvo de seu cemitério para a sua mão.Se Skaab Possuído for morrer, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Uma tentativa remendada de skaab com alma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f87e13e-4aa8-4967-8587-65cfeba0d5ef\', \'multiverseId\': 400873}, \'multiverseid\': 400873}, {\'name\': \'Одержимый Скааб\', \'text\': \'Когда Одержимый Скааб выходит на поле битвы, верните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания, волшебства или существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.Если Одержимый Скааб должен умереть, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Сшиватель попытался создать скааба, обладающего душой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c14ca0-a620-482e-9c8e-b2209760ff11\', \'multiverseId\': 401150}, \'multiverseid\': 401150}, {\'name\': \'着魔尸嵌\', \'text\': \'当着魔尸嵌进战场时，将目标瞬间，法术或生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。如果着魔尸嵌将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'拼接师尝试替尸嵌拼接灵魂的成果。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c314ad96-f138-4ea2-a6ac-d5e6c98245e5\', \'multiverseId\': 398934}, \'multiverseid\': 398934}, {\'name\': \'著魔屍嵌\', \'text\': \'當著魔屍嵌進戰場時，將目標瞬間，巫術或生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。如果著魔屍嵌將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'拼接師嘗試替屍嵌拼接靈魂的成果。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98296cfa-ea36-429d-a57e-1c23079ef3d7\', \'multiverseId\': 399211}, \'multiverseid\': 399211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzspeer\', \'text\': \'Der Blitzspeer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Harpyien stürzten gnadenlos auf Akros herab, nur um festzustellen, dass ihr Angriff sie in die Reichweite der Speerwerfer gebracht hatte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20772bc4-e6d0-4dfe-b307-75106e85ce77\', \'multiverseId\': 399369}, \'multiverseid\': 399369}, {\'name\': \'Jabalina relampagueante\', \'text\': \'La Jabalina relampagueante hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las arpías descendieron sin piedad sobre Akros solo para descubrir que su ataque las puso al alcance de los jabalineros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eaf619e-7fe5-45d0-9fdd-b75524e34dc8\', \'multiverseId\': 401308}, \'multiverseid\': 401308}, {\'name\': "Javelot d\'éclair", \'text\': "Le Javelot d\'éclair inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur. Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les harpies fondirent sans pitié sur Akros, mais leur attaque les mirent à portée des javeliniers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399646&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff389070-5144-463a-a16d-4497da4b2ded\', \'multiverseId\': 399646}, \'multiverseid\': 399646}, {\'name\': \'Giavellotto Fulminante\', \'text\': \'Il Giavellotto Fulminante infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio. Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le arpie si avventarono senza pietà su Akros, ma il loro attacco non fece altro che avvicinarle al raggio di tiro dei giavellottieri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9930370c-1ebe-48cf-8071-d5353b590ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 399923}, \'multiverseid\': 399923}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の投槍\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。稲妻の投槍はそれに３点のダメージを与える。占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ハーピーたちは無慈悲にアクロスに向かって降下してきた。しかしハーピーたちの攻撃は、自らを投槍兵の射程距離内に置いただけであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a3db3a7-ae80-41f1-b8f7-321ea728beff\', \'multiverseId\': 400200}, \'multiverseid\': 400200}, {\'name\': \'번개 투창\', \'text\': \'생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 번개 투창은 그 목표에 피해 3점을 입힌다. 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'무자비하게 아크로스를 강습한 하피들은 곧 자신들이 투창의 사거리에 들어왔다는 사실을 깨달았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f638dba4-9229-42c5-ae82-62cb17492b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 400477}, \'multiverseid\': 400477}, {\'name\': \'Azagaia de Raio\', \'text\': \'Azagaia de Raio causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo. Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As harpias atacaram Ácros sem misericórdia, mas seu ataque as colocou ao alcance dos azagaieiros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd3c7bc0-b4c6-4456-b472-590e269708c0\', \'multiverseId\': 400754}, \'multiverseid\': 400754}, {\'name\': \'Копье Молнии\', \'text\': \'Копье Молнии наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку. Предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Гарпии налетели на Акрос безжалостной тучей. Они слишком поздно поняли, что оказались в пределах досягаемости копьеметателей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb26dcf-9c48-4e7f-acb8-bc720fdd0f04\', \'multiverseId\': 401031}, \'multiverseid\': 401031}, {\'name\': \'闪电标枪\', \'text\': \'闪电标枪对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'哈痞无情地俯冲向阿喀洛斯，却发现自己的攻击落在掷枪手的射程内。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9319869a-1826-427e-af4e-9249da0ee673\', \'multiverseId\': 398815}, \'multiverseid\': 398815}, {\'name\': \'閃電標槍\', \'text\': \'閃電標槍對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'哈痞無情地俯衝向阿喀洛斯，卻發現自己的攻擊落在擲槍手的射程內。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab2fdc34-8fa6-47e4-94b8-d184b33f727a\', \'multiverseId\': 399092}, \'multiverseid\': 399092}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutfluch-Ritter\', \'text\': \'Solange du eine Verzauberung kontrollierst, erhält der Blutfluch-Ritter +1/+1 und hat Lebensverknüpfung. (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Blutdurst wird mich nicht beherrschen, denn mein Schwur ist mein größtes Joch."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399358&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11bd4e07-035f-48ae-8d1d-ab2da79571e9\', \'multiverseId\': 399358}, \'multiverseid\': 399358}, {\'name\': \'Caballero maldito por la sangre\', \'text\': \'Mientras controles un encantamiento, el Caballero maldito por la sangre obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de vínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"La sed de sangre no me controlará, pues mi juramento es un deber mayor".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a27e7ac6-3e2e-4e91-89ce-23411cfaafcd\', \'multiverseId\': 401297}, \'multiverseid\': 401297}, {\'name\': \'Chevalier maudit par le sang\', \'text\': \'Tant que vous contrôlez un enchantement, le Chevalier maudit par le sang gagne +1/+1 et a le lien de vie. (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'« La soif de sang ne me contrôlera pas, car mon serment prime sur mes autres instincts. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399635&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9b0fb0a-8291-4566-9453-cc0efc561851\', \'multiverseId\': 399635}, \'multiverseid\': 399635}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliere Maledetto dal Sangue\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che controlli un incantesimo, il Cavaliere Maledetto dal Sangue prende +1/+1 e ha legame vitale. (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"La sete di sangue non mi dominerà, poiché il mio giuramento è la mia compulsione più grande."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365b66c9-4422-4254-9a23-151a567d36f2\', \'multiverseId\': 399912}, \'multiverseid\': 399912}, {\'name\': \'血に呪われた騎士\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャントをコントロールしているかぎり、血に呪われた騎士は＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに絆魂を持つ。（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「血の渇きが私を支配することはない。なぜなら私の誓約こそが私にとっての最大の強制力なのだから。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ee6f3a-6f90-487c-95bf-406db87605d3\', \'multiverseId\': 400189}, \'multiverseid\': 400189}, {\'name\': \'피의 저주를 받은 기사\', \'text\': \'당신이 부여마법을 조종하는 한, 피의 저주를 받은 기사는 +1/+1을 받고 생명연결을 가진다. (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 이 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"난 흡혈 충동을 이겨낸다. 내게는 더 중요한 의무가 있기 때문이지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ba21c8-adf3-4a3f-a223-e7c2f6ff2f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 400466}, \'multiverseid\': 400466}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro do Sangue Amaldiçoado\', \'text\': \'Enquanto você controlar um encantamento, Cavaleiro do Sangue Amaldiçoado receberá +1/+1 e terá vínculo com a vida. (O dano causado por esta criatura também faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A sede de sangue não me controlará, pois meu juramento é a minha maior compulsão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0aa88c-afde-4797-aa7d-14674ea36672\', \'multiverseId\': 400743}, \'multiverseid\': 400743}, {\'name\': \'Рыцарь Проклятой Крови\', \'text\': \'Пока вы контролируете чары, Рыцарь Проклятой Крови получает +1/+1 и имеет Цепь жизни. (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Жажда крови не сможет управлять мной. Ей не превзойти силу моих обетов».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a7b4904-75ec-4e7e-9b2b-1b1ae1ee2018\', \'multiverseId\': 401020}, \'multiverseid\': 401020}, {\'name\': \'血诅骑士\', \'text\': \'只要你操控结界，血诅骑士便得+1/+1且具有系命异能。（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「嗜血欲不能左右我，因为履行誓言才是我最强烈的欲望。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f05ed20-3c21-45b1-a2ec-2f9de9c72028\', \'multiverseId\': 398804}, \'multiverseid\': 398804}, {\'name\': \'血詛騎士\', \'text\': \'只要你操控結界，血詛騎士便得+1/+1且具有繫命異能。（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「嗜血欲不能左右我，因為履行誓言才是我最強烈的欲望。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe70568a-88b1-47c9-bf40-0f6ef30c6d86\', \'multiverseId\': 399081}, \'multiverseid\': 399081}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutsegnung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine KreaturDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Flugfähigkeit und „Opfere zwei andere Kreaturen: Regeneriere diese Kreatur." (Das nächste Mal, dass diese Kreatur in diesem Zug zerstört würde, wird sie nicht zerstört. Tappe sie stattdessen, entferne allen Schaden von ihr und entferne sie aus dem Kampf.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399343&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7374639e-72e3-4667-a34f-d385b088205c\', \'multiverseId\': 399343}, \'multiverseid\': 399343}, {\'name\': \'Consagrada por la sangre\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.La criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de volar y "Sacrificar otras dos criaturas: Regenera esta criatura". (La próxima vez que esta criatura fuera a ser destruida este turno, no lo es. En vez de eso, gírala, remueve todo el daño de ella y remuévela del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1587edf5-3d33-4a5c-9378-3e8971f4b187\', \'multiverseId\': 401282}, \'multiverseid\': 401282}, {\'name\': \'Consécration par le sang\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créatureLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a le vol et « Sacrifiez deux autres créatures : Régénérez cette créature ». (La prochaine fois que cette créature devrait être détruite ce tour-ci, elle ne l\'est pas. À la place, engagez-la, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et retirez-la du combat.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d14455-ca64-432e-a346-b61e4d08203b\', \'multiverseId\': 399620}, \'multiverseid\': 399620}, {\'name\': \'Consacrazione del Sangue\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha volare e "Sacrifica altre due creature: Rigenera questa creatura". (La prossima volta che la creatura sta per essere distrutta in questo turno, non viene distrutta. Invece TAPpala, rimuovi da essa tutto il danno e rimuovila dal combattimento.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acf68c25-48bf-422d-9d0b-296e73ba163b\', \'multiverseId\': 399897}, \'multiverseid\': 399897}, {\'name\': \'血による聖別\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）エンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに飛行と「他のクリーチャーを２体生け贄に捧げる：このクリーチャーを再生する。」を持つ。（このターン、次にそのクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、破壊されない。代わりに、それをタップし、ダメージをすべて取り除き、戦闘から取り除く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0729a14-bf37-439f-a1d9-5fefec20ca22\', \'multiverseId\': 400174}, \'multiverseid\': 400174}, {\'name\': \'피의 축성\', \'text\': \'생물에 부여부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 비행과 "다른 두 생물을 희생한다: 이 생물을 재생한다."를 가진다. (이 턴에 다음으로 이 생물이 파괴되어야 할 경우에 이 생물은 파괴되지 않는다. 대신에 이 생물을 탭하고 전투에서 제거하며, 이 생물로부터 모든 피해를 제거한다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdb48f3f-0d72-4c64-8b88-13cc941c1306\', \'multiverseId\': 400451}, \'multiverseid\': 400451}, {\'name\': \'Consagrado com Sangue\', \'text\': \'Encantar criaturaA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem voar e "Sacrifique outras duas criaturas: Regenere esta criatura." (Na próxima vez em que a criatura seria destruída neste turno, ela não será. Em vez disso, vire-a, remova todo o dano dela e remova-a do combate.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f38b44-3e06-4386-9d1c-32527ed12a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 400728}, \'multiverseid\': 400728}, {\'name\': \'Освящение Кровью\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существоЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Полет и способность «Пожертвуйте два других существа: регенерируйте это существо». (В следующий раз при уничтожении того существа в этом ходу оно не уничтожается. Вместо этого поверните его, снимите с него все повреждения и удалите его из боя.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b6fb84-8c64-4ea4-a60a-0d1c3c43681b\', \'multiverseId\': 401005}, \'multiverseid\': 401005}, {\'name\': \'以血祝圣\', \'text\': \'结附于生物所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有飞行异能与「牺牲两个其他生物：重生此生物。」（如果该生物下一次于本回合中将被消灭，则它不会被消灭，而是改为将它横置，移除受过的所有伤害，并将它移出战斗。）\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82248756-2c92-4fca-98e5-18b16a24f9d3\', \'multiverseId\': 398789}, \'multiverseid\': 398789}, {\'name\': \'以血祝聖\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2且具有飛行異能與「犧牲兩個其他生物：重生此生物。」（如果此生物下一次於本回合中將被消滅，則它不會被消滅。而是改為將它橫置，移除受過的所有傷害，並將它移出戰鬥。）\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d924fbde-5b55-4df3-ba8e-2dbc500a05fc\', \'multiverseId\': 399066}, \'multiverseid\': 399066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boggart-Rohling\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Er hat den größten Knüppel, also kann man davon ausgehen, dass er der Anführer ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab54ca1-d6df-4dc0-b84a-beaedffc5bbc\', \'multiverseId\': 399437}, \'multiverseid\': 399437}, {\'name\': \'Bruto boggart\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Tiene el garrote más grande, así que es probable que sea el líder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'501a0ada-9308-4363-a400-3404b05f521c\', \'multiverseId\': 401376}, \'multiverseid\': 401376}, {\'name\': \'Brute boggarte\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Il a le plus gros bâton ; il y a donc des chances qu\'il soit le chef.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399714&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329d705e-0b2f-4df3-a041-9b789d0b8935\', \'multiverseId\': 399714}, \'multiverseid\': 399714}, {\'name\': \'Bruto Boggart\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Se impugna il randello più grande, è senza dubbio il capo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af1c93e-23cc-49ff-9356-0eb8a4052fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 399991}, \'multiverseid\': 399991}, {\'name\': \'ボガートの粗暴者\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'彼が一番大きな棍棒を持っているから、恐らく彼がリーダーなのだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bbc570c-5820-4279-aed3-18e389f626d9\', \'multiverseId\': 400268}, \'multiverseid\': 400268}, {\'name\': \'보가트 싸움꾼\', \'text\': \'호전적 (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'무리에서 가장 큰 몽둥이를 든 고블린이 우두머리일 가능성이 높다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eea6ee6-b0dc-459e-b567-947088f3c38d\', \'multiverseId\': 400545}, \'multiverseid\': 400545}, {\'name\': \'Papão Brutamontes\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Ele tem o maior porrete, portanto deve ser o líder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f34a383-122c-4269-b371-850d59749de9\', \'multiverseId\': 400822}, \'multiverseid\': 400822}, {\'name\': \'Боггарт-Громила\', \'text\': \'Угроза (Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'У него самая большая палка-колотилка, так что можно смело предположить, что он тут главный.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac8be5b-ed5b-42d3-9857-813639b63fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 401099}, \'multiverseid\': 401099}, {\'name\': \'波尬蛮汉\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'他拿的棍子最大，由此看来他应该就是首领。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ad47eb-853c-4c96-a264-b91298c2823d\', \'multiverseId\': 398883}, \'multiverseid\': 398883}, {\'name\': \'波尬蠻漢\', \'text\': \'威懾（此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'他拿的棍子最大，由此看來他應該就是首領。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba040b2-e903-47a0-b3b8-501ff0b988e4\', \'multiverseId\': 399160}, \'multiverseid\': 399160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bote des Waldes\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden (Diese Kreatur kann beim Angreifen überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)Wenn der Bote des Waldes ins Spiel kommt, decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm alle Elf-Karten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest der Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f94ac72-7064-4113-8533-b0184338273d\', \'multiverseId\': 399482}, \'multiverseid\': 399482}, {\'name\': \'Mensajera silvestre\', \'text\': \'Arrolla. (Esta criatura puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker defensor mientras ataca.)Cuando la Mensajera silvestre entre al campo de batalla, muestra las primeras cuatro cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas de Elfo mostradas de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a543c7f2-6475-42cc-a907-a1388e531f19\', \'multiverseId\': 401421}, \'multiverseid\': 401421}, {\'name\': \'Messager sylvestre\', \'text\': "Piétinement (Cette créature peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker défenseur quand elle attaque.)Quand le Messager sylvestre arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes d\'elfe révélées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399759&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0eed081-d9f9-41f2-abad-349fd8def370\', \'multiverseId\': 399759}, \'multiverseid\': 399759}, {\'name\': \'Messaggero Silvano\', \'text\': \'Travolgere (Questa creatura può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso a un giocatore in difesa o a un planeswalker mentre attacca.)Quando il Messaggero Silvano entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte Elfo rivelate in questo modo e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a3e7538-8bce-45f9-a185-304c26cb9d1d\', \'multiverseId\': 400036}, \'multiverseid\': 400036}, {\'name\': \'森の伝書使\', \'text\': \'トランプル（攻撃しているこのクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージを防御プレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）森の伝書使が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを公開する。これにより公開されたすべてのエルフ・カードをあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3cf9533-a67e-44a4-b8dc-bfb1a8270347\', \'multiverseId\': 400313}, \'multiverseid\': 400313}, {\'name\': \'숲의 전령\', \'text\': \'돌진 (이 생물은 공격할 때 수비플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 여분의 피해를 입힌다.)숲의 전령이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 공개한다. 그중에서 모든 엘프 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e5f6103-1c41-4a9b-b5e0-19e0267a9ab8\', \'multiverseId\': 400590}, \'multiverseid\': 400590}, {\'name\': \'Mensageira Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Atropelar (Esta criatura pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao planeswalker ou jogador defensor ao atacar.)Quando Mensageira Silvestre entrar no campo de batalha, revele os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards do tipo Elfo revelados desta maneira na sua mão e o restante no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efeff8b0-e404-40db-a924-9f2fd20d41e8\', \'multiverseId\': 400867}, \'multiverseid\': 400867}, {\'name\': \'Лесной Посланник\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар (Атакуя, это существо может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения защищающемуся игроку или planeswalker-у.)Когда Лесной Посланник выходит на поле битвы, покажите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите все показанные таким образом карты Эльфов в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98c371e3-ec76-47be-9f46-a01b531d61ce\', \'multiverseId\': 401144}, \'multiverseid\': 401144}, {\'name\': \'森林信驿\', \'text\': \'践踏（此生物攻击时造成之过量战斗伤害能对防御牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）当森林信驿进战场时，展示你牌库顶的四张牌。将以此法展示的所有妖精牌置于你手上，其余则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cf6d4d9-2391-41b3-bdc3-f991ebec205d\', \'multiverseId\': 398928}, \'multiverseid\': 398928}, {\'name\': \'森林信驛\', \'text\': \'踐踏（此生物攻擊時造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對防禦玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）當森林信驛進戰場時，展示你牌庫頂的四張牌。將以此法展示的所有妖精牌置於你手上，其餘則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'988f5ca7-8c7c-41c9-abfe-25eb0d019555\', \'multiverseId\': 399205}, \'multiverseid\': 399205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion des Iroas\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Daran gewöhnt, in der Arena zu kämpfen, weiß der Champion genau, wie man die Zuschauer begeistern kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98b9e83-e9a8-4380-b62e-09994cbabdc5\', \'multiverseId\': 399484}, \'multiverseid\': 399484}, {\'name\': \'Campeona de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces. (Esta criatura daña primero y también hace daño de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Acostumbrados a combatir ante el público en la arena, los campeones de Iroas saben ofrecer un buen espectáculo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'649d1f01-a9a5-4bf7-9973-4e3cf24f8cee\', \'multiverseId\': 401423}, \'multiverseid\': 401423}, {\'name\': "Championne d\'Iroas", \'text\': "Double initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Habitués à combattre en public dans l\'arène, les champions d\'Iroas savent se donner en spectacle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9affb4dd-916c-41b8-9eb0-2c9c2f562108\', \'multiverseId\': 399761}, \'multiverseid\': 399761}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa di Iroas\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco (Questa creatura infligge sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': "Abituati a combattere davanti al pubblico nell\'arena, i campioni di Iroas sanno come offrire un grande spettacolo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170f5ed1-67cd-418b-a832-1bfe6d870759\', \'multiverseId\': 400038}, \'multiverseid\': 400038}, {\'name\': \'イロアスの勇者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃（このクリーチャーは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'イロアスの勇者たちは闘技場で観客を前にして戦うことに慣れているため、見せ場を作る方法を熟知している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf77000-23db-44c6-ba46-ec393c62c1b0\', \'multiverseId\': 400315}, \'multiverseid\': 400315}, {\'name\': \'이로아스의 용사\', \'text\': \'이단공격 (이 생물은 선제공격 전투피해와 일반 전투피해를 같이 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'투기장에서 관중의 환호를 받으며 싸우는데 익숙한 이로아스의 용사들은 관중을 열광시킬 줄 안다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03cadd0a-00db-49a7-8eec-0a4ab9767dc5\', \'multiverseId\': 400592}, \'multiverseid\': 400592}, {\'name\': \'Campeã de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo (Esta criatura causa tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Acostumados a lutar diante do público na arena, os campeões de Iroas sabem dar um show.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52424b25-334e-4164-b721-2a9e46bf86fc\', \'multiverseId\': 400869}, \'multiverseid\': 400869}, {\'name\': \'Поборница Ироя\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Поборники Ироя привыкли сражаться перед зрителями на арене и поэтому знают, как устроить достойное зрелище.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78e4e80e-8c60-4f36-9a13-0c847d2b21d7\', \'multiverseId\': 401146}, \'multiverseid\': 401146}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯的斗士\', \'text\': \'连击（此生物能造成先攻伤害以及普通战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'伊洛安斯的斗士习于在竞技场观众面前战斗，知道如何精彩演出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a5ff56-b334-4ccd-b315-02ad48ebab00\', \'multiverseId\': 398930}, \'multiverseid\': 398930}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯的鬥士\', \'text\': \'連擊（此生物能造成先攻傷害以及普通戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'伊洛安斯的鬥士習於在競技場觀眾面前戰鬥，知道如何精彩演出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85314fa4-c96f-4a64-ac27-a99d7e09a3db\', \'multiverseId\': 399207}, \'multiverseid\': 399207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Feuer von Kaladesh // Chandra, die tobende Flamme\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, die tobende Flamme, fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.−2: Chandra, die tobende Flamme, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.−7: Chandra, die tobende Flamme, fügt jedem Gegner 6 Schadenspunkte zu. Jeder Spieler, dem auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, erhält ein Emblem mit „Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt dir dieses Emblem 3 Schadenspunkte zu."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Chandra, die tobende Flamme\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399253&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee38666e-16ae-4674-8ad5-6fcc7ee678eb\', \'multiverseId\': 399253}, \'multiverseid\': 399253}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, el fuego de Kaladesh // Chandra, llamarada rugiente\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, llamarada rugiente hace 2 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.-2: Chandra, llamarada rugiente hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.-7: Chandra, llamarada rugiente hace 6 puntos de daño a cada oponente. Cada jugador que recibió daño de esta manera obtiene un emblema con "Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, este emblema te hace 3 puntos de daño".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Chandra, llamarada rugiente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17c1643-d25b-469f-af98-231cf3107ea0\', \'multiverseId\': 401192}, \'multiverseid\': 401192}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, feu de Kaladesh // Chandra, flamme rugissante\', \'text\': \'+1 : Chandra, flamme rugissante inflige 2 blessures au joueur ciblé.-2 : Chandra, flamme rugissante inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée.-7 : Chandra, flamme rugissante inflige 6 blessures à chaque adversaire. Chaque adversaire blessé de cette manière gagne un emblème avec « Au début de votre entretien, cet emblème vous inflige 3 blessures ».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker : - Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Chandra, flamme rugissante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'460b53f8-2204-4463-8dc5-830e74424a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 399530}, \'multiverseid\': 399530}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Fuoco di Kaladesh // Chandra, Fiamma Ruggente\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Fiamma Ruggente infligge 2 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.-2: Chandra, Fiamma Ruggente infligge 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio.-7: Chandra, Fiamma Ruggente infligge 6 danni a ogni avversario. Ogni giocatore a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo ottiene un emblema con "All\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, questo emblema ti infligge 3 danni".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Chandra, Fiamma Ruggente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb04686-2f5b-46d2-8208-404220ed92c1\', \'multiverseId\': 399807}, \'multiverseid\': 399807}, {\'name\': \'カラデシュの火、チャンドラ // 燃え盛る炎、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。燃え盛る炎、チャンドラはそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。−2：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。燃え盛る炎、チャンドラはそれに２点のダメージを与える。−7：燃え盛る炎、チャンドラは各対戦相手にそれぞれ６点のダメージを与える。これによりダメージを与えられた各プレイヤーはそれぞれ「あなたのアップキープの開始時に、この紋章はあなたに３点のダメージを与える。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー ― - チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'燃え盛る炎、チャンドラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10ecfe33-7cdc-4adb-99a5-83fb5452ec03\', \'multiverseId\': 400084}, \'multiverseid\': 400084}, {\'name\': \'칼라데시의 불 찬드라 // 포효하는 불길 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 포효하는 불길 찬드라는 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.-2: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 포효하는 불길 찬드라는 그 생물에 피해 2점을 입힌다.-7: 포효하는 불길 찬드라는 각 상대에게 피해 6점을 입힌다. 이런 식으로 피해를 입은 각 플레이어는 "당신의 유지단 시작에, 이 휘장은 당신에게 피해 3점을 입힌다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'포효하는 불길 찬드라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c9dbe1a-18d1-4a5a-b018-953faa8ee497\', \'multiverseId\': 400361}, \'multiverseid\': 400361}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Fogo de Kaladesh // Chandra, Chama Furiosa\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Chama Furiosa, causa 2 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.−2: Chandra, Chama Furiosa, causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.−7: Chandra, Chama Furiosa, causa 6 pontos de dano a cada oponente. Cada jogador que sofrer dano desta forma recebe um emblema com "No início da sua manutenção, este emblema causa 3 pontos de dano a você."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Chandra, Chama Furiosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73ce43b-44c8-4a63-a650-59b678b2dde0\', \'multiverseId\': 400638}, \'multiverseid\': 400638}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Огонь Каладеша // Чандра, Ревущее Пламя\', \'text\': \'+1: Чандра, Ревущее Пламя наносит 2 повреждения целевому игроку.−2: Чандра, Ревущее Пламя наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу.−7: Чандра, Ревущее Пламя наносит 6 повреждений каждому оппоненту. Каждый игрок, которому были таким образом нанесены повреждения, получает эмблему со способностью «В начале вашего шага поддержки эта эмблема наносит вам 3 повреждения».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Чандра, Ревущее Пламя\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb4bd79-2a71-4b20-960e-6ffe4cd53b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 400915}, \'multiverseid\': 400915}, {\'name\': \'卡拉德许之火茜卓 // 咆哮烈焰茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：咆哮烈焰茜卓对目标牌手造成2点伤害。−2：咆哮烈焰茜卓对目标生物造成2点伤害。−7：咆哮烈焰茜卓向每位对手各造成6点伤害。以此法受到伤害的每位牌手均获得具有「在你的维持开始时，此徽记对你造成3点伤害」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～ - 茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'咆哮烈焰茜卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d7c7e19-debd-4cd6-825e-083af532afbc\', \'multiverseId\': 398699}, \'multiverseid\': 398699}, {\'name\': \'卡拉德許之火茜卓 // 咆哮烈焰茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：咆哮烈焰茜卓對目標玩家造成2點傷害。-2：咆哮烈焰茜卓對目標生物造成2點傷害。-7：咆哮烈焰茜卓向每位對手各造成6點傷害。以此法受到傷害的每位玩家均獲得具有「在你的維持開始時，此徽記對你造成3點傷害」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～ - 茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'咆哮烈焰茜卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37846886-52e8-4ad2-b517-bf64c80c879b\', \'multiverseId\': 398976}, \'multiverseid\': 398976}]', "[{'name': 'Chandra, Feuer von Kaladesh // Chandra, die tobende Flamme', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen roten Zauberspruch wirkst, enttappe Chandra, Feuer von Kaladesh.{T}: Chandra, Feuer von Kaladesh, fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Falls Chandra in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Schadenspunkte zugefügt hat, schicke sie ins Exil und bringe sie dann transformiert unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Chandra, Feuer von Kaladesh', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399253&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee38666e-16ae-4674-8ad5-6fcc7ee678eb', 'multiverseId': 399253}, 'multiverseid': 399253}, {'name': 'Chandra, el fuego de Kaladesh // Chandra, llamarada rugiente', 'text': 'Siempre que lances un hechizo rojo, endereza a Chandra, el fuego de Kaladesh.{T}: Chandra, el fuego de Kaladesh hace 1 punto de daño al jugador objetivo. Si Chandra ha hecho 3 o más puntos de daño este turno, exíliala, luego regrésala al campo de batalla transformada bajo el control de su propietario.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Chamán humano', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Chandra, el fuego de Kaladesh', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401192&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b17c1643-d25b-469f-af98-231cf3107ea0', 'multiverseId': 401192}, 'multiverseid': 401192}, {'name': 'Chandra, feu de Kaladesh // Chandra, flamme rugissante', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort rouge, dégagez Chandra, feu de Kaladesh.{T} : Chandra, feu de Kaladesh inflige 1 blessure au joueur ciblé. Si Chandra a infligé au moins 3 blessures ce tour-ci, exilez-la, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille, transformée, sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et shamane', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Chandra, feu de Kaladesh', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399530&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '460b53f8-2204-4463-8dc5-830e74424a4f', 'multiverseId': 399530}, 'multiverseid': 399530}, {'name': 'Chandra, Fuoco di Kaladesh // Chandra, Fiamma Ruggente', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia rossa, STAPpa Chandra, Fuoco di Kaladesh.{T}: Chandra, Fuoco di Kaladesh infligge 1 danno a un giocatore bersaglio. Se Chandra ha inflitto 3 o più danni in questo turno, esiliala, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia trasformata sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Umano', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Chandra, Fuoco di Kaladesh', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399807&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bb04686-2f5b-46d2-8208-404220ed92c1', 'multiverseId': 399807}, 'multiverseid': 399807}, {'name': 'カラデシュの火、チャンドラ // 燃え盛る炎、チャンドラ', 'text': 'あなたが赤の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、カラデシュの火、チャンドラをアンタップする。{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。カラデシュの火、チャンドラはそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。このターンにカラデシュの火、チャンドラが３点以上のダメージを与えたなら、カラデシュの火、チャンドラを追放し、その後、これを変身させた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'カラデシュの火、チャンドラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400084&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10ecfe33-7cdc-4adb-99a5-83fb5452ec03', 'multiverseId': 400084}, 'multiverseid': 400084}, {'name': '칼라데시의 불 찬드라 // 포효하는 불길 찬드라', 'text': '당신이 적색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 칼라데시의 불 찬드라를 언탭한다.{T}: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 칼라데시의 불 찬드라는 그 플레이어에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 이 턴에 찬드라가 피해 3점 이상을 입혔다면, 찬드라를 추방한 다음 변신한 채로 그 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.', 'type': '전설적 생물 — 인간 주술사', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '칼라데시의 불 찬드라', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400361&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c9dbe1a-18d1-4a5a-b018-953faa8ee497', 'multiverseId': 400361}, 'multiverseid': 400361}, {'name': 'Chandra, Fogo de Kaladesh // Chandra, Chama Furiosa', 'text': 'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica vermelha, desvire Chandra, Fogo de Kaladesh.{T}: Chandra, Fogo de Kaladesh, causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador alvo. Se Chandra tiver causado 3 ou mais pontos de dano neste turno, exile-a e devolva-a ao campo de batalha transformada sob o controle de seu dono.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Xamã', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Chandra, Fogo de Kaladesh', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400638&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e73ce43b-44c8-4a63-a650-59b678b2dde0', 'multiverseId': 400638}, 'multiverseid': 400638}, {'name': 'Чандра, Огонь Каладеша // Чандра, Ревущее Пламя', 'text': 'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете красное заклинание, разверните Чандру, Огонь Каладеша.{T}: Чандра, Огонь Каладеша наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку. Если Чандра нанесла не менее 3 повреждений в этом ходу, изгоните ее, затем верните ее на поле битвы трансформированной под контролем ее владельца.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Человек Шаман', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Чандра, Огонь Каладеша', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400915&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fb4bd79-2a71-4b20-960e-6ffe4cd53b3b', 'multiverseId': 400915}, 'multiverseid': 400915}, {'name': '卡拉德许之火茜卓 // 咆哮烈焰茜卓', 'text': '每当你施放红色咒语时，重置卡拉德许之火茜卓。{T}：卡拉德许之火茜卓对目标牌手造成1点伤害。如果茜卓本回合已造成3点或更多伤害，则放逐她，然后将她在其拥有者的操控下移回战场且已转化。', 'type': '传奇生物～人类／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '卡拉德许之火茜卓', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398699&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d7c7e19-debd-4cd6-825e-083af532afbc', 'multiverseId': 398699}, 'multiverseid': 398699}, {'name': '卡拉德許之火茜卓 // 咆哮烈焰茜卓', 'text': '每當你施放紅色咒語時，重置卡拉德許之火茜卓。{T}：卡拉德許之火茜卓對目標玩家造成1點傷害。如果茜卓本回合已造成3點或更多傷害，則放逐她，然後將她在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場且已轉化。', 'type': '傳奇生物～人類／祭師', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '卡拉德許之火茜卓', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398976&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37846886-52e8-4ad2-b517-bf64c80c879b', 'multiverseId': 398976}, 'multiverseid': 398976}]", '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Entflammen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt jeder anderen Kreatur und jedem Gegner Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In dem Moment vor ihrer Hinrichtung verstand sie, was es heißt, eine Pyromagierin zu sein, am Leben zu sein, Chandra zu sein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399247&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efc8a036-a610-49cd-96af-f543a51c6af4\', \'multiverseId\': 399247}, \'multiverseid\': 399247}, {\'name\': \'Ignición de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a cada otra criatura y cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En el momento previo a su ejecución, se dio cuenta de lo que significaba ser una piromante, estar viva, ser Chandra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473af626-9163-4d04-98bc-75fd28c2c9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 401186}, \'multiverseid\': 401186}, {\'name\': \'Embrasement de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à chaque autre créature et à chaque adversaire.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "À l\'instant de son exécution, elle comprit ce que signifiait être une pyromancienne, être vivante et être Chandra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'960386a2-4a15-47bd-b089-ffb31664c0f3\', \'multiverseId\': 399524}, \'multiverseid\': 399524}, {\'name\': \'Scintilla di Chandra\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a ogni altra creatura e a ogni avversario.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Nell\'istante prima della sua esecuzione, capì cosa significava essere una piromante, essere viva, essere... Chandra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'083b9f15-31f3-4e01-88cc-c888e99f5f05\', \'multiverseId\': 399801}, \'multiverseid\': 399801}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの灯の目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それは他の各クリーチャーと各対戦相手に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージをそれぞれ与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'処刑される直前の瞬間、彼女は紅蓮術師であること、生きること、チャンドラであることの意味を悟った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b927ae-8b86-41f4-822a-37cf3927736f\', \'multiverseId\': 400078}, \'multiverseid\': 400078}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 점화\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 다른 각 생물과 상대에게 자신의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'찬드라는 처형당하기 직전에 불꽃술사가 뭔지, 살아 있다는 것이 뭔지, 자기 자신이 뭘 원하는지 깨달았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'483e188c-cf99-4370-bdf3-ed50cdbf983c\', \'multiverseId\': 400355}, \'multiverseid\': 400355}, {\'name\': \'Combustão de Chandra\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla causa dano igual ao seu poder a cada outra criatura e cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'No momento antes de sua execução, ela se deu conta do significado de ser uma piromante, de estar viva e de ser Chandra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ded3d852-0ac1-493d-9b7e-8d3cadf85f36\', \'multiverseId\': 400632}, \'multiverseid\': 400632}, {\'name\': \'Воспламенение Чандры\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, каждому другому существу и каждому оппоненту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'За секунду до казни она поняла, что значит быть пиромантом, быть живой, быть Чандрой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b8297c-6c21-4887-9065-044bc36fd29a\', \'multiverseId\': 400909}, \'multiverseid\': 400909}, {\'name\': \'茜卓扬焰\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物向每个其他生物和每位对手各造成伤害，其数量等同于该生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在她将被处决的那一刻，她才明白身为烈焰术士的意义，活着的意义，以及身为茜卓的意义。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23f9d32a-3f43-4060-bd26-03d20c59f269\', \'multiverseId\': 398693}, \'multiverseid\': 398693}, {\'name\': \'茜卓揚焰\', \'text\': \'目標由你操控的生物向每個其他生物和每位對手各造成傷害，其數量等同於該生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'在她將被處決的那一刻，她才明白身為烈焰術士的意義，活著的意義，以及身為茜卓的意義。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4405de28-3b45-431e-865b-6c5a14ed9f35\', \'multiverseId\': 398970}, \'multiverseid\': 398970}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Wut\', \'text\': \'Chandras Wut fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte und allen Kreaturen, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie haben angefangen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80168d6-d6e7-4140-9ec4-0b3e9cd883ed\', \'multiverseId\': 399463}, \'multiverseid\': 399463}, {\'name\': \'Furia de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Furia de Chandra hace 4 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo y 1 punto de daño a cada criatura que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Empezaron ellos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c663568a-d85f-4288-8906-4f1ed42cc713\', \'multiverseId\': 401402}, \'multiverseid\': 401402}, {\'name\': \'Furie de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Furie de Chandra inflige 4 blessures au joueur ciblé et 1 blessure à chaque créature que ce joueur contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est eux qui ont commencé. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f49c2ed-4640-4a66-bcc0-c167b54d0aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 399740}, \'multiverseid\': 399740}, {\'name\': \'Furia di Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Furia di Chandra infligge 4 danni a un giocatore bersaglio e 1 danno a ogni creatura controllata da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono stati loro a iniziare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a862f058-66bb-4905-b49a-48aa6c71ed2c\', \'multiverseId\': 400017}, \'multiverseid\': 400017}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの憤怒\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。チャンドラの憤怒はそのプレイヤーに４点、そのプレイヤーがコントロールする各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「先に手を出したのはあいつらだからね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08fe6256-4a33-4330-a020-48d1daa82741\', \'multiverseId\': 400294}, \'multiverseid\': 400294}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 분노\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 분노는 그 플레이어에게 피해 4점을 입히고 그 플레이어가 조종하는 각 생물에 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"놈들이 먼저 시작했어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd57734e-0eb7-46f0-bdc4-527ce49a76aa\', \'multiverseId\': 400571}, \'multiverseid\': 400571}, {\'name\': \'Fúria de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Fúria de Chandra causa 4 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo e 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles começaram."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc0cb966-8d3a-45f4-846f-e5cc7b0d6dd6\', \'multiverseId\': 400848}, \'multiverseid\': 400848}, {\'name\': \'Ярость Чандры\', \'text\': \'Ярость Чандры наносит 4 повреждения целевому игроку и 1 повреждение каждому существу под контролем того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Они первые начали».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befc0a13-3678-42d3-856c-794f1a58890b\', \'multiverseId\': 401125}, \'multiverseid\': 401125}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的怒火\', \'text\': \'茜卓的怒火对目标牌手造成4点伤害，且对每个由该牌手操控的生物各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「他们先惹我的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b167c15-2d57-4c4e-84c4-f1e790024606\', \'multiverseId\': 398909}, \'multiverseid\': 398909}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的怒火\', \'text\': \'茜卓的怒火對目標玩家造成4點傷害，且對每個由該玩家操控的生物各造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「他們先惹我的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a060f7e-8303-4766-9f3b-bdf2e297c28a\', \'multiverseId\': 399186}, \'multiverseid\': 399186}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Rudel versammeln\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.Zauberkunst — Falls sich zwei oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexerei-Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, nimm von den aufgedeckten Karten bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten statt einer auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399279&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df62459-207d-42d0-abfe-210a0f8c80f5\', \'multiverseId\': 399279}, \'multiverseid\': 399279}, {\'name\': \'Reunir al grupo\', \'text\': \'Muestra las primeras cinco cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de criatura que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.\\nDominio de hechizos — Si hay dos o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, en vez de una, pon en tu mano hasta dos cartas de criatura que se encuentren entre las cartas mostradas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee28a190-9f81-4a33-a936-0556d0da01c0\', \'multiverseId\': 401218}, \'multiverseid\': 401218}, {\'name\': \'Rassemblement de la meute\', \'text\': "Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.Maîtrise de sort — S\'il y a au moins deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, mettez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature parmi les cartes révélées dans votre main à la place d\'une.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce7277e6-1e9f-4f5e-9756-36bb1f329492\', \'multiverseId\': 399556}, \'multiverseid\': 399556}, {\'name\': \'Radunare la Banda\', \'text\': \'Rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta creatura scelta tra esse. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.Arte magica — Se nel tuo cimitero ci sono due o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, aggiungi alla tua mano fino a due carte creatura scelte tra le carte rivelate invece di una.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35820134-074e-4d6c-a784-6f06f1a55458\', \'multiverseId\': 399833}, \'multiverseid\': 399833}, {\'name\': \'群れの結集\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを公開する。あなたは、その中からクリーチャー・カードを１枚あなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタント・カードやソーサリー・カードが合わせて２枚以上あるなら、公開されたカードの中からクリーチャー・カードを、１枚の代わりに最大２枚まであなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'449436e8-cb9f-4082-b27a-e6bb39c1b369\', \'multiverseId\': 400110}, \'multiverseid\': 400110}, {\'name\': \'무리 소집\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 다섯 장을 공개한다. 당신은 그 중 생물 카드 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드는 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.주문 숙련 — 당신의 무덤에 집중마법 그리고/또는 순간마법 카드가 두 장 이상 있다면, 공개한 카드 중 생물 카드를 한 장 대신 두 장까지 손으로 가져간다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c2d3e01-18b9-458f-9cd3-e958efc6142e\', \'multiverseId\': 400387}, \'multiverseid\': 400387}, {\'name\': \'Reunir o Bando\', \'text\': \'Revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de criatura dentre eles em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.Maestria em magia — Se houver dois ou mais cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço no seu cemitério, coloque até dois cards de criatura dentre os revelados na sua mão, em vez de um.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ab5ca1-835e-4806-901d-720967fea2cc\', \'multiverseId\': 400664}, \'multiverseid\': 400664}, {\'name\': \'Сбор Стаи\', \'text\': \'Покажите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить находящуюся среди них карту существа в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты на ваше кладбище.Мастерство заклинаний — Если на вашем кладбище есть не менее двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и (или) волшебства, положите в вашу руку не более двух карт существ, находящихся среди показанных карт, вместо одной.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58421479-703a-4e4e-aebc-328503bd0b8c\', \'multiverseId\': 400941}, \'multiverseid\': 400941}, {\'name\': \'召集猎群\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以将其中的一张生物牌置于你手上。将其余的牌置入你的坟墓场。精熟咒语～如果你坟墓场中有两张或更多的瞬间和／或法术牌，则改为将所展示之牌中至多两张生物牌置于你手上，而非一张。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da9fcac-4378-460a-904c-f4b42c25e13b\', \'multiverseId\': 398725}, \'multiverseid\': 398725}, {\'name\': \'召集獵群\', \'text\': \'展示你牌庫頂的五張牌。你可以將其中的一張生物牌置於你手上。將其餘的牌置入你的墳墓場。精熟咒語～如果你墳墓場中有兩張或更多的瞬間和／或巫術牌，則改為將所展示之牌中至多兩張生物牌置於你手上，而非一張。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c314038b-32a2-4fcb-b599-b79367d179b4\', \'multiverseId\': 399002}, \'multiverseid\': 399002}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Nichts Natürliches oder Sterbliches hat für immer Bestand.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d9b37e-477a-444a-b2ff-41fe08b1ddb2\', \'multiverseId\': 399317}, \'multiverseid\': 399317}, {\'name\': \'Demoler\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Nada que proceda de la naturaleza ni de los mortales puede resistir para siempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'878bdfe8-40cb-4716-a0c6-638410616639\', \'multiverseId\': 401256}, \'multiverseid\': 401256}, {\'name\': \'Démolition\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Rien de naturel ou de mortel n\'est éternel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7a960f0-385f-48d5-b0e0-99ec919b51aa\', \'multiverseId\': 399594}, \'multiverseid\': 399594}, {\'name\': \'Frantumare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Niente che appartenga alla natura o ai mortali può durare in eterno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'632252e0-439b-4b1f-b204-e9a1cd4fd268\', \'multiverseId\': 399871}, \'multiverseid\': 399871}, {\'name\': \'破砕\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'自然または定命の者の造ったもので、永遠に残るものは皆無である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e82c3b-220a-4397-8da0-0627b3b6ce91\', \'multiverseId\': 400148}, \'multiverseid\': 400148}, {\'name\': \'철거\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'자연이나 인간이 만든 것은 영속성이 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e62c59a3-d8d3-44f6-a319-207b54744249\', \'multiverseId\': 400425}, \'multiverseid\': 400425}, {\'name\': \'Demolir\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nada da natureza ou dos mortais pode durar para sempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4570e55c-8679-4f9f-af31-0eb528f49438\', \'multiverseId\': 400702}, \'multiverseid\': 400702}, {\'name\': \'Разрушение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Ни творения природы, ни создания смертных не существуют вечно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d38a4d9e-2493-4f47-bafc-56cbebae4dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 400979}, \'multiverseid\': 400979}, {\'name\': \'毁坏\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'自然和凡人的一切都无法永存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53f693b1-eed2-4274-8662-adfe3e08380d\', \'multiverseId\': 398763}, \'multiverseid\': 398763}, {\'name\': \'毀壞\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'自然和凡人的一切都無法永存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cbd7dfd-b88e-4324-8920-578ef1dd938e\', \'multiverseId\': 399040}, \'multiverseid\': 399040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Große Aurora\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler mischt alle Karten aus seiner Hand und alle bleibenden Karten, die er besitzt, in seine Bibliothek und zieht dann entsprechend viele Karten. Jeder Spieler kann eine beliebige Anzahl an Länderkarten aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen. Schicke Die Große Aurora ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399510&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5837384c-8922-4af4-b7a9-242987016351\', \'multiverseId\': 399510}, \'multiverseid\': 399510}, {\'name\': \'La Gran Aurora\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador baraja todas las cartas de su mano y todos los permanentes de los que es propietario en su biblioteca, luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas. Cada jugador puede poner cualquier cantidad de cartas de tierra de su mano en el campo de batalla. Exilia La Gran Aurora.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0bab0d3-72f1-44e0-9f0d-a2978242a010\', \'multiverseId\': 401449}, \'multiverseid\': 401449}, {\'name\': \'La Grande Aurore\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur mélange toutes les cartes de sa main et tous les permanents qu\'il possède à sa bibliothèque et pioche ensuite autant de cartes. Chaque joueur peut mettre sur le champ de bataille n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de terrain de sa main. Exilez La Grande Aurore.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3ba6aa-9c6c-4221-9a85-8ec83c8e5f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 399787}, \'multiverseid\': 399787}, {\'name\': \'La Grande Luminaria\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore rimescola tutte le carte della propria mano e tutti i permanenti che possiede nel proprio grimorio, poi pesca altrettante carte. Ogni giocatore può mettere sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte terra dalla sua mano. Esilia La Grande Luminaria.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a79d12e9-9b44-47a2-805e-71ecf48dab74\', \'multiverseId\': 400064}, \'multiverseid\': 400064}, {\'name\': \'大オーロラ\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札にあるすべてのカードと自分がオーナーであるすべてのパーマネントを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後それらの枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札から望む枚数の土地・カードを戦場に出してもよい。大オーロラを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a8338ab-7bcd-49fe-ac39-29f3672e45fb\', \'multiverseId\': 400341}, \'multiverseid\': 400341}, {\'name\': \'장대한 오로라\', \'text\': \'각 플레이어는 자신의 손에 있는 모든 카드와 자신이 소유한 모든 지속물을 자신의 서고에 섞어 넣은 후, 그만큼의 카드를 뽑는다. 각 플레이어는 자신의 손에서 원하는 만큼의 대지 카드를 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 장대한 오로라를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f54db1-7f6b-4a89-8b40-0052b6f70341\', \'multiverseId\': 400618}, \'multiverseid\': 400618}, {\'name\': \'A Grande Aurora\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador embaralha todos os cards da própria mão e todas as permanentes que lhe pertencem em seu próprio grimório e depois compra um número equivalente de cards. Cada jogador pode colocar qualquer número de cards de terrenos que tiver na mão no campo de batalha. Exile A Grande Aurora.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e246096-c386-4384-acce-ada479a60eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 400895}, \'multiverseid\': 400895}, {\'name\': \'Великая Аврора\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок втасовывает в свою библиотеку все карты из своей руки и все перманенты, владельцем которых он является, затем берет столько же карт. Каждый игрок может положить любое количество карт земель из своей руки на поле битвы. Изгоните Великую Аврору.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b083cf1-50a4-46f5-9d8b-21f5f38154bb\', \'multiverseId\': 401172}, \'multiverseid\': 401172}, {\'name\': \'伟大极光\', \'text\': \'每位牌手将其所有手牌和由他拥有的所有永久物洗入其牌库，然后各抓等量的牌。每位牌手可以将任意数量的地牌从其手上放进战场。放逐伟大极光。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da947902-49c4-4e8d-8fa4-6b0ecb702b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 398956}, \'multiverseid\': 398956}, {\'name\': \'偉大極光\', \'text\': \'每位玩家將其所有手牌和由他擁有的所有永久物洗入其牌庫，然後各抽等量的牌。每位玩家可以將任意數量的地牌從其手上放進戰場。放逐偉大極光。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1de34222-70ca-400a-a97f-0033df963cf3\', \'multiverseId\': 399233}, \'multiverseid\': 399233}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Macht der Massen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Joraga-Elfen haben es nicht nötig, Trolle aus ihrem Gebiet zu vertreiben. Sie verleihen ihnen einfach ihre gesammelte Stärke, und kein Troll kann dann widerstehen, sich auf eine lustige Rauftour in fremde Länder zu begeben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399493&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b2e9747-aa19-412b-8ffb-b00ab4e05f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 399493}, \'multiverseid\': 399493}, {\'name\': \'Poder de las masas\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los elfos de Joraga nunca necesitan pedir a un trol que deje su territorio. Simplemente le otorgan su fuerza combinada y este no puede resistir emprender un alegre viaje de destrucción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66da5a1-08a4-4ec2-8855-c223365b7509\', \'multiverseId\': 401432}, \'multiverseid\': 401432}, {\'name\': \'Puissance des masses\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les elfes de Joraga ne demandent jamais à un troll de quitter leur territoire. Ils lui transfèrent juste leur force combinée et il ne peut résister très longtemps à l\'appel de la sauvagerie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0e8561-b847-4973-ab83-e4d61fe93792\', \'multiverseId\': 399770}, \'multiverseid\': 399770}, {\'name\': \'Potere delle Masse\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli elfi di Joraga non hanno mai la necessità di chiedere a un troll di alzare i tacchi. Basta che gli concedano la loro forza combinata e quello non può resistere alla prospettiva di scatenarsi come un pazzo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e00f2021-adcb-4474-b359-38639db4d9fc\', \'multiverseId\': 400047}, \'multiverseid\': 400047}, {\'name\': \'大群の力\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはあなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ジョラーガのエルフは、トロールに領地から出て行けと言う必要がまったくない。単に彼らの力を渡すだけで、嬉々として襲撃に出かけることを我慢できなくなるからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c7ac95-8630-4fc7-a1b2-d35321d1c181\', \'multiverseId\': 400324}, \'multiverseid\': 400324}, {\'name\': \'군중의 힘\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개당 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'조라가의 엘프들은 트롤을 쫓아낼 필요가 없다. 트롤에게 자신들의 힘을 주면 트롤이 기쁨을 감추지 못하고 뭐든 때려 부수러 숲을 나가기 때문이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a2e4098-97d0-4eff-bacb-8ea98abe98b8\', \'multiverseId\': 400601}, \'multiverseid\': 400601}, {\'name\': \'Força das Massas\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os elfos de Joraga nunca precisam pedir a um trol que deixe seu território. Eles meramente concedem a ele sua força combinada e ele não consegue resistir ao impulso destrutivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0371fdb5-5bcd-43dd-993f-bce60dd5bdd8\', \'multiverseId\': 400878}, \'multiverseid\': 400878}, {\'name\': \'Сила Масс\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Джорагским эльфам не приходится просить тролля покинуть их земли. Они наделяют его своей объединенной силой, и тот весело отправляется крушить все подряд.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff230134-8997-422b-bcc3-44b274494c78\', \'multiverseId\': 401155}, \'multiverseid\': 401155}, {\'name\': \'众人之力\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个生物，目标生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'玖瑞加妖精从未要求巨魔离开其领土。他们只是将集体之力量赋予它身上，使它忍不住要展开快乐的暴冲旅程。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0241d9-0bed-4d92-a530-bfccdc2c392a\', \'multiverseId\': 398939}, \'multiverseid\': 398939}, {\'name\': \'眾人之力\', \'text\': \'你每操控一個生物，目標生物便得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'玖瑞加妖精從未要求巨魔離開其領土。他們只是將集體之力量賦予牠身上，使牠忍不住要展開快樂的暴衝旅程。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43136b6c-667f-4e52-9ac3-cb58c4662f34\', \'multiverseId\': 399216}, \'multiverseid\': 399216}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnerschlag-Lindwurm\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)FliegendAndere fliegende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'Donner verheißt nicht immer Regen. Manchmal verheißt er auch dein Verderben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f4a0e6-d3a1-4dfe-93fc-f1577d6b93a1\', \'multiverseId\': 399486}, \'multiverseid\': 399486}, {\'name\': \'Wyvern del trueno\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)Vuela.Las otras criaturas que controlas con la habilidad de volar obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'El trueno no siempre anuncia lluvia. A veces, es heraldo de ruina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19707a8c-34e3-4fea-934d-c9f16acb0305\', \'multiverseId\': 401425}, \'multiverseid\': 401425}, {\'name\': \'Vouivre du tonnerre\', \'text\': \'Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)VolLes autres créatures avec le vol que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "Le tonnerre n\'annonce pas toujours la pluie. Parfois, il annonce la destruction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399763&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdf6c1bc-026e-423c-8855-5006e49bcc25\', \'multiverseId\': 399763}, \'multiverseid\': 399763}, {\'name\': \'Viverna del Rombo di Tuono\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)VolareLe altre creature con volare che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'Non sempre un tuono preannuncia pioggia. A volte preannuncia rovina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fa9f31e-5140-42ae-baeb-757f0c10312d\', \'multiverseId\': 400040}, \'multiverseid\': 400040}, {\'name\': \'雷鳴のワイヴァーン\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）飛行他のあなたがコントロールする飛行を持つクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'雷鳴が常に雨を意味するとは限らない。時には、それは荒廃を意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cd4b5b2-98d5-4193-84b0-4d24d722b05a\', \'multiverseId\': 400317}, \'multiverseid\': 400317}, {\'name\': \'뇌명 와이번\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)비행당신이 조종하는 비행을 가진 다른 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드레이크\', \'flavor\': \'천둥이 친다고 항상 비가 오는 것은 아니다. 천둥이 파괴의 전조일 수도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd699779-b71b-4264-8a04-6b05e880191d\', \'multiverseId\': 400594}, \'multiverseid\': 400594}, {\'name\': \'Serpe da Trovoada\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)VoarAs outras criaturas que você controla com voar recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'Trovão nem sempre significa chuva. Às vezes, significa destruição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16680f6c-71ac-47da-996a-9b5f05f1680f\', \'multiverseId\': 400871}, \'multiverseid\': 400871}, {\'name\': \'Громоносная Виверна\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)ПолетДругие существа с Полетом под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': \'Грому не всегда сопутствует ливень. Иногда ему сопутствует погибель.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62d192e8-0d68-44ed-ae4a-5a87be90f0df\', \'multiverseId\': 401148}, \'multiverseid\': 401148}, {\'name\': \'雷鸣蜿龙\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）飞行由你操控且具飞行异能的其他生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'打雷不一定下雨。有时它意味着毁灭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f6c631d-c581-49ad-a7ae-874ea80cd249\', \'multiverseId\': 398932}, \'multiverseid\': 398932}, {\'name\': \'雷鳴蜿龍\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）飛行由你操控且具飛行異能的其他生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍獸\', \'flavor\': \'打雷不一定下雨。有時它意味著毀滅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c31f6d2-5edf-467e-968c-1ad69a0e806d\', \'multiverseId\': 399209}, \'multiverseid\': 399209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornbogenschütze\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Dornbogenschütze angreift, verliert jeder Gegner, der keinen Elfen kontrolliert, 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde nicht ruhen, ehe diese Augenweh-Pest aus diesen Wäldern getilgt ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399238&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b5def1-d0a0-477d-888b-07f2b7a5c07d\', \'multiverseId\': 399238}, \'multiverseid\': 399238}, {\'name\': \'Tirador arco de espinas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Tirador arco de espinas ataque, cada oponente que no controla un Elfo pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No descansaré hasta que el hedor de las desgracias visuales sea erradicado de estos bosques".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92156fdc-1068-4ba4-a7be-bd800be5bbcd\', \'multiverseId\': 401177}, \'multiverseid\': 401177}, {\'name\': "Archer à l\'arc épineux", \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Archer à l\'arc épineux attaque, chaque adversaire qui ne contrôle pas d\'elfe perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et archer\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne prendrai pas de repos tant que la puanteur des dysmèles ne sera pas éradiquée de ces bois. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b504c6-002e-44fa-8859-3c67b71b46fd\', \'multiverseId\': 399515}, \'multiverseid\': 399515}, {\'name\': \'Arciere Arcospinoso\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Arciere Arcospinoso attacca, ogni avversario che non controlla un Elfo perde 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non avrò pace finché il fetore dei mal\\\'occhi non verrà estirpato da questi boschi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2678da2-f3e7-47ef-a8f8-fbebb1fafe80\', \'multiverseId\': 399792}, \'multiverseid\': 399792}, {\'name\': \'茨弓の射手\', \'text\': \'茨弓の射手が攻撃するたび、エルフをコントロールしていない各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・射手\', \'flavor\': \'「この森から眼腐りの悪臭が根絶されるまで、私に休息の時はない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be8f1ef7-91dd-4e7b-aef8-233b20f74fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 400069}, \'multiverseid\': 400069}, {\'name\': \'가시활 궁수\', \'text\': \'가시활 궁수가 공격할 때마다, 엘프를 조종하지 않는 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 궁수\', \'flavor\': \'"이 숲에서 추물들이 박멸될 때까지 내게 휴식은 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d7531d-6026-44dd-817c-85fa339e4284\', \'multiverseId\': 400346}, \'multiverseid\': 400346}, {\'name\': \'Arqueiro do Arco Espinhoso\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Arqueiro do Arco Espinhoso ataca, cada oponente que não controla um Elfo perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não descansarei até que o fedor dos seca-olhos tenha sido erradicado da floresta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98ce781-249f-4e8d-91c6-10fea0f90fa1\', \'multiverseId\': 400623}, \'multiverseid\': 400623}, {\'name\': \'Стрелок с Терновым Луком\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Стрелок с Терновым Луком атакует, каждый оппонент, под контролем которого нет Эльфа, теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не успокоюсь, пока мерзкие порчеглазы не будут истреблены в этих лесах до последнего».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6669e796-a88a-4c35-9225-7beb3da4ecff\', \'multiverseId\': 400900}, \'multiverseid\': 400900}, {\'name\': \'棘弓射手\', \'text\': \'每当棘弓射手攻击时，每位未操控妖精的对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「直到完全清除树林中碍眼臭味之前，我绝不休息。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e06d1b80-a8d0-429d-aafb-9454c10a7a55\', \'multiverseId\': 398684}, \'multiverseid\': 398684}, {\'name\': \'棘弓射手\', \'text\': \'每當棘弓射手攻擊時，每位未操控妖精的對手各失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「直到完全清除樹林中礙眼臭味之前，我絕不休息。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c25feb-f163-4d65-a8f0-e4d79bb2ceda\', \'multiverseId\': 398961}, \'multiverseid\': 398961}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenfutter\', \'text\': \'Bringe zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins wandern immer zu zweit zu den Gipfeln der Opferung, damit der gelegentliche Überlebende vom Untergang des anderen berichten kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc8f1a7-b3b0-4659-a354-31d9e0f89f41\', \'multiverseId\': 399478}, \'multiverseid\': 399478}, {\'name\': \'Carnada para dragones\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos viajan a los picos de sacrificio en parejas, de manera tal que si hay un superviviente pueda contar los detalles del fallecimiento del otro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2034bf2d-bfc9-4a5d-9657-85b8e271e9c7\', \'multiverseId\': 401417}, \'multiverseid\': 401417}, {\'name\': \'Chair à dragon\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les gobelins se rendent sur les pics sacrificiels par deux pour que l\'éventuel survivant puisse relater les détails de l\'horrible fin de l\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399755&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1809a872-05bc-4f45-bf54-e9509ac4d6e0\', \'multiverseId\': 399755}, \'multiverseid\': 399755}, {\'name\': \'Spuntino del Drago\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I goblin viaggiano fino alle vette sacrificali in coppia così che i rari sopravvissuti siano in grado di riferire i dettagli della macabra dipartita del compagno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2605e922-26a6-4f42-8772-cb84e4d8871d\', \'multiverseId\': 400032}, \'multiverseid\': 400032}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの餌\', \'text\': \'赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'贄の峠へと旅に出るとき、ゴブリンは必ず二人で行く。稀に、生き残った方が、もう一方の悲惨な最期を語ることができるかもしれないからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b22f28-83a5-4c74-86ff-a7d234b2b3f5\', \'multiverseId\': 400309}, \'multiverseid\': 400309}, {\'name\': \'용의 먹이\', \'text\': \'1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'고블린들은 희생의 봉우리로 갈 때는 꼭 짝을 지어서 움직인다. 혹시라도 한 명이 살아남았을 경우 죽은 쪽의 최후를 상세히 전달하기 위해서다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c6f75c-084a-456c-a1c5-5b2178df8d71\', \'multiverseId\': 400586}, \'multiverseid\': 400586}, {\'name\': \'Forragem de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura vermelhas 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os goblins viajam para o pico do sacrifício em pares, para que os raros sobreviventes possam relatar os detalhes da morte dolorosa de seu par.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25df8923-d457-4b97-b1a8-81ddb5c9fd76\', \'multiverseId\': 400863}, \'multiverseid\': 400863}, {\'name\': \'Драконий Корм\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Гоблины всегда отправляются к местам жертвоприношения парами, чтобы выживший счастливчик смог поведать о страшной кончине товарища.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce93458-47d3-47ec-ad24-f395d02db84a\', \'multiverseId\': 401140}, \'multiverseid\': 401140}, {\'name\': \'巨龙食粮\', \'text\': \'将两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪前往牺牲山峰的旅程总是两两结伴同行，好让极幸运的生还者能讲述另一人的悲惨死法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d66309-7d27-41f2-856b-e64e09c501d0\', \'multiverseId\': 398924}, \'multiverseid\': 398924}, {\'name\': \'巨龍食糧\', \'text\': \'將兩個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪前往犧牲山峰的旅程總是兩兩結伴同行，好讓極幸運的生還者能講述另一人的悲慘死法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61f15fed-0220-49c4-af3d-b648aa7fdba0\', \'multiverseId\': 399201}, \'multiverseid\': 399201}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dwynen, Güldenlaub-Daen\', \'text\': \'ReichweiteAndere Elf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.Immer wenn Dwynen, Güldenlaub-Daen, angreift, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt für jeden angreifenden Elfen, den du kontrollierst, dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Dies ist unser Land. Wir werden dem Augenweh nicht gestatten, seine Schönheit zu vergiften."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f15490c2-19f4-4035-9b65-d260567c1e6b\', \'multiverseId\': 399377}, \'multiverseid\': 399377}, {\'name\': \'Dwynen, daena de Hojas Doradas\', \'text\': \'Alcance.Las otras criaturas Elfo que controlas obtienen +1/+1.Siempre que Dwynen, daena de Hojas Doradas ataque, ganas 1 vida por cada Elfo atacante que controles.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta es nuestra tierra. No permitiremos que las desgracias visuales envenenen su belleza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c188454-8a07-4a07-a386-ce98d913c8d3\', \'multiverseId\': 401316}, \'multiverseid\': 401316}, {\'name\': \'Dwynen, daen de Feuilledor\', \'text\': \'PortéeLes autres créatures Elfe que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.À chaque fois que Dwynen, daen de Feuilledor attaque, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque elfe attaquant que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Cette terre nous appartient. Nous ne laisserons pas les dysmèles ternir sa beauté. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399654&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f252d72-9b85-4493-aff2-0dea17f6e448\', \'multiverseId\': 399654}, \'multiverseid\': 399654}, {\'name\': \'Dwynen, Daen di Foglia Dorata\', \'text\': \'RaggiungereLe altre creature Elfo che controlli prendono +1/+1.Ogniqualvolta Dwynen, Daen di Foglia Dorata attacca, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni Elfo attaccante che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa è la nostra terra. Non permetteremo ai mal\\\'occhi di deturpare la sua bellezza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d7aa5e4-657e-4bcc-832d-ea8886032f36\', \'multiverseId\': 399931}, \'multiverseid\': 399931}, {\'name\': \'光り葉の将帥、ドゥイネン\', \'text\': \'到達あなたがコントロールする他のエルフ・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。光り葉の将帥、ドゥイネンが攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールする攻撃しているエルフ１体につき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「ここは我々の土地だ。眼腐りにその美しさを毒させるわけにはいかぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd7cc1e-6055-40cb-8853-b55359d2abf4\', \'multiverseId\': 400208}, \'multiverseid\': 400208}, {\'name\': \'금박나뭇잎의 다엔, 드위넨\', \'text\': \'대공당신이 조종하는 다른 엘프 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.금박나뭇잎의 다엔, 드위넨이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 공격중인 엘프 생물 한 개당 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"여긴 우리 땅이다. 추물들이 이 땅을 망치도록 두지 않겠다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'514b8fd2-cdcd-46d5-9850-9b8819613e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 400485}, \'multiverseid\': 400485}, {\'name\': "Dwynen, Daen de Folha D\'Ouro", \'text\': "AlcanceAs outras criaturas do tipo Elfo que você controla recebem +1/+1.Toda vez que Dwynen, Daen de Folha D\'Ouro, ataca, você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada Elfo atacante que você controla.", \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta é a nossa terra. Não permitiremos que seca-olhos profanem sua beleza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62657716-22b2-4198-a255-1178a65c67e3\', \'multiverseId\': 400762}, \'multiverseid\': 400762}, {\'name\': \'Двайнен, Даэн Златолесья\', \'text\': \'ЗахватДругие существа-Эльфы под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.Каждый раз, когда Двайнен, Даэн Златолесья атакует, вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждого атакующего Эльфа под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Это наша земля. Мы не позволим порчеглазам осквернять ее красоту».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141a5c57-85b8-4eed-b7ec-43c73ba79111\', \'multiverseId\': 401039}, \'multiverseid\': 401039}, {\'name\': \'金叶猎领德维恩\', \'text\': \'延势由你操控的其他妖精生物得+1/+1。每当金叶猎领德维恩攻击时，你每操控一个进行攻击的妖精，便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「这是我们的土地。我们不允许碍眼荼毒它的美丽。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86111e17-7805-463d-952f-b8dfd23f516c\', \'multiverseId\': 398823}, \'multiverseid\': 398823}, {\'name\': \'金葉獵領德維恩\', \'text\': \'延勢由你操控的其他妖精生物得+1/+1。每當金葉獵領德維恩攻擊時，你每操控一個進行攻擊的妖精，便獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～妖精／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「這是我們的土地，我們不允許礙眼荼毒它的美麗。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76169a9-f085-46ab-a4ee-61f33acd854a\', \'multiverseId\': 399100}, \'multiverseid\': 399100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dwynens Elitekrieger\', \'text\': \'Wenn Dwynens Elitekrieger ins Spiel kommen und falls du einen anderen Elfen kontrollierst, bringe einen 1/1 grünen (Elf, Krieger)-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Kommt, meine entzückenden Brüder und Schwestern. Lasst uns jagen."—Dwynen, Güldenlaub-Daen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399440&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0242b0b-240c-4ff9-9f4d-02f99cf81b97\', \'multiverseId\': 399440}, \'multiverseid\': 399440}, {\'name\': \'Élite de Dwynen\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Élite de Dwynen entre al campo de batalla, si controlas otro Elfo, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vengan, mis bellos hermanos y hermanas. Cacemos".—Dwynen, daena de Hojas Doradas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbfe5d3d-73ea-4a1c-8bc6-95fc5abdaba0\', \'multiverseId\': 401379}, \'multiverseid\': 401379}, {\'name\': \'Élite de Dwynen\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Élite de Dwynen arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez un autre elfe, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Venez, frères et sœurs de beauté. Partons chasser. »—Dwynen, daen de Feuilledor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bead921f-fbf8-473c-b3ee-14c6441cf013\', \'multiverseId\': 399717}, \'multiverseid\': 399717}, {\'name\': \'Elite di Dwynen\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elite di Dwynen entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli un altro Elfo, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Venite, miei splendidi fratelli e sorelle. Andiamo a caccia."—Dwynen, Daen di Foglia Dorata\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'347c3d1f-a0ea-4f80-8299-9e9139531e36\', \'multiverseId\': 399994}, \'multiverseid\': 399994}, {\'name\': \'ドゥイネンの精鋭\', \'text\': \'ドゥイネンの精鋭が戦場に出たとき、あなたが他のエルフをコントロールしている場合、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「さあ、美しき我が兄弟姉妹よ。これより狩りを始めよう。」――光り葉の将帥、ドゥイネン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a2e6f0d-c1c5-43b0-b1c1-9d91088c2447\', \'multiverseId\': 400271}, \'multiverseid\': 400271}, {\'name\': \'드위넨의 정예병\', \'text\': \'드위넨의 정예병이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 다른 엘프를 조종한다면, 1/1 녹색 엘프 전사 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"아름다운 형제 자매들이여, 사냥을 시작하자."—금박나뭇잎의 다엔, 드위넨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2c537f-3791-4a1c-964e-898b43dce4c6\', \'multiverseId\': 400548}, \'multiverseid\': 400548}, {\'name\': \'Elite de Dwynen\', \'text\': \'Quando Elite de Dwynen entrar no campo de batalha, se você controlar outro Elfo, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Elfo Guerreiro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Venham, meus belos irmãos e irmãs. Vamos caçar."— Dwynen, Daen de Folha D\\\'Ouro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af2b8f8-5810-4ebb-aa18-980302aa24b9\', \'multiverseId\': 400825}, \'multiverseid\': 400825}, {\'name\': \'Отборные Бойцы Двайнен\', \'text\': \'Когда Отборные Бойцы Двайнен выходят на поле битвы, если вы контролируете другого Эльфа, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Эльф Воин.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Вперед, мои дивные братья и сестры. Поохотимся».— Двайнен, даэн Златолесья\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba1891de-b504-48e5-9dd2-d972f752ce56\', \'multiverseId\': 401102}, \'multiverseid\': 401102}, {\'name\': \'德维恩的精兵\', \'text\': \'当德维恩的精兵进战场时，若你操控另一个妖精，则将一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「来吧，我美丽的兄弟姐妹。一起狩猎吧。」～金叶猎领德维恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'186e6f23-88d3-4b8b-846d-60a7ecbb9d34\', \'multiverseId\': 398886}, \'multiverseid\': 398886}, {\'name\': \'德維恩的精兵\', \'text\': \'當德維恩的精兵進戰場時，若你操控另一個妖精，則將一個1/1綠色妖精／戰士衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「來吧，我美麗的兄弟姐妹。一起狩獵吧。」～金葉獵領德維恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a749046d-f65c-4feb-a2bb-674cb54c4458\', \'multiverseId\': 399163}, \'multiverseid\': 399163}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerwald-Alphatier\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, geblockt wird, erhält sie +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.{1}{G}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann beim Angreifen überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399457&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4478a67f-3b02-49f4-bc76-5b0940e871e4\', \'multiverseId\': 399457}, \'multiverseid\': 399457}, {\'name\': \'Alfa de Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas sea bloqueada, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.{1}{G}: La criatura objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno. (Puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker defensor mientras ataca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eda3c29-3bdb-42c6-93d2-35f21b2378b9\', \'multiverseId\': 401396}, \'multiverseid\': 401396}, {\'name\': \'Alpha de Somberwald\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez devient bloquée, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.{1}{G} : La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker défenseur quand elle attaque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be170d6f-ff3b-4afc-acaa-3963b85c7837\', \'multiverseId\': 399734}, \'multiverseid\': 399734}, {\'name\': \'Capobranco di Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli viene bloccata, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.{1}{G}: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno. (Può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso a un giocatore in difesa o a un planeswalker mentre attacca.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f93d146-1bc9-4749-a913-24762eb395a4\', \'multiverseId\': 400011}, \'multiverseid\': 400011}, {\'name\': \'ソンバーワルドの頭目\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体がブロックされた状態になるたび、ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。{1}{G}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルを得る。（攻撃しているそれは余剰の戦闘ダメージを防御プレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f352c2-cbe2-4f6e-80bd-6be7b6c6cd30\', \'multiverseId\': 400288}, \'multiverseid\': 400288}, {\'name\': \'솜버왈드 우두머리\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이 방어될 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.{1}{G}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다. (그 생물은 공격할 때 수비플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 여분의 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02596a42-e04a-4b6b-b485-90346cd3a999\', \'multiverseId\': 400565}, \'multiverseid\': 400565}, {\'name\': \'Alfa de Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla é bloqueada, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.{1}{G}: A criatura alvo que você controla ganha atropelar até o final do turno. (Seu dano de combate excedente pode ser causado ao planeswalker ou ao jogador defensor ao atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45de1bd-9d1b-4092-a4de-90e8d95ff131\', \'multiverseId\': 400842}, \'multiverseid\': 400842}, {\'name\': \'Сомбервальдский Вожак\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем становится заблокированным, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода.{1}{G}: целевое существо под вашим контролем получает Пробивной удар до конца хода. (Атакуя, оно может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения защищающемуся игроку или planeswalker-у.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e96fc5-4eae-464b-9def-a5e9682c2ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 401119}, \'multiverseid\': 401119}, {\'name\': \'松柏森首领\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物被阻挡时，它得+1/+1直到回合结束。{1}{G}：目标由你操控的生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。（它攻击时造成之过量战斗伤害能对防御牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef637d6-ab65-4d2d-ab9f-796afd50b76e\', \'multiverseId\': 398903}, \'multiverseid\': 398903}, {\'name\': \'松柏森首領\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物被阻擋時，它得+1/+1直到回合結束。{1}{G}：目標由你操控的生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。（它攻擊時造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對防禦玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113054a4-d160-419d-bd70-33328ac24023\', \'multiverseId\': 399180}, \'multiverseid\': 399180}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonischer Pakt\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eines, das noch nicht bestimmt wurde —• Der Dämonische Pakt fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu, und du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.• Ein Gegner deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten ab.• Ziehe zwei Karten.• Du verlierst die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a79476-495f-499a-b9ec-88608df96708\', \'multiverseId\': 399264}, \'multiverseid\': 399264}, {\'name\': \'Pacto demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, elige uno que no haya sido elegido:• El Pacto demoníaco hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo y tú ganas 4 vidas.• El oponente objetivo descarta dos cartas.• Roba dos cartas.• Pierdes el juego.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25c8ead3-1981-430f-aa39-87057e9acf89\', \'multiverseId\': 401203}, \'multiverseid\': 401203}, {\'name\': \'Pacte démoniaque\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, choisissez l\'un qui n\'a pas été choisi —• Le Pacte démoniaque inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur, et vous gagnez 4 points de vie.• L\'adversaire ciblé se défausse de deux cartes.• Piochez deux cartes.• Vous perdez la partie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a588fd1-34cd-495e-b874-5539a5cd80d5\', \'multiverseId\': 399541}, \'multiverseid\': 399541}, {\'name\': \'Patto Demoniaco\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, scegli uno che non è stato scelto —• Il Patto Demoniaco infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio e tu guadagni 4 punti vita.• Un avversario bersaglio scarta due carte.• Pesca due carte.• Perdi la partita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f358c36-8dd1-4093-a927-3d92683a1e06\', \'multiverseId\': 399818}, \'multiverseid\': 399818}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の契約\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、以下からまだ選ばれていないもの１つを選ぶ。・クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。悪魔の契約はそれに４点のダメージを与え、あなたは４点のライフを得る。・対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚捨てる。・カードを２枚引く。・あなたはこのゲームに敗北する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14b008af-9fdd-49e1-8b4b-2531909b923d\', \'multiverseId\': 400095}, \'multiverseid\': 400095}, {\'name\': \'악마와의 계약\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 아직 선택하지 않은 하나를 선택한다 —• 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 악마와의 계약은 그 목표에 피해 4점을 입히고 당신은 생명 4점을 얻는다.• 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 카드 두 장을 버린다.• 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.• 당신이 게임에서 패배한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baf32e05-ccc2-437d-8fed-7f18aa673ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 400372}, \'multiverseid\': 400372}, {\'name\': \'Pacto Demoníaco\', \'text\': \'No início da sua manutenção, escolha um que não tenha sido escolhido —• Pacto Demoníaco causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo e você ganha 4 pontos de vida.• O oponente alvo descarta dois cards.• Compre dois cards.• Você perde o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c97b0c30-1aee-4c1a-b32b-0919b356f9de\', \'multiverseId\': 400649}, \'multiverseid\': 400649}, {\'name\': \'Договор с Демонами\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки выберите одно то, что еще не было выбрано —• Договор с Демонами наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу или игроку, а вы получаете 4 жизни.• Целевой оппонент сбрасывает две карты.• Возьмите две карты.• Вы проигрываете партию.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd46737-6099-4f33-9537-06adb82f73d7\', \'multiverseId\': 400926}, \'multiverseid\': 400926}, {\'name\': \'恶魔契约\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，选择一项，且不得是此前选过的～• 恶魔契约对目标生物或牌手造成4点伤害且你获得4点生命。• 目标对手弃两张牌。• 抓两张牌。• 你输掉这盘游戏。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a7dda45-e3c9-46a1-8b48-924cca97385e\', \'multiverseId\': 398710}, \'multiverseid\': 398710}, {\'name\': \'惡魔契約\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，選擇一項，且不得是此前選過的～• 惡魔契約對目標生物或玩家造成4點傷害且你獲得4點生命。• 目標對手棄兩張牌。• 抽兩張牌。• 你輸掉這盤遊戲。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8beaf473-9156-45c8-904f-8a5cff31d291\', \'multiverseId\': 398987}, \'multiverseid\': 398987}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düstere Experimentierfreude\', \'text\': \'Regeneriere eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Ziehe eine Karte. (Das nächste Mal, dass diese Kreatur in diesem Zug zerstört würde, wird sie nicht zerstört. Tappe sie stattdessen, entferne allen Schaden von ihr und entferne sie aus dem Kampf.)Zauberkunst — Falls sich zwei oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexerei-Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, regeneriere außerdem alle anderen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399297&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46aed20e-4ce0-4872-a4b1-44a712aecf55\', \'multiverseId\': 399297}, \'multiverseid\': 399297}, {\'name\': \'Experimentos oscuros\', \'text\': \'Regenera la criatura objetivo. Roba una carta. (La próxima vez que esta criatura fuera a ser destruida este turno, no lo es. En vez de eso, gírala, remueve todo el daño de ella y remuévela del combate.)Dominio de hechizos — Si hay dos o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, regenera también cada una de las otras criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'346f36fa-27d9-4e59-a8d8-fbf7a2525a91\', \'multiverseId\': 401236}, \'multiverseid\': 401236}, {\'name\': \'Obscure expérimentation\', \'text\': "Régénérez la créature ciblée. Piochez une carte. (La prochaine fois que cette créature devrait être détruite ce tour-ci, elle ne l\'est pas. À la place, engagez-la, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et retirez-la du combat.)Maîtrise de sort — S\'il y a au moins deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, régénérez aussi chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399574&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1baa3784-c7e3-4654-ac0f-4b4f4dc7038f\', \'multiverseId\': 399574}, \'multiverseid\': 399574}, {\'name\': \'Oscuro Diletto\', \'text\': \'Rigenera una creatura bersaglio. Pesca una carta. (La prossima volta che la creatura sta per essere distrutta in questo turno, non viene distrutta. Invece TAPpala, rimuovi da essa tutto il danno e rimuovila dal combattimento.)Arte magica — Se nel tuo cimitero ci sono due o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, rigenera anche ogni altra creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14455a90-bf9c-4c7f-85b4-f8d5f44346e7\', \'multiverseId\': 399851}, \'multiverseid\': 399851}, {\'name\': \'闇の試み\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを再生する。カードを１枚引く。（このターン、次にそのクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、破壊されない。代わりに、それをタップし、ダメージをすべて取り除き、戦闘から取り除く。）魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタント・カードやソーサリー・カードが合わせて２枚以上あるなら、あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーもそれぞれ再生する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0a4a553-41a2-4b42-b834-82f6285a3805\', \'multiverseId\': 400128}, \'multiverseid\': 400128}, {\'name\': \'음험한 시도\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 재생한다. 카드 한 장을 뽑는다. (이 턴에 다음으로 이 생물이 파괴되어야 할 경우에 이 생물은 파괴되지 않는다. 대신에 이 생물을 탭하고 전투에서 제거하며, 이 생물로부터 모든 피해를 제거한다.)주문 숙련 — 당신의 무덤에 집중마법 그리고/또는 순간마법 카드가 두 장 이상 있다면, 당신이 조종하는 다른 각 생물들도 재생한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb2b4d6-b6e8-41bd-8218-67eb2ed12218\', \'multiverseId\': 400405}, \'multiverseid\': 400405}, {\'name\': \'Experimentação Sombria\', \'text\': \'Regenere a criatura alvo. Compre um card. (Na próxima vez em que a criatura seria destruída neste turno, ela não será. Em vez disso, vire-a, remova todo o dano dela e remova-a do combate.)Maestria em magia — Se houver dois ou mais cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço no seu cemitério, também regenere todas as outras criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdef08a2-56c5-409e-af6d-efa82e965a57\', \'multiverseId\': 400682}, \'multiverseid\': 400682}, {\'name\': \'Темное Орошение\', \'text\': \'Регенерируйте целевое существо. Возьмите карту. (В следующий раз при уничтожении того существа в этом ходу оно не уничтожается. Вместо этого поверните его, снимите с него все повреждения и удалите его из боя.)Мастерство заклинаний — Если на вашем кладбище есть не менее двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и (или) волшебства, также регенерируйте каждое другое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d10d298-bff8-4661-8c33-548124842ee1\', \'multiverseId\': 400959}, \'multiverseid\': 400959}, {\'name\': \'暗法小试\', \'text\': \'重生目标生物。抓一张牌。（如果该生物下一次于本回合中将被消灭，则它不会被消灭，而是改为将它横置，移除受过的所有伤害，并将它移出战斗。）精熟咒语～如果你坟墓场中有两张或更多的瞬间和／或法术牌，则再重生每个由你操控的其他生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0769b9-05ca-45a5-90af-a622167deaac\', \'multiverseId\': 398743}, \'multiverseid\': 398743}, {\'name\': \'暗法小試\', \'text\': \'重生目標生物。抽一張牌。（如果此生物下一次於本回合中將被消滅，則它不會被消滅。而是改為將它橫置，移除受過的所有傷害，並將它移出戰鬥。）精熟咒語～如果你墳墓場中有兩張或更多的瞬間和／或巫術牌，則再重生每個由你操控的其他生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d0209bd-791e-4a35-a4dc-edd8725add09\', \'multiverseId\': 399020}, \'multiverseid\': 399020}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399365&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4330915-689f-495b-a584-d2f12a278c53', 'multiverseId': 399365}, 'multiverseid': 399365}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401304&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c568d31c-1376-457f-95e0-315d9efc988e', 'multiverseId': 401304}, 'multiverseid': 401304}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399642&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84b3c323-dba8-4671-b796-66fb5e250100', 'multiverseId': 399642}, 'multiverseid': 399642}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399919&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c50be64f-b1ea-47d9-8287-029ff2c4b9cf', 'multiverseId': 399919}, 'multiverseid': 399919}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400196&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '162d0450-3f77-42fc-9d81-2d208cd9c69d', 'multiverseId': 400196}, 'multiverseid': 400196}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400473&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ca546a0-6650-4791-bfa0-9e47370294b0', 'multiverseId': 400473}, 'multiverseid': 400473}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400750&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bed2270-15e7-488f-8bef-a03973f959ab', 'multiverseId': 400750}, 'multiverseid': 400750}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401027&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '139967d5-a921-4824-9765-6a7330111273', 'multiverseId': 401027}, 'multiverseid': 401027}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398811&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6804bc90-dffd-44e7-a163-25248356549e', 'multiverseId': 398811}, 'multiverseid': 398811}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399088&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '367b559f-c43a-47fb-8f38-d9dbf004dffb', 'multiverseId': 399088}, 'multiverseid': 399088}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399372&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f71577e-3527-425c-9026-786f270b5f12', 'multiverseId': 399372}, 'multiverseid': 399372}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401311&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bc1d431-feb8-4f3e-8f76-88ff6fbdc098', 'multiverseId': 401311}, 'multiverseid': 401311}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399649&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddc84105-4780-4d2c-9d12-340f958980d3', 'multiverseId': 399649}, 'multiverseid': 399649}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399926&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de5de266-67c2-4536-9ce7-eed16824c511', 'multiverseId': 399926}, 'multiverseid': 399926}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400203&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbbee89a-3f07-4a09-9afb-fe0a326ce234', 'multiverseId': 400203}, 'multiverseid': 400203}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400480&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '524e9b17-b5a8-4ce8-b307-ca3c3bfefaf2', 'multiverseId': 400480}, 'multiverseid': 400480}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400757&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '004cc1e6-47cb-49c3-919a-98b7397418d4', 'multiverseId': 400757}, 'multiverseid': 400757}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401034&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1cd9acc-9256-431a-8ef4-6ff50a0f31d1', 'multiverseId': 401034}, 'multiverseid': 401034}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398818&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c79f1bb5-763f-4c10-b0cb-7c3f333aec82', 'multiverseId': 398818}, 'multiverseid': 398818}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399095&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a351a7bc-f608-4751-9e6d-80f6d7e7569b', 'multiverseId': 399095}, 'multiverseid': 399095}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399381&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81959802-5edb-4313-ab06-386545d574e5', 'multiverseId': 399381}, 'multiverseid': 399381}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401320&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b89d1d9f-25f0-416e-b701-e5c9da1644e5', 'multiverseId': 401320}, 'multiverseid': 401320}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399658&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f05404a-cadc-418c-85d7-79099cc2a819', 'multiverseId': 399658}, 'multiverseid': 399658}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399935&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf3d1c49-26c0-4e75-a79f-ac174cfec6b1', 'multiverseId': 399935}, 'multiverseid': 399935}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400212&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c2c5e03-3359-4619-aae0-718efc960eb9', 'multiverseId': 400212}, 'multiverseid': 400212}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400489&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34e347bf-fd28-4799-87a8-db314a20de0a', 'multiverseId': 400489}, 'multiverseid': 400489}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400766&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30a08592-4e92-4589-aa68-cf0c3467835e', 'multiverseId': 400766}, 'multiverseid': 400766}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401043&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8e48c93-8879-481d-bb46-0b154e0895d5', 'multiverseId': 401043}, 'multiverseid': 401043}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398827&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de67899f-ae4d-4073-b3f8-9398063e581f', 'multiverseId': 398827}, 'multiverseid': 398827}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399104&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33d8cb73-4b43-41ea-aeb7-bae5863f6efc', 'multiverseId': 399104}, 'multiverseid': 399104}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399506&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3209941b-933e-4c04-80b3-e38a051a0ca9', 'multiverseId': 399506}, 'multiverseid': 399506}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401445&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb3f5b29-f787-4112-bdb7-cf5af1f0878b', 'multiverseId': 401445}, 'multiverseid': 401445}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399783&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3493c0d6-4b2c-4646-b447-9d48d28d2be2', 'multiverseId': 399783}, 'multiverseid': 399783}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400060&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd9ba224-d160-4d32-a4f9-ccacd4ff3130', 'multiverseId': 400060}, 'multiverseid': 400060}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400337&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '244cf66b-8f76-4581-8139-7281ffa901aa', 'multiverseId': 400337}, 'multiverseid': 400337}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400614&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78794fd2-9223-4b3f-a0d0-13b1535db25d', 'multiverseId': 400614}, 'multiverseid': 400614}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400891&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f595d771-a84c-4d00-8aab-87a79fe31c00', 'multiverseId': 400891}, 'multiverseid': 400891}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401168&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59afe6e2-16e2-4b83-a5e3-526e67e93be1', 'multiverseId': 401168}, 'multiverseid': 401168}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398952&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c3a0572-3ccb-4b7a-9adc-fb83966e6408', 'multiverseId': 398952}, 'multiverseid': 398952}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399229&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bbd3953-497b-48e0-9f47-18a3dc3aa17e', 'multiverseId': 399229}, 'multiverseid': 399229}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eingespannter Ochse\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ochse\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Kornfeldern, nicht auf Schlachtfeldern war es, wo die Auserwählte lernte, den Göttern zu dienen. Sie bearbeitete das Land lange bevor der Ruf an sie erging, es zu verteidigen.—Die Theriaden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f487ad5-bc3a-4a59-82cd-3396ac954197\', \'multiverseId\': 399502}, \'multiverseid\': 399502}, {\'name\': \'Buey sometido\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Buey\', \'flavor\': \'Fue en campos de grano, y no de batalla, donde la Campeona aprendió a soportar el yugo del deber hacia los dioses. Trabajó la tierra mucho antes de ser llamada a defenderla.—La Theríada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9095ef2-82d5-44c0-9131-5db17184be62\', \'multiverseId\': 401441}, \'multiverseid\': 401441}, {\'name\': \'Buffle attelé\', \'type\': \'Créature : bovidé\', \'flavor\': "Ce n\'est pas sur le champ de bataille, mais dans les champs de blé, que la Championne apprit à accomplir son devoir envers les dieux. Elle travailla la terre bien avant d\'être amenée à la défendre.—La Thériade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9afcc71-57f2-45bc-b604-b0c59ee0083a\', \'multiverseId\': 399779}, \'multiverseid\': 399779}, {\'name\': \'Bue col Giogo\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bue\', \'flavor\': \'Fu nei campi di grano e non nei campi di battaglia che la Campionessa imparò a sostenere il giogo del dovere verso gli dei. Lavorò la terra ben prima di essere chiamata a difenderla.—La Theriade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e12952e-c900-4de8-8900-6049bd39aa36\', \'multiverseId\': 400056}, \'multiverseid\': 400056}, {\'name\': \'鋤引きの雄牛\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 雄牛\', \'flavor\': \'女勇者が自ら背負う神々への義務を履行することを学んだ場所は、戦場ではなく穀物畑であった。彼女は大地を守るために呼ばれる遥か前から耕していたのであった。――「テーリアス」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf73f7d-04d2-47ac-9719-89fe77891e60\', \'multiverseId\': 400333}, \'multiverseid\': 400333}, {\'name\': \'멍에 씌운 황소\', \'type\': \'생물 — 황소\', \'flavor\': \'영웅이 신들에게 순종하는 법을 배운 곳은 전장이 아니라 논밭이었다. 그녀는 신들의 부름을 받아 고향 땅을 지키기 훨씬 전부터 바로 그 땅에서 농사를 지으며 살아왔다.—테리아드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f3c2686-0912-4856-8b4b-6aa40eeff714\', \'multiverseId\': 400610}, \'multiverseid\': 400610}, {\'name\': \'Boi Jungido\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Boi\', \'flavor\': \'Foi nos campos de colheita, e não nos de batalha, que a Campeã aprendeu a suportar o jugo da devoção aos deuses. Ela trabalhou na terra muito antes de ser chamada a defendê-la.— A Teríada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7fa981-d94f-4396-bda6-54de3bc5a621\', \'multiverseId\': 400887}, \'multiverseid\': 400887}, {\'name\': \'Бык под Ярмом\', \'type\': \'Существо — Бык\', \'flavor\': \'Поборница училась нести ярмо служения богам не на поле битвы, а на хлебном поле. Она вспахивала землю задолго до того, как была призвана ее защищать.— Териада\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67bc855f-da7d-4c22-8fd9-2179a906a3c7\', \'multiverseId\': 401164}, \'multiverseid\': 401164}, {\'name\': \'负轭牛\', \'type\': \'生物～牛\', \'flavor\': \'天尊领受天降重任之时，还只是耕耘田间的一介凡夫俗子，不知征战沙场为何物。在她受神所托、挺身捍卫家园之前，她已在这片土地上劳作多载。～《塞洛亚特》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53979303-eb17-4a04-bedf-3fd9af01bc67\', \'multiverseId\': 398948}, \'multiverseid\': 398948}, {\'name\': \'負軛牛\', \'type\': \'生物～牛\', \'flavor\': \'天尊領受天降重任之時，還只是耕耘田間的一介凡夫俗子，不知征戰沙場為何物。在她受神所託、挺身捍衛家園之前，她已在這片土地上勞作多載。～《塞洛亞特》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ffb3791-3d85-4b93-9ea1-f95a84ad5f10\', \'multiverseId\': 399225}, \'multiverseid\': 399225}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einschläfern\', \'text\': \'Tappe bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.Zauberkunst — Falls sich zwei oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexerei-Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, enttappen diese Kreaturen nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihrer Beherrscher.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931caf10-886a-4543-aace-daa8688c878f\', \'multiverseId\': 399376}, \'multiverseid\': 399376}, {\'name\': \'Dulces sueños\', \'text\': \'Gira hasta dos criaturas objetivo.Dominio de hechizos — Si hay dos o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, esas criaturas no se enderezan durante el próximo paso de enderezar de sus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69e3ace8-ff5d-4ce4-aee4-7177027a10f2\', \'multiverseId\': 401315}, \'multiverseid\': 401315}, {\'name\': \'Plonger dans le sommeil\', \'text\': "Engagez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées.Maîtrise de sort — S\'il y a au moins deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, ces créatures ne se dégagent pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de leurs contrôleurs.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399653&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0fc24e5-b493-415a-8241-c0282a9ca4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 399653}, \'multiverseid\': 399653}, {\'name\': \'Indurre il Sonno\', \'text\': \'TAPpa fino a due creature bersaglio.Arte magica — Se nel tuo cimitero ci sono due o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, quelle creature non STAPpano durante il prossimo STAP dei rispettivi controllori.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88bef069-c462-4a0b-b17b-71e4a955c1c2\', \'multiverseId\': 399930}, \'multiverseid\': 399930}, {\'name\': \'眠りへの誘い\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーを最大２体まで対象とし、それらをタップする。魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタント・カードやソーサリー・カードが合わせて２枚以上あるなら、それらのクリーチャーは、それらのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c87b2a98-9d21-4b25-baeb-57f0bda06fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 400207}, \'multiverseid\': 400207}, {\'name\': \'재우기\', \'text\': \'생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 탭한다.주문 숙련 — 당신의 무덤에 집중마법 그리고/또는 순간마법 카드가 두 장 이상 있다면, 그 생물들은 그 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d1d91e-9510-4c57-a621-a67d349a51ca\', \'multiverseId\': 400484}, \'multiverseid\': 400484}, {\'name\': \'Adormecer\', \'text\': \'Vire até duas criaturas alvo.Maestria em magia — Se houver dois ou mais cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço no seu cemitério, aquelas criaturas não serão desviradas durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08a038f-0e36-4a36-9de7-60c074bad041\', \'multiverseId\': 400761}, \'multiverseid\': 400761}, {\'name\': \'Усыпление\', \'text\': \'Поверните не более двух целевых существ.Мастерство заклинаний — Если на вашем кладбище есть не менее двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и (или) волшебства, те существа не разворачиваются во время следующих шагов разворота контролирующих их игроков.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7cf3379-37b8-47ee-812c-a5347740b8f7\', \'multiverseId\': 401038}, \'multiverseid\': 401038}, {\'name\': \'送入梦乡\', \'text\': \'横置至多两个目标生物。精熟咒语～如果你坟墓场中有两张或更多的瞬间和／或法术牌，则这些生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbb2ba50-b89d-47dc-ac3a-8ced2c530fce\', \'multiverseId\': 398822}, \'multiverseid\': 398822}, {\'name\': \'送入夢鄉\', \'text\': \'橫置至多兩個目標生物。精熟咒語～如果你墳墓場中有兩張或更多的瞬間和／或巫術牌，則這些生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b128b47-a646-423e-9ddd-d97f3217f785\', \'multiverseId\': 399099}, \'multiverseid\': 399099}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einsiedlerische Handwerkerin\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)Wenn die Einsiedlerische Handwerkerin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du sie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen, wie du Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399352&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3eba9b5-36ae-4c42-8145-6ee0693a24d2\', \'multiverseId\': 399352}, \'multiverseid\': 399352}, {\'name\': \'Artífice huraña\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entra bajo tu control.)Cuando la Artífice huraña entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que le haga una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0290f142-e20a-4fbf-b790-1e06c1504962\', \'multiverseId\': 401291}, \'multiverseid\': 401291}, {\'name\': \'Artificière recluse\', \'text\': "Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)Quand l\'Artificière recluse arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle inflige à une créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b86e94a7-991d-4d4f-9f32-76bf6aed695f\', \'multiverseId\': 399629}, \'multiverseid\': 399629}, {\'name\': \'Artefice Solitaria\', \'text\': "Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)Quando l\'Artefice Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi farle infliggere a una creatura bersaglio danno pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a10b89-c4c5-4580-bb3a-97ff86485b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 399906}, \'multiverseid\': 399906}, {\'name\': \'隠棲した工匠\', \'text\': \'速攻（このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）隠棲した工匠が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「隠棲した工匠はそれに、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクトの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f79c51fc-06fe-4ddf-afb4-e4e8875d6247\', \'multiverseId\': 400183}, \'multiverseid\': 400183}, {\'name\': \'은둔한 마법공학자\', \'text\': \'신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)은둔한 마법공학자가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 은둔한 마법공학자가 그 생물에 당신이 조종하는 마법물체의 개수만큼의 피해를 입히도록 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27021e1f-a907-46c1-9de1-a20b32305cab\', \'multiverseId\': 400460}, \'multiverseid\': 400460}, {\'name\': \'Artífice Eremita\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que passa ao seu controle.)Quando Artífice Eremita entra no campo de batalha, você pode fazer com que ele cause à criatura alvo dano igual ao número de artefatos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50fde955-06b1-41d4-9f84-3add6f71b012\', \'multiverseId\': 400737}, \'multiverseid\': 400737}, {\'name\': \'Нелюдимый Механик\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)Когда Нелюдимый Механик выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заставить его нанести целевому существу повреждения, равные количеству артефактов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee98e3c-bd04-4f14-a7ee-ceae55c56fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 401014}, \'multiverseid\': 401014}, {\'name\': \'隐居神器师\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）当隐居神器师进战场时，你可以令它对目标生物造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53da4798-3917-4e04-bf9f-b91325e19e0f\', \'multiverseId\': 398798}, \'multiverseid\': 398798}, {\'name\': \'隱居神器師\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）當隱居神器師進戰場時，你可以令它對目標生物造成傷害，其數量等同於由你操控的神器數量。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce545068-e317-43ad-bad0-b40ba78fc6a8\', \'multiverseId\': 399075}, \'multiverseid\': 399075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elementarer Bund\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur mit Stärke 3 oder mehr unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich möchte Zendikar helfen. Zeige mir den Weg."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399237&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4d360a-90fe-4b8d-bd0e-9d79593720dc\', \'multiverseId\': 399237}, \'multiverseid\': 399237}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo elemental\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura con fuerza de 3 o más entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Quiero ayudar a Zendikar. Muéstrame la manera".—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e56b02b9-244d-45f8-878d-a9804ff8c50e\', \'multiverseId\': 401176}, \'multiverseid\': 401176}, {\'name\': \'Lien élémentaire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature avec une force supérieure ou égale à 3 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Je souhaite aider Zendikar. Montre-moi la voie. »—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40243717-d157-4c8a-bfbb-3705c0325d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 399514}, \'multiverseid\': 399514}, {\'name\': \'Legame Elementale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 3 entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Desidero aiutare Zendikar. Mostrami la via."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12da12d1-570b-460a-915f-101b0aef17bc\', \'multiverseId\': 399791}, \'multiverseid\': 399791}, {\'name\': \'精霊の絆\', \'text\': \'パワーが３以上のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「私はゼンディカーの助けとなりたい。進むべき道を示して欲しい。」――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd42e0a-0702-4462-a9e6-1945ea758382\', \'multiverseId\': 400068}, \'multiverseid\': 400068}, {\'name\': \'정령과의 유대\', \'text\': \'공격력이 3 이상인 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"젠디카르를 돕고 싶어. 방법을 알려줘."—니사 레베인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aafc3451-ac74-4e68-a517-0fca9cc522a0\', \'multiverseId\': 400345}, \'multiverseid\': 400345}, {\'name\': \'Elo Elemental\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 3 entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu quero ajudar Zendikar. Mostre-me o caminho."— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546f4fda-ed9d-4af2-83af-dad610c72562\', \'multiverseId\': 400622}, \'multiverseid\': 400622}, {\'name\': \'Стихийные Узы\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо с силой 3 или больше выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Я хочу помочь Зендикару. Покажи мне, как».— Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1be2fad-6d2c-4316-872e-d3e3d148eca3\', \'multiverseId\': 400899}, \'multiverseid\': 400899}, {\'name\': \'元素羁绊\', \'text\': \'每当一个力量等于或大于3的生物在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我想帮助赞迪卡，请指引我方法。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7721629-27d2-4764-8ece-3142a309a0cc\', \'multiverseId\': 398683}, \'multiverseid\': 398683}, {\'name\': \'元素羈絆\', \'text\': \'每當一個力量等於或大於3的生物在你的操控下進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「我想幫助贊迪卡，請指引我方法。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ae0814-d1bf-434b-9073-82c4d4e629f5\', \'multiverseId\': 398960}, \'multiverseid\': 398960}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfischer Visionär\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Elfische Visionär ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Aus dem kleinsten Setzling sprießen und erblühen die größten Bäume. Mögen die Samen deines Geistes ebenso fruchtbar sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399385&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28efa01e-af44-44d2-8107-8ec27a9c67b0\', \'multiverseId\': 399385}, \'multiverseid\': 399385}, {\'name\': \'Visionaria élfica\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Visionaria élfica entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"A partir de un brote diminuto crecen y florecen los árboles más grandes. Que las semillas de tu mente sean igual de fructíferas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2214ab7-7777-4ff4-9db2-0ec560e190a1\', \'multiverseId\': 401324}, \'multiverseid\': 401324}, {\'name\': \'Visionnaire elfe\', \'text\': \'Quand la Visionnaire elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« D\'une graine minuscule peut naître un arbre immense et florissant. Puissent les graines de ton esprit être aussi prolifiques. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399662&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db6d1cd4-f3c5-4256-9f23-1e7931527b17\', \'multiverseId\': 399662}, \'multiverseid\': 399662}, {\'name\': \'Elfa Visionaria\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elfa Visionaria entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Da un piccolo germoglio, crescono e fioriscono gli alberi più grandi. Possano i semi della tua mente rivelarsi fertili in egual misura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1fdf68e-f444-4866-8f41-44c55e4dcc8f\', \'multiverseId\': 399939}, \'multiverseid\': 399939}, {\'name\': \'エルフの幻想家\', \'text\': \'エルフの幻想家が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「この上なく立派な木々も、小さな芽から成長し、生い繁ります。あなたの精神が宿す種も等しく実りますように。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b61627f0-6dba-43dd-87a3-2b4525a75aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 400216}, \'multiverseid\': 400216}, {\'name\': \'엘프 선지자\', \'text\': \'엘프 선지자가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"아주 작은 씨앗에서 거대한 나무가 자라고 울창한 숲을 이룬다. 그대 마음의 작은 씨앗도 그와 같이 크게 자라기를..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02c0501-96ec-4c9d-b664-0dacc3b56372\', \'multiverseId\': 400493}, \'multiverseid\': 400493}, {\'name\': \'Visionário Élfico\', \'text\': \'Quando Visionário Élfico entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"De pequenas sementes nascem e crescem as maiores árvores. Que as sementes da sua mente sejam igualmente férteis."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c170cc4-e125-4919-a6df-aa9579c4a0b6\', \'multiverseId\': 400770}, \'multiverseid\': 400770}, {\'name\': \'Эльфийский Прорицатель\', \'text\': \'Когда Эльфийский Прорицатель выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Из крохотного ростка вырастают величайшие деревья. Пусть семена твоего разума будут столь же плодородны».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d2b44b-d68b-48f5-a427-78c8552e2ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 401047}, \'multiverseid\': 401047}, {\'name\': \'妖精幻视师\', \'text\': \'当妖精幻视师进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「最大的树木也是从一颗小芽开始生长茂盛。愿你心中的种子也如这般硕果累累。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'713266c5-22f7-42ca-9413-d2a80b682c61\', \'multiverseId\': 398831}, \'multiverseid\': 398831}, {\'name\': \'妖精幻視師\', \'text\': \'當妖精幻視師進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「最大的樹木也是從一顆小芽開始生長茂盛。願你心中的種子也如這般碩果累累。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8d211b-67eb-46d6-8cb9-c29aecfbc1ad\', \'multiverseId\': 399108}, \'multiverseid\': 399108}]', '[{\'name\': \'Endlose Auslöschung\', \'text\': \'Benenne eine Kreaturenkarte. Durchsuche den Friedhof, die Hand und die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an Karten mit diesem Namen und schicke sie ins Exil. Dieser Spieler mischt dann seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e502e2c-b66e-46e2-93b0-dcd30d3598e0\', \'multiverseId\': 399334}, \'multiverseid\': 399334}, {\'name\': \'Aniquilación infinita\', \'text\': \'Nombra una carta de criatura. Busca en el cementerio, mano y biblioteca del oponente objetivo cualquier cantidad de cartas con ese nombre y exílialas. Luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de8a0d2a-d1af-4a2f-be31-a138eb51c9cb\', \'multiverseId\': 401273}, \'multiverseid\': 401273}, {\'name\': \'Oblitération infinie\', \'text\': "Nommez une carte de créature. Cherchez dans le cimetière, la main et la bibliothèque de l\'adversaire ciblé n\'importe quel nombre de cartes avec ce nom et exilez-les. Ce joueur mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399611&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff07ee5-60e8-4864-a709-14a73a91f972\', \'multiverseId\': 399611}, \'multiverseid\': 399611}, {\'name\': \'Annientamento Infinito\', \'text\': \'Nomina una carta creatura. Passa in rassegna il cimitero, la mano e il grimorio di un avversario bersaglio per un qualsiasi numero di carte con quel nome ed esiliale. Poi quel giocatore rimescola il suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ea6e4f-9a6a-4b42-bbb9-888635422521\', \'multiverseId\': 399888}, \'multiverseid\': 399888}, {\'name\': \'無限の抹消\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。クリーチャー・カード名を１つ指定する。そのプレイヤーの墓地と手札とライブラリーから、その名前を持つカードを望む枚数探し、それらを追放する。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7f9410-7c75-4bc5-a9c6-bf908690314c\', \'multiverseId\': 400165}, \'multiverseid\': 400165}, {\'name\': \'무한한 소멸\', \'text\': \'생물 카드 한 장을 호명한다. 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대의 무덤, 손, 서고에서 그 이름의 카드를 원하는 만큼 찾아서 추방한다. 그러고 나서 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b3c4674-50b7-4127-94ca-1bf0f9e8572e\', \'multiverseId\': 400442}, \'multiverseid\': 400442}, {\'name\': \'Obliteração Infinita\', \'text\': \'Nomeie um card de criatura. Procure um número qualquer de cards com o mesmo nome daquele card no cemitério, na mão e no grimório do oponente alvo e exile-os. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha seu próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3469851-aadb-4859-908f-15acea3dfa5e\', \'multiverseId\': 400719}, \'multiverseid\': 400719}, {\'name\': \'Бесконечное Изничтожение\', \'text\': \'Назовите карту существа. Найдите на кладбище, в руке и в библиотеке целевого оппонента любое количество карт с тем именем и изгоните их. Затем тот игрок тасует свою библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42399479-2a5b-469d-bb27-653f9ae4bfa7\', \'multiverseId\': 400996}, \'multiverseid\': 400996}, {\'name\': \'无限抹灭\', \'text\': \'说出一个生物牌的名称。从目标对手的坟墓场，手牌及牌库中搜寻任意数量具该名称的牌，并将它们放逐。然后该牌手将其牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36354b4c-5acd-4df8-b531-9c7e151520fa\', \'multiverseId\': 398780}, \'multiverseid\': 398780}, {\'name\': \'無限抹滅\', \'text\': \'說出一張生物牌的名稱。從目標對手的墳墓場，手牌及牌庫中搜尋任意數量具該名稱的牌，並將它們放逐。然後該玩家將其牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea0330af-d983-4879-827c-f2aa548ff955\', \'multiverseId\': 399057}, \'multiverseid\': 399057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erleuchtete Asketin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Erleuchtete Asketin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kritisiere die Götter nicht. Ich kritisiere ihre Autorität, ihre Engherzigkeit und ihre Arroganz."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dab988c-66ea-45f8-9007-6eaf7844cb0d\', \'multiverseId\': 399245}, \'multiverseid\': 399245}, {\'name\': \'Asceta iluminada\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Asceta iluminada entre al campo de batalla, puedes destruir el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo no rechazo a los dioses. Rechazo su autoridad, su presunción y su arrogancia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83a4507a-774b-48d3-9a8d-7d22756fc258\', \'multiverseId\': 401184}, \'multiverseid\': 401184}, {\'name\': \'Ascète éclairée\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Ascète éclairée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez détruire l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et moine\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne rejette pas les dieux. Je rejette leur autorité, leur mesquinerie et leur arrogance. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9aea799-4af0-4d1b-8835-bb388d27a7d2\', \'multiverseId\': 399522}, \'multiverseid\': 399522}, {\'name\': \'Asceta Illuminata\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Asceta Illuminata entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi distruggere un incantesimo bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Non rifiuto gli dei. Rifiuto la loro autorità, la loro meschinità e la loro arroganza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb64c973-c3d1-40a7-8cc7-744327ac3c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 399799}, \'multiverseid\': 399799}, {\'name\': \'悟った苦行者\', \'text\': \'悟った苦行者が戦場に出たとき、エンチャント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「私は神々を否定しているのではない。私が否定するのは、かの者たちの権威と狭量さ、そして傲慢である。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6565df-3746-4055-94aa-a256f4eb5e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 400076}, \'multiverseid\': 400076}, {\'name\': \'깨달음을 얻은 고행자\', \'text\': \'깨달음을 얻은 고행자가 전장에 들어올 때, 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 부여마법을 파괴할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 수도승\', \'flavor\': \'"난 신들을 거부하는 게 아니야. 그들의 권위의식과 시시함, 오만함을 거부하는 거지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2ead30-f8f6-4b50-b145-b71f6676557a\', \'multiverseId\': 400353}, \'multiverseid\': 400353}, {\'name\': \'Asceta Iluminada\', \'text\': \'Quando Asceta Iluminada entra no campo de batalha, você pode destruir o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Monge\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não rejeito os deuses. Eu rejeito o autoritarismo, a arrogância e a mesquinhez deles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92022af2-f500-4043-acd6-6e78f9552f13\', \'multiverseId\': 400630}, \'multiverseid\': 400630}, {\'name\': \'Просветленный Аскет\', \'text\': \'Когда Просветленный Аскет выходит на поле битвы, вы можете уничтожить целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Монах\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не отвергаю богов. Я отвергаю их власть, их мелочность и их высокомерие».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d3929d6-c3e7-4e61-a1dc-03a40f580dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 400907}, \'multiverseid\': 400907}, {\'name\': \'启化苦修士\', \'text\': \'当启化苦修士进战场时，你可以消灭目标结界。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「我不排斥神。我排斥的是神的威权、鄙劣和傲慢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8b7652-a7be-4d49-bd78-fc7d2e3e8584\', \'multiverseId\': 398691}, \'multiverseid\': 398691}, {\'name\': \'啟化苦修士\', \'text\': \'當啟化苦修士進戰場時，你可以消滅目標結界。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「我不排斥神。我排斥的是神的威權、鄙劣和傲慢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3cfe32c-250e-4b83-ade8-179879ab88ac\', \'multiverseId\': 398968}, \'multiverseid\': 398968}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erwachen der Animistin\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Bringe davon alle Länderkarten getappt ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.Zauberkunst — Falls sich zwei oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexerei-Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, enttappe diese Länder.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d97ccb-0d7d-412c-b736-fb9d559d1506\', \'multiverseId\': 399268}, \'multiverseid\': 399268}, {\'name\': \'Despertar de la animista\', \'text\': \'Muestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas de tierra que se encuentren entre ellas en el campo de batalla giradas y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.Dominio de hechizos — Si hay dos o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, endereza esas tierras.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d764780-ed3e-40ca-90db-e9f197d57c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 401207}, \'multiverseid\': 401207}, {\'name\': "Éveil de l\'animiste", \'text\': "Révélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes de terrain parmi elles sur le champ de bataille, engagées, et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.Maîtrise de sort — S\'il y a au moins deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, dégagez ces terrains.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850c6e3f-d80f-4d20-a5ae-a98a58f9a03d\', \'multiverseId\': 399545}, \'multiverseid\': 399545}, {\'name\': "Risveglio dell\'Animista", \'text\': \'Rivela le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Metti tutte le carte terra tra di esse sul campo di battaglia TAPpate e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.Arte magica — Se nel tuo cimitero ci sono due o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, STAPpa quelle terre.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3659a8ea-917d-48a4-a4ca-12b6aa39c009\', \'multiverseId\': 399822}, \'multiverseid\': 399822}, {\'name\': \'精霊信者の覚醒\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードを公開する。その中にある土地・カードをすべてタップ状態で戦場に出し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタント・カードやソーサリー・カードが合わせて２枚以上あるなら、それらの土地をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64249395-069c-40ca-a173-3b11b2050625\', \'multiverseId\': 400099}, \'multiverseid\': 400099}, {\'name\': \'정령숭배자의 각성\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 X장을 공개한다. 그 중 모든 대지 카드를 탭된 상태로 전장에 놓고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 놓는다.주문 숙련 — 당신의 무덤에 집중마법 그리고/또는 순간마법 카드가 두 장 이상 있다면, 그 대지들을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea82791-913c-4e1d-9570-af6777df45d1\', \'multiverseId\': 400376}, \'multiverseid\': 400376}, {\'name\': \'Despertar da Animista\', \'text\': \'Revele os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards de terreno no campo de batalha virados e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.Maestria em magia — Se houver dois ou mais cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço no seu cemitério, desvire aqueles terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3cea01-5401-4909-88fb-51335fbb5ca3\', \'multiverseId\': 400653}, \'multiverseid\': 400653}, {\'name\': \'Пробуждение Анимиста\', \'text\': \'Покажите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Положите все находящиеся среди них карты земель на поле битвы повернутыми, а остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.Мастерство заклинаний — Если на вашем кладбище есть не менее двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и (или) волшебства, разверните те земли.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'203cb694-7014-4e0c-9e82-5bf794d314a8\', \'multiverseId\': 400930}, \'multiverseid\': 400930}, {\'name\': \'物灵师唤醒\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的X张牌。将其中所有地牌横置放进战场，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。精熟咒语～如果你坟墓场中有两张或更多的瞬间和／或法术牌，则重置这些地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9747bff1-c7a1-430f-9912-3ef3f9a5d73b\', \'multiverseId\': 398714}, \'multiverseid\': 398714}, {\'name\': \'物靈師喚醒\', \'text\': \'展示你牌庫頂的X張牌。將其中所有地牌橫置放進戰場，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。精熟咒語～如果你墳墓場中有兩張或更多的瞬間和／或巫術牌，則重置這些地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e134e709-6898-4a39-bb5b-d495ca3b7b3f\', \'multiverseId\': 398991}, \'multiverseid\': 398991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzengel der Zehnten\', \'text\': \'FliegendSolange der Erzengel der Zehnten ungetappt ist, können Kreaturen weder dich noch einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreifen, falls ihr Beherrscher nicht {1} für jede dieser Kreaturen bezahlt.Solange der Erzengel der Zehnten angreift, können Kreaturen nicht blocken, falls ihr Beherrscher nicht {1} für jede dieser Kreaturen bezahlt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6805ead3-05c3-45a1-ad2c-0fe68e226a01\', \'multiverseId\': 399402}, \'multiverseid\': 399402}, {\'name\': \'Arcángel de los diezmos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Mientras el Arcángel de los diezmos esté enderezado, las criaturas no pueden atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas a menos que su controlador pague {1} por cada una de esas criaturas.Mientras el Arcángel de los diezmos esté atacando, las criaturas no pueden bloquear a menos que su controlador pague {1} por cada una de esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7139001d-49ce-4b11-9b0d-15905e3a0b53\', \'multiverseId\': 401341}, \'multiverseid\': 401341}, {\'name\': \'Archange des dîmes\', \'text\': "VolTant que l\'Archange des dîmes est dégagé, les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un planeswalker que vous contrôlez à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {1} pour chacune de ces créatures.Tant que l\'Archange des dîmes attaque, les créatures ne peuvent pas bloquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {1} pour chacune de ces créatures.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e110993-88c1-481e-ac48-389cfaf2e2b6\', \'multiverseId\': 399679}, \'multiverseid\': 399679}, {\'name\': \'Arcangelo dei Tributi\', \'text\': "VolareFintanto che l\'Arcangelo dei Tributi è STAPpato, le creature non possono attaccare te o un planeswalker che controlli a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {1} per ognuna di quelle creature.Fintanto che l\'Arcangelo dei Tributi attacca, le creature non possono bloccare a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {1} per ognuna di quelle creature.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c613db57-0aaa-4ad0-b0df-8f2a9582e037\', \'multiverseId\': 399956}, \'multiverseid\': 399956}, {\'name\': \'徴税の大天使\', \'text\': \'飛行徴税の大天使がアンタップ状態であるかぎり、クリーチャー１体につき、それのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、それではあなたやあなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。徴税の大天使が攻撃しているかぎり、クリーチャー１体につき、それのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ac116b-54f7-4e82-bcee-590982b67b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 400233}, \'multiverseid\': 400233}, {\'name\': \'십일조의 대천사\', \'text\': \'비행십일조의 대천사가 언탭되어 있는 한, 각 생물은 그 조종자가 공격하려는 생물마다 {1}을 지불하지 않으면 당신 또는 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격할 수 없다.십일조의 대천사가 공격하는 한, 각 생물은 그 조종자가 방어하려는 생물마다 {1}을 지불하지 않으면 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c3ecfd-7806-45ec-a556-2466d975bcb0\', \'multiverseId\': 400510}, \'multiverseid\': 400510}, {\'name\': \'Arcanjo dos Dízimos\', \'text\': \'VoarEnquanto Arcanjo dos Dízimos estiver desvirado, as criaturas não poderão atacar você nem um planeswalker que você controla, a menos que o controlador delas pague {1} para cada criatura.Enquanto Arcanjo dos Dízimos estiver atacando, as criaturas não poderão bloquear, a menos que o controlador delas pague {1} para cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26df3eb1-fb11-4a14-adcd-3fbc0023f89c\', \'multiverseId\': 400787}, \'multiverseid\': 400787}, {\'name\': \'Архангел Десятин\', \'text\': \'ПолетПока Архангел Десятин развернут, существа не могут атаковать вас или planeswalker-а под вашим контролем, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {1} за каждое из тех существ.Пока Архангел Десятин атакует, существа не могут блокировать, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {1} за каждое из тех существ.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'110b56bd-e8a7-4a78-8968-4a2a0f24a271\', \'multiverseId\': 401064}, \'multiverseid\': 401064}, {\'name\': \'什一税大天使\', \'text\': \'飞行只要什一税大天使未横置，则对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{1}，否则它不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。只要什一税大天使正进行攻击，则对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{1}，否则它不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f36044e-c9dd-4dab-8f10-006ac86dbffd\', \'multiverseId\': 398848}, \'multiverseid\': 398848}, {\'name\': \'什一稅大天使\', \'text\': \'飛行只要什一稅大天使未橫置，則對每個生物而言，除非其操控者為其支付{1}，否則它不能攻擊你或由你操控的鵬洛客。只要什一稅大天使正進行攻擊，則對每個生物而言，除非其操控者為其支付{1}，否則它不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb3f1921-b924-404e-bb32-28d162f5bed9\', \'multiverseId\': 399125}, \'multiverseid\': 399125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Evolutionssprung\', \'text\': \'{G}, opfere eine Kreatur: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst. Nimm diese Karte auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Essenz der Natur ist Veränderung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399404&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ef8b30-708c-4dbb-892d-7dda3d19206e\', \'multiverseId\': 399404}, \'multiverseid\': 399404}, {\'name\': \'Salto evolutivo\', \'text\': \'{G}, sacrificar una criatura: Muestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura. Pon esa carta en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La esencia de la naturaleza es el cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c19cd6-b2a7-42dc-b1ae-8539d9cbd46e\', \'multiverseId\': 401343}, \'multiverseid\': 401343}, {\'name\': "Bond de l\'évolution", \'text\': "{G}, sacrifiez une créature : Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le changement est l\'essence même de la nature.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399681&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09f43b6e-993b-4705-9303-a3a120f5808c\', \'multiverseId\': 399681}, \'multiverseid\': 399681}, {\'name\': \'Balzo Evolutivo\', \'text\': \'{G}, Sacrifica una creatura: Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "L\'essenza della natura è il cambiamento.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c731a6-1c52-49be-9064-3adfc1c9c380\', \'multiverseId\': 399958}, \'multiverseid\': 399958}, {\'name\': \'進化の飛躍\', \'text\': \'{G}, クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上から、クリーチャー・カードが公開されるまでカードを公開する。そのカードをあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'自然の本質とは変化である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14bf9c3e-68cc-43a6-a3ba-a23949e515f9\', \'multiverseId\': 400235}, \'multiverseid\': 400235}, {\'name\': \'급속한 진화\', \'text\': \'{G}, 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 생물 카드가 공개될 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'자연의 정수는 변화다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c453245b-8e09-4034-a288-54e9824545e1\', \'multiverseId\': 400512}, \'multiverseid\': 400512}, {\'name\': \'Salto Evolutivo\', \'text\': \'{G}, Sacrifique uma criatura: Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura. Coloque aquele card na sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A essência da natureza é a mudança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13d61914-cfcb-4c5e-bb3d-e220b986be78\', \'multiverseId\': 400789}, \'multiverseid\': 400789}, {\'name\': \'Скачок Эволюции\', \'text\': \'{G}, пожертвуйте существо: показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете карту существа. Положите ту карту в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Сущность природы — перемены.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'715024d7-6322-4d1f-b862-237d31d8f614\', \'multiverseId\': 401066}, \'multiverseid\': 401066}, {\'name\': \'飞跃进化\', \'text\': \'{G}，牺牲一个生物：从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止。将该牌置于你手上，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'变化乃自然根本。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09b77670-66a3-4674-926d-f011befbf6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 398850}, \'multiverseid\': 398850}, {\'name\': \'飛躍進化\', \'text\': \'{G}，犧牲一個生物：從你的牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張生物牌為止。將該牌置於你手上，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'變化乃自然根本。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac4322a-55bd-49b1-b3d4-fcb63a0b9edf\', \'multiverseId\': 399127}, \'multiverseid\': 399127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fangbein-Einsiedlerspinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht alle Spinnen brauchen Netze, um ihre Beute zu fangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d58cfb-af2d-4c9a-9819-bb3ab1fca6a9\', \'multiverseId\': 399507}, \'multiverseid\': 399507}, {\'name\': \'Reclusa garras curvas\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear a criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'No todas las arañas necesitan redes para cazar a sus presas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4a3ca3-7da9-48f9-8725-7220e2ec665a\', \'multiverseId\': 401446}, \'multiverseid\': 401446}, {\'name\': \'Recluse crochegriffe\', \'text\': \'Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les araignées n\'ont pas besoin de toile pour attraper leurs proies.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399784&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8c96910-cfcd-4ef7-963d-45fb29733560\', \'multiverseId\': 399784}, \'multiverseid\': 399784}, {\'name\': \'Eremita dagli Artigli Uncinati\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Non tutti i ragni si servono di ragnatele per catturare le loro prede.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34290e6c-defb-4545-b7b9-99d9fdf28e02\', \'multiverseId\': 400061}, \'multiverseid\': 400061}, {\'name\': \'絡み爪のイトグモ\', \'text\': \'到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'すべての蜘蛛が獲物を捕らえるのに網を必要とするとは限らない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00320870-7e71-491a-ae90-aa062af397ba\', \'multiverseId\': 400338}, \'multiverseid\': 400338}, {\'name\': \'고리발 은둔거미\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': \'거미가 꼭 거미줄로만 먹이를 잡는 것은 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5153ac40-6ed2-46d4-a02d-0afac4185995\', \'multiverseId\': 400615}, \'multiverseid\': 400615}, {\'name\': \'Eremita Garra de Gancho\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Nem todas as aranhas precisam de teias para capturar suas presas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8435c2f9-c1b4-41e7-bc86-66ad1630ec66\', \'multiverseId\': 400892}, \'multiverseid\': 400892}, {\'name\': \'Цепконогий Отшельник\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Не всем паукам нужна паутина, чтобы поймать жертву.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222740f2-893a-4791-9fc9-5f9aeb71b849\', \'multiverseId\': 401169}, \'multiverseid\': 401169}, {\'name\': \'钩爪隐士\', \'text\': \'延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'不是所有的蜘蛛都要靠结网来捕捉猎物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4416588-dfd0-4a0c-984c-2eecfe767ce5\', \'multiverseId\': 398953}, \'multiverseid\': 398953}, {\'name\': \'鈎爪隱士\', \'text\': \'延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'不是所有的蜘蛛都要靠結網來捕捉獵物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec97ccd-a69b-4196-9a0c-e37737bb58fc\', \'multiverseId\': 399230}, \'multiverseid\': 399230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feen-Missetäterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)Wenn die Feen-Missetäterin ins Spiel kommt und falls du eine andere Kreatur namens Feen-Missetäterin kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Fee lenkt den Richter ab, während eine zweite das Gesetz stiehlt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399290&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f87c6ff7-3b58-4392-b06d-30f9b8663a01\', \'multiverseId\': 399290}, \'multiverseid\': 399290}, {\'name\': \'Hada malhechora\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)Cuando el Hada malhechora entre al campo de batalla, si controlas otra criatura llamada Hada malhechora, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': \'Un hada distrae al juez mientras la otra roba la ley.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4369871-b438-425c-a4e3-a25140d7a39a\', \'multiverseId\': 401229}, \'multiverseid\': 401229}, {\'name\': \'Scélérate faerie\', \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)Quand la Scélérate faerie arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez une autre créature appelée Scélérate faerie, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Une faerie distrait le juge pendant qu\'une autre dérobe la loi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399567&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'246adfa9-2a4c-46d1-8413-4c3499d24ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 399567}, \'multiverseid\': 399567}, {\'name\': \'Spiritella Furfante\', \'text\': "Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)Quando la Spiritella Furfante entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli un\'altra creatura chiamata Spiritella Furfante, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': "Una spiritella distrae il giudice mentre l\'altra ruba le leggi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a61511-9025-49a2-be83-4478c9707eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 399844}, \'multiverseid\': 399844}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの悪党\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）フェアリーの悪党が戦場に出たとき、あなたが他の「フェアリーの悪党」という名前のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'１体のフェアリーが審判官の注意を引きつける間に、もう１体が法律を盗む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab970591-c28c-4a13-8abf-5605ea4f2643\', \'multiverseId\': 400121}, \'multiverseid\': 400121}, {\'name\': \'범법자 페어리\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)범법자 페어리가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 이름이 범법자 페어리인 다른 생물을 조종한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페어리 도적\', \'flavor\': \'페어리 하나가 판사의 주의를 끌면 다른 페어리가 법을 훔쳐간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc107beb-953a-4328-9699-2924978db7dd\', \'multiverseId\': 400398}, \'multiverseid\': 400398}, {\'name\': \'Fada Marota\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)Quando Fada Marota entra no campo de batalha, se você controlar outra criatura com o nome Fada Marota, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Uma fada distrai o juiz enquanto a outra rouba a lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f55231d-8d5d-4653-a9b0-b00cdc54d808\', \'multiverseId\': 400675}, \'multiverseid\': 400675}, {\'name\': \'Фея-Злоумышленница\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)Когда Фея-Злоумышленница выходит на поле битвы, если под вашим контролем есть другое существо с именем Фея-Злоумышленница, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Одна фея отвлекает судью, а вторая — крадет законы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff77582-b283-4112-80b9-c9c66f4d1904\', \'multiverseId\': 400952}, \'multiverseid\': 400952}, {\'name\': \'仙灵恶徒\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）当仙灵恶徒进战场时，若你操控另一个名称为仙灵恶徒的生物，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'一名仙灵转移法官的注意力，另一名则趁隙作歹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b342cc-c8d5-4524-aaa8-c65fb600bab8\', \'multiverseId\': 398736}, \'multiverseid\': 398736}, {\'name\': \'仙靈惡徒\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）當仙靈惡徒進戰場時，若你操控另一個名稱為仙靈惡徒的生物，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～仙靈／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'一名仙靈轉移法官的注意力，另一名則趁隙作歹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad6a484d-15d1-49d2-a3ee-03934be77193\', \'multiverseId\': 399013}, \'multiverseid\': 399013}]', "[{'name': 'Feldschmiede', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R} oder {W}. Die Feldschmiede fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399248&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efcb2c4a-3c2a-4b19-8cdb-51b839b9b582', 'multiverseId': 399248}, 'multiverseid': 399248}, {'name': 'Forja del campo de batalla', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{T}: Agrega {R} o {W} a tu reserva de maná. La Forja del campo de batalla te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401187&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1525179-aad0-4c0f-8488-329636b186a1', 'multiverseId': 401187}, 'multiverseid': 401187}, {'name': 'Forge de campagne', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W} à votre réserve. La Forge de campagne vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399525&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '822f7628-35b3-4723-b8de-70d00136b82d', 'multiverseId': 399525}, 'multiverseid': 399525}, {'name': 'Forgia da Campo', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana. La Forgia da Campo ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399802&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75478fff-7b32-45dc-abff-39e3d0216e61', 'multiverseId': 399802}, 'multiverseid': 399802}, {'name': '戦場の鍛冶場', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{W}を加える。戦場の鍛冶場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400079&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '060bcc8e-7c3e-409c-8feb-a7ae5f5d38d5', 'multiverseId': 400079}, 'multiverseid': 400079}, {'name': '전장의 대장간', 'text': '{T}: {1}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{T}: {R} 또는 {W}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다. 전장의 대장간은 당신에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400356&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8431867b-6655-472d-a303-248d39567dc6', 'multiverseId': 400356}, 'multiverseid': 400356}, {'name': 'Forjaria do Campo de Batalha', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana. Forjaria do Campo de Batalha causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400633&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '711f94e8-e52e-4324-bfd6-8c46bedc2061', 'multiverseId': 400633}, 'multiverseid': 400633}, {'name': 'Кузница на Поле Боя', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{T}: добавьте {R} или {W} в ваше хранилище маны. Кузница на Поле Боя наносит вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400910&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bb4d0c8-5772-4bca-8c5c-93f0e00a6aad', 'multiverseId': 400910}, 'multiverseid': 400910}, {'name': '战场融炉', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{T}：加{R}或{W}到你的法术力池中。战场融炉对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398694&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '560052c7-1de1-41e2-98e3-fea972d57733', 'multiverseId': 398694}, 'multiverseid': 398694}, {'name': '戰場鎔爐', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{T}：加{R}或{W}到你的魔法力池中。戰場鎔爐對你造成1點傷害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398971&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07d9bb15-94e5-4e2e-ab59-0f4e1ede85a9', 'multiverseId': 398971}, 'multiverseid': 398971}]", "[{'name': 'Festlandzertreter', 'text': 'Der Festlandzertreter kann nicht neutralisiert werden.Verursacht Trampelschaden (Diese Kreatur kann beim Angreifen überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': 'Ab und zu werden schwere Erdbeben, herumfliegende Felsen und unerklärliche Staubwirbel fälschlicherweise der Turbulenz angekreidet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401515&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '808dacd3-d325-41a3-9298-e1a1272f92a5', 'multiverseId': 401515}, 'multiverseid': 401515}, {'name': 'Aplastatierra', 'text': 'El Aplastatierra no puede ser contrarrestado.Arrolla. (Esta criatura puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker defensor mientras ataca.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'A veces terremotos violentos, piedras volando y tormentas de polvo fuera de temporada se atribuyen por error a la Turbulencia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401627&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd182c789-fbd1-4f28-b164-0d3b6b6c971b', 'multiverseId': 401627}, 'multiverseid': 401627}, {'name': 'Piétineur terrestre', 'text': 'Le Piétineur terrestre ne peut pas être contrecarré.Piétinement (Cette créature peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker défenseur quand elle attaque.)', 'type': 'Créature : bête', 'flavor': 'Parfois les violents tremblements de terre, les chutes de pierres et les tempêtes de poussière hors-saison sont attribuées par erreur au Roulis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401531&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae4a073d-f4ff-44f0-9deb-a2a24f5c5473', 'multiverseId': 401531}, 'multiverseid': 401531}, {'name': 'Calcaterra', 'text': 'Il Calcaterra non può essere neutralizzato.Travolgere (Questa creatura può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso a un giocatore in difesa o a un planeswalker mentre attacca.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'A volte violenti terremoti, macigni in caduta e tempeste di polvere fuori stagione sono erroneamente attribuiti al Torbido.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401547&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd9e3078-06ae-45c4-9341-68c807fc099d', 'multiverseId': 401547}, 'multiverseid': 401547}, {'name': '土を踏み付けるもの', 'text': '土を踏み付けるものは打ち消されない。トランプル（攻撃しているこのクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージを防御プレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': '暴力的な地震やぶつかり合う岩、時期外れの砂嵐等は、時として乱動と間違われる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401563&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '679cf8e0-4dd7-4d30-8689-3a871148eb4f', 'multiverseId': 401563}, 'multiverseid': 401563}, {'name': '대지를 짓밟는 야수', 'text': '대지를 짓밟는 야수는 무효화될 수 없다.돌진 (이 생물은 공격할 때 수비플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 여분의 피해를 입힌다.)', 'type': '생물 — 야수', 'flavor': '사람들은 격렬한 지진이나 낙석, 그리고 먼지 폭풍이 일어나면 항상 소용돌이를 탓한다. 하지만 항상 소용돌이의 소행이라 생각하면 오산이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401579&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '893f781e-1bd3-4c4d-b591-483a70c0623a', 'multiverseId': 401579}, 'multiverseid': 401579}, {'name': 'Pisoteador de Terreno', 'text': 'Pisoteador de Terreno não pode ser anulado.Atropelar (Esta criatura pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao planeswalker ou jogador defensor ao atacar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Besta', 'flavor': 'Algumas vezes violentos terremotos, rochedos em queda e tormentas de areia fora de estação são atribuídos erroneamente ao Turbilhão.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401595&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f896b48-23de-4170-87f2-5d9f496d3c28', 'multiverseId': 401595}, 'multiverseid': 401595}, {'name': 'Земной Тяжелоступ', 'text': 'Земной Тяжелоступ не может быть отменен.Пробивной удар (Атакуя, это существо может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения защищающемуся игроку или planeswalker-у.)', 'type': 'Существо — Зверь', 'flavor': 'Иногда сильные землетрясения, летящие валуны и неожиданные пылевые бури ошибочно приписываются Великому Валу.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401611&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eba63bf6-540e-47be-ae3b-8c7da6a912d5', 'multiverseId': 401611}, 'multiverseid': 401611}, {'name': '跺地猛兽', 'text': '跺地猛兽不能被反击。践踏（此生物攻击时造成之过量战斗伤害能对防御牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': '有时狂烈地震，飞掠巨岩，以及突来砂暴都给人误认作狂搅。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401483&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc7907c1-8475-4b68-b7c6-e57eb4e139e9', 'multiverseId': 401483}, 'multiverseid': 401483}, {'name': '跺地猛獸', 'text': '跺地猛獸不能被反擊。踐踏（此生物攻擊時造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對防禦玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）', 'type': '生物～野獸', 'flavor': '有時狂烈地震，飛掠巨岩，以及突來砂暴都給人誤認作狂攪。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401499&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eebb264d-ec10-4205-aa34-af0deb3cd4dd', 'multiverseId': 401499}, 'multiverseid': 401499}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feuerunhold-Elementar\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)Ruhm 1 (Wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und falls sie nicht ruhmvoll ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und sie wird ruhmvoll.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2170223-82b3-473f-90ff-dc7621ae7b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 399421}, \'multiverseid\': 399421}, {\'name\': \'Elemental demonio del fuego\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entra bajo tu control.)Prestigio 1. (Cuando esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, si no tiene prestigio, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y gana prestigio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8610cad-6149-4838-9b7c-b55b6ffda5ef\', \'multiverseId\': 401360}, \'multiverseid\': 401360}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de fiellefeu\', \'text\': "Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)Réputation 1 (Quand cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, si elle n\'est pas réputée, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient réputée.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cabdbcb8-6825-4fa3-9c85-ae75c8a3858d\', \'multiverseId\': 399698}, \'multiverseid\': 399698}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Demone di Fuoco\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)Rinomare 1 (Quando questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, se non è rinomata, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e diventa rinomata.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703e38fc-3326-47a2-88dc-98cfda1f5ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 399975}, \'multiverseid\': 399975}, {\'name\': \'炎魔の精霊\', \'text\': \'速攻（このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）高名１（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これが高名でない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これは高名になる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'100485c2-9a02-447f-bb8a-7c24b313c1fd\', \'multiverseId\': 400252}, \'multiverseid\': 400252}, {\'name\': \'불마귀 정령\', \'text\': \'신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)명성 1 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때, 이 생물에 명성이 없다면 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 이 생물은 명성을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26013c8c-5c28-49ac-908e-6f18f21a3076\', \'multiverseId\': 400529}, \'multiverseid\': 400529}, {\'name\': \'Elemental Flamidemo\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que passa ao seu controle.)Renome 1 (Quando esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, se ela não for renomada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará renomada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cefe57a-d15a-43b3-879e-084532127673\', \'multiverseId\': 400806}, \'multiverseid\': 400806}, {\'name\': \'Элементаль Духа Пламени\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)Прославленность 1 (Когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, если оно не прославлено, положите на него один жетон +1/+1, и оно становится прославленным.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc828af1-3bc3-42ba-9f91-00e3f41acfe5\', \'multiverseId\': 401083}, \'multiverseid\': 401083}, {\'name\': \'炎魔元素\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）铭勇1（当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若它未铭勇，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它已铭勇。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ebac54-0306-462a-acaf-be758290c198\', \'multiverseId\': 398867}, \'multiverseid\': 398867}, {\'name\': \'炎魔元素\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）銘勇1（當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，若它未銘勇，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物且它已銘勇。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14b08363-0a03-4389-ab2b-14b5be2d8cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 399144}, \'multiverseid\': 399144}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuriger Höllenhund\', \'text\': \'{R}: Der Feurige Höllenhund erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hatte gehofft, ihm die Loyalität eines Wachhundes anzuerziehen, aber mit der Macht des Feuers kommt seine Launenhaftigkeit."—Moggath, Sardischer Elementalist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2da4c8-42ea-42a0-b8ad-d8e0f02a6c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 401511}, \'multiverseid\': 401511}, {\'name\': \'Perro infernal ardiente\', \'text\': \'{R}: El Perro infernal ardiente obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Esperaba poder inspirarle la lealtad de un perro guardián, pero el poder del fuego es impredecible".—Mággath, elementalista de Sardia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05671549-8075-4fe3-9bf4-355f6139e42b\', \'multiverseId\': 401623}, \'multiverseid\': 401623}, {\'name\': \'Cerbère ardent\', \'text\': "{R} : Le Cerbère ardent gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et chien de chasse\', \'flavor\': "« J\'avais espéré lui donner la fidélité d\'un chien de garde, mais le pouvoir du feu est toujours imprévisible. »—Maggath, élémentaliste sardien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401527&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'413f218d-8198-4a3e-b0d2-56b8bdf3b498\', \'multiverseId\': 401527}, \'multiverseid\': 401527}, {\'name\': \'Segugio Infernale Focoso\', \'text\': \'{R}: Il Segugio Infernale Focoso prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Segugio Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Avevo sperato di instillargli la fedeltà di un cane da guardia, ma dal potere del fuoco deriva la sua imprevedibilità."—Maggath, elementalista di Sardia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f2d4460-e94a-4933-8bba-5edb7ad4359d\', \'multiverseId\': 401543}, \'multiverseid\': 401543}, {\'name\': \'焦熱のヘルハウンド\', \'text\': \'{R}：ターン終了時まで、焦熱のヘルハウンドは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・猟犬\', \'flavor\': \'「番犬の忠実さを吹き込めればと思っていたが、火の力は予想外に過ぎる。」――サルディアの精霊術士、マーガス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c24d4345-c631-4e7d-9992-690e9bc25052\', \'multiverseId\': 401559}, \'multiverseid\': 401559}, {\'name\': \'열화지옥견\', \'text\': \'{R}: 열화지옥견은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사냥개 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"녀석을 충성스러운 짐승으로 바꾸려 했지만 불의 힘을 예측할 수 없어 실패하고 말았지."—사르디아인 정령술사 마가스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d5d266-ccb4-402a-bf63-7fe56c9619f2\', \'multiverseId\': 401575}, \'multiverseid\': 401575}, {\'name\': \'Sabujo Infernal\', \'text\': \'{R}: Sabujo Infernal recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Sabujo\', \'flavor\': \'"Minha esperança era incutir-lhe a lealdade de um cão de guarda, mas o poder do fogo está intrinsecamente ligado à sua imprevisibilidade."— Maggath, elementalista sardiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4539f488-bcd9-46fe-9965-67853b3f934a\', \'multiverseId\': 401591}, \'multiverseid\': 401591}, {\'name\': \'Огненный Цербер\', \'text\': \'{R}: Огненный Цербер получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Пес\', \'flavor\': \'«Я надеялся наделить его преданностью сторожевого пса, но вместе с силой огня приходит и его непредсказуемость».— Маггат, сардийский создатель элементалей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a14adf2e-9856-4037-a334-249a327388f2\', \'multiverseId\': 401607}, \'multiverseid\': 401607}, {\'name\': \'火热地狱犬\', \'text\': \'{R}：火热地狱犬得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素／猎犬\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾期望将守卫犬的忠贞精神注入其间，但火焰的力量让它天生就无从预测。」～沙地亚元素师马加斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a57f7d03-84aa-417b-9cd6-af6d13631fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 401479}, \'multiverseid\': 401479}, {\'name\': \'火熱地獄犬\', \'text\': \'{R}：火熱地獄犬得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素／獵犬\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾期望將守衛犬的忠貞精神注入其間，但火焰的力量讓牠天生就無從預測。」～沙地亞元素師馬加斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda0c426-e0ad-4353-b0d2-4d47c76a0092\', \'multiverseId\': 401495}, \'multiverseid\': 401495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuriger Impuls\', \'text\': \'Der Feurige Impuls fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.Zauberkunst — Falls sich zwei oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexerei-Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, fügt der Feurige Impuls dieser Kreatur stattdessen 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nun, das ist irgendwie aus dem Ruder gelaufen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399347&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a1a36e4-2577-4168-a3a3-bdacbb202d19\', \'multiverseId\': 399347}, \'multiverseid\': 399347}, {\'name\': \'Impulso ardiente\', \'text\': \'El Impulso ardiente hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.Dominio de hechizos — Si hay dos o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, en vez de eso, el Impulso ardiente hace 3 puntos de daño a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vaya, esto se ha descontrolado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'932900f7-df96-492f-9ff4-ce681f5ad730\', \'multiverseId\': 401286}, \'multiverseid\': 401286}, {\'name\': \'Impulsion ardente\', \'text\': "L\'Impulsion ardente inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée.Maîtrise de sort — S\'il y a au moins deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, l\'Impulsion ardente inflige 3 blessures à cette créature à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai un peu perdu le contrôle. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0933d85-dc20-459a-b9ca-c32bc233009e\', \'multiverseId\': 399624}, \'multiverseid\': 399624}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Infuocato\', \'text\': "L\'Impulso Infuocato infligge 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio.Arte magica — Se nel tuo cimitero ci sono due o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, l\'Impulso Infuocato infligge invece 3 danni a quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La situazione mi è un po\\\' sfuggita di mano."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58185969-e889-4bc9-9095-dfc16a973a77\', \'multiverseId\': 399901}, \'multiverseid\': 399901}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の衝動\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の衝動はそれに２点のダメージを与える。魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタント・カードやソーサリー・カードが合わせて２枚以上あるなら、焦熱の衝動はそのクリーチャーに２点の代わりに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ああ、もうお手上げね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd69e2ea-adf7-4de0-9051-cd23f909e08b\', \'multiverseId\': 400178}, \'multiverseid\': 400178}, {\'name\': \'불타는 충동\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 불타는 충동은 그 생물에 피해 2점을 입힌다.주문 숙련 — 당신의 무덤에 집중마법 그리고/또는 순간마법 카드가 두 장 이상 있다면, 대신에 불타는 충동은 그 생물에 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이런, 자제를 못 했네."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1082250-970c-44cc-a316-8731a09641cb\', \'multiverseId\': 400455}, \'multiverseid\': 400455}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Impulso Flamejante causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.Maestria em magia — Se houver dois ou mais cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço no seu cemitério, em vez disso, Impulso Flamejante causará 3 pontos de dano àquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Bem, parece que exagerei."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8760db2-1ccb-4026-92b8-1b69b2deffb8\', \'multiverseId\': 400732}, \'multiverseid\': 400732}, {\'name\': \'Огненный Импульс\', \'text\': \'Огненный Импульс наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу.Мастерство заклинаний — Если на вашем кладбище есть не менее двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и (или) волшебства, Огненный Импульс вместо этого наносит 3 повреждения тому существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Что ж, похоже, это вышло из-под контроля».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c34aa7-0c96-4afa-99cc-52e919864c2c\', \'multiverseId\': 401009}, \'multiverseid\': 401009}, {\'name\': \'暴烈冲动\', \'text\': \'暴烈冲动对目标生物造成2点伤害。精熟咒语～如果你坟墓场中有两张或更多的瞬间和／或法术牌，则改为暴烈冲动对该生物造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「好吧，这失控了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef60df2-fca6-4578-a4b7-5ceb051b1d10\', \'multiverseId\': 398793}, \'multiverseid\': 398793}, {\'name\': \'暴烈衝動\', \'text\': \'暴烈衝動對目標生物造成2點傷害。精熟咒語～如果你墳墓場中有兩張或更多的瞬間和／或巫術牌，則改為暴烈衝動對該生物造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「好吧，這失控了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ca7364-b1ed-4ff8-9fd0-ce7cc953686d\', \'multiverseId\': 399070}, \'multiverseid\': 399070}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuriges Ende\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um Feuriges Ende zu wirken.Feuriges Ende fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Boros-Legionär sah ein edles Selbstopfer, der Rakdos-Raufbold sah einen flammenden Selbstmord, und für den Izzet-Alchimisten war es ein Experiment, das gründlich schiefgegangen war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'390316d7-67b6-4c9e-86b6-441fd0aab080\', \'multiverseId\': 399328}, \'multiverseid\': 399328}, {\'name\': \'Conclusión ardiente\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar la Conclusión ardiente, sacrifica una criatura.La Conclusión ardiente hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El legionario boros vio un noble sacrificio, el malhechor rakdos un suicida en llamas y el alquimista ízzet un experimento que salió mal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0425f6e5-24cd-4aa1-b596-fe5cf026e924\', \'multiverseId\': 401267}, \'multiverseid\': 401267}, {\'name\': \'Conclusion ardente\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer la Conclusion ardente, sacrifiez une créature.La Conclusion ardente inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le légionnaire boros vit un noble sacrifice, l\'étrangleur rakdos, une immolation, et l\'alchimiste izzet, une expérience qui avait mal tourné.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399605&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e70883-e598-4ea9-9b8f-b13e8f20c342\', \'multiverseId\': 399605}, \'multiverseid\': 399605}, {\'name\': \'Esito Ardente\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare l\'Esito Ardente, sacrifica una creatura.L\'Esito Ardente infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il legionario Boros vide un nobile sacrificio, il thug Rakdos un feroce suicidio e l\'alchimista Izzet un esperimento finito male.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f78973b3-492e-4561-844e-a3faf4f3238b\', \'multiverseId\': 399882}, \'multiverseid\': 399882}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の結末\', \'text\': \'焦熱の結末を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。クリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の結末はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ボロスの軍団が見たのは尊い自己犠牲であり、ラクドスのごろつきが見たのは焼身自殺であり、イゼットの錬金術師が見たのは失敗した実験であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4611000-174c-40ea-949d-820b88b52c06\', \'multiverseId\': 400159}, \'multiverseid\': 400159}, {\'name\': \'불타는 결말\', \'text\': \'불타는 결말을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.생물을 목표로 정한다. 불타는 결말은 그 생물에 피해 5점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'같은 장면을 보고 보로스 군단병은 고귀한 희생이라고 생각했고, 락도스 깡패는 분신자살이라 생각했으며, 이젯 연금술사는 실험이 실패했다고 생각했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aa84617-6d42-4dfd-9c2f-839b0bc5327b\', \'multiverseId\': 400436}, \'multiverseid\': 400436}, {\'name\': \'Conclusão Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Conclusão Flamejante, sacrifique uma criatura.Conclusão Flamejante causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O legionário Boros viu um sacrifício nobre; o rufião Rakdos viu um suicídio carbonizante; e o alquimista Izzet viu um experimento que deu errado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ae2d3b-c944-4c55-8ce3-b7785505a99e\', \'multiverseId\': 400713}, \'multiverseid\': 400713}, {\'name\': \'Огненное Завершение\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Огненного Завершения пожертвуйте существо.Огненное Завершение наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Легионер Боросов увидел благородное самопожертвование, бандит Ракдосов — яркое самоубийство, а алхимик Иззетов — неудачный эксперимент.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cba3014f-6812-44dd-bf50-18d0866a7753\', \'multiverseId\': 400990}, \'multiverseid\': 400990}, {\'name\': \'暴烈终局\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放暴烈终局的额外费用。暴烈终局对目标生物造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'波洛斯军团兵见证了高贵的牺牲，拉铎司刺客看到了眩目的自杀场面，伊捷炼金术士则认为是实验出了差错。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d802975a-ba12-4aa1-8750-75c9ba99783c\', \'multiverseId\': 398774}, \'multiverseid\': 398774}, {\'name\': \'暴烈終局\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放暴烈終局的額外費用。暴烈終局對目標生物造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'波洛斯軍團兵見證了高貴的犧牲，拉鐸司刺客看到了眩目的自殺場面，伊捷鍊金術士則認為是實驗出了差錯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f4e32e-424e-4006-8c21-a1fc9bb48b71\', \'multiverseId\': 399051}, \'multiverseid\': 399051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Finsteres Gesuch\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.Zauberkunst — Falls sich zwei oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexerei-Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B}{B}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399356&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6223631-5dd2-4f79-9d51-d606e49d4e39\', \'multiverseId\': 399356}, \'multiverseid\': 399356}, {\'name\': \'Petición oscura\', \'text\': \'Busca una carta en tu biblioteca y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.Dominio de hechizos — Si hay dos o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, agrega {B}{B}{B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1559966-473b-4706-aef4-5ebf7016711b\', \'multiverseId\': 401295}, \'multiverseid\': 401295}, {\'name\': \'Obscure prétention\', \'text\': "Cherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque et mettez cette carte dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.Maîtrise de sort — S\'il y a au moins deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, ajoutez {B}{B}{B} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399633&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de303e78-763c-419a-ab0c-7e54102c55b7\', \'multiverseId\': 399633}, \'multiverseid\': 399633}, {\'name\': \'Richiesta Oscura\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.Arte magica — Se nel tuo cimitero ci sono due o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, aggiungi {B}{B}{B} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a099ff-d23d-43ee-abef-0ae9460ed559\', \'multiverseId\': 399910}, \'multiverseid\': 399910}, {\'name\': \'闇の誓願\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからカードを１枚探し、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタント・カードやソーサリー・カードが合わせて２枚以上あるなら、あなたのマナ・プールに{B}{B}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b470467-3f5f-41a0-8e30-2524b81b3cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 400187}, \'multiverseid\': 400187}, {\'name\': \'어둠의 청원\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 원하는 카드 한 장을 찾아 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그러고 나서 당신의 서고를 섞는다.주문 숙련 — 당신의 무덤에 집중마법 그리고/또는 순간마법 카드가 두 장 이상 있다면, {B}{B}{B}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d39f1c8c-9b80-429e-8741-b1889884b7db\', \'multiverseId\': 400464}, \'multiverseid\': 400464}, {\'name\': \'Petição Obscura\', \'text\': \'Procure um card em seu grimório e coloque aquele card em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.Maestria em magia — Se houver dois ou mais cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço no seu cemitério, adicione {B}{B}{B} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57311b47-2957-4fa8-8718-a9305a108d40\', \'multiverseId\': 400741}, \'multiverseid\': 400741}, {\'name\': \'Темное Воззвание\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту и положите ту карту в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.Мастерство заклинаний — Если на вашем кладбище есть не менее двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и (или) волшебства, добавьте {B}{B}{B} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8db3fad9-c6d2-4b96-a6f4-d6ad97b9b98e\', \'multiverseId\': 401018}, \'multiverseid\': 401018}, {\'name\': \'求诸黑暗\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张牌并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。精熟咒语～如果你坟墓场中有两张或更多的瞬间和／或法术牌，则加{B}{B}{B}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff66b572-08d9-4f2f-b118-70fc33052004\', \'multiverseId\': 398802}, \'multiverseid\': 398802}, {\'name\': \'求諸黑暗\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋一張牌並置於你手上。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。精熟咒語～如果你墳墓場中有兩張或更多的瞬間和／或巫術牌，則加{B}{B}{B}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cf5a01d-c7b7-4bf0-ac73-0ccd1996028d\', \'multiverseId\': 399079}, \'multiverseid\': 399079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenschatten-Beschwörung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe einen Spielstein ins Spiel, der eine Kopie dieser Kreatur ist. Der Spielstein erhält Eile. Schicke ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399378&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6753f6b2-20ea-4182-a809-8179325da8be\', \'multiverseId\': 399378}, \'multiverseid\': 399378}, {\'name\': \'Invocación sombrardiente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {R}. Si lo haces, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd37c6ea-8bee-4862-9e79-19a1b9906e6c\', \'multiverseId\': 401317}, \'multiverseid\': 401317}, {\'name\': "Conjuration d\'ombreflamme", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {R}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité. Exilez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399655&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a8bb5e8-4ad1-45fc-b059-b13933941bda\', \'multiverseId\': 399655}, \'multiverseid\': 399655}, {\'name\': "Evocazione dell\'Ombrafiamma", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {R}. Se lo fai, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina che è una copia di quella creatura. Quella pedina ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a858f8-af26-4dcc-b8c9-eb41ce6b10af\', \'multiverseId\': 399932}, \'multiverseid\': 399932}, {\'name\': \'炎影の妖術\', \'text\': \'トークンでないクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたはそのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークンを１体戦場に出す。そのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b09ef36-5cf3-4d0b-901c-e5cb91144d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 400209}, \'multiverseid\': 400209}, {\'name\': \'불꽃그림자 소환술\', \'text\': \'토큰이 아닌 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {R}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 그 생물의 복사본 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 토큰은 신속을 얻는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 토큰을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e796b4-66ff-4575-837f-3c619df125c1\', \'multiverseId\': 400486}, \'multiverseid\': 400486}, {\'name\': \'Conjuração de Sombra Ígnea\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que não seja ficha entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {R}. Se fizer isso, você colocará uma ficha no campo de batalha que seja uma cópia daquela criatura. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto. Exile-a no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db6822b7-1c72-45c0-ae42-c063e4361648\', \'multiverseId\': 400763}, \'multiverseid\': 400763}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Огненной Тени\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда не являющееся фишкой существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {R}. Если вы это делаете, положите на поле битвы одну фишку, являющуюся копией того существа. Та фишка получает Ускорение. Изгоните ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b561cd3-09d7-49e6-92ba-1940ad4b62cf\', \'multiverseId\': 401040}, \'multiverseid\': 401040}, {\'name\': \'召现焰影\', \'text\': \'每当一个非衍生物的生物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{R}。若你如此作，将一个衍生物放进战场，此衍生物为该生物的复制品。该衍生物获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'783cdbbb-4d8c-4cd4-9d1d-f49a9eac7b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 398824}, \'multiverseid\': 398824}, {\'name\': \'召現焰影\', \'text\': \'每當一個非衍生物的生物在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{R}。若你如此作，將一個衍生物放進戰場，此衍生物為該生物的複製品。該衍生物獲得敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'838dceec-009e-4f27-82dc-1a5f210bd32f\', \'multiverseId\': 399101}, \'multiverseid\': 399101}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fleisch zu Staub\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein weiterer Tag. Ein weiterer rächender Engel. Ein weiterer Klumpen Federn zum Entsorgen."—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f48029cc-a914-435e-804e-12788752a9e0\', \'multiverseId\': 401507}, \'multiverseid\': 401507}, {\'name\': \'De la carne al polvo\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. No puede ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un día más, un ángel vengador más. Un montón de plumas más que irán a la basura".—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b863795b-bbea-43b9-98f4-541fe76b8ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 401619}, \'multiverseid\': 401619}, {\'name\': \'Chair en poussière\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature ciblée. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Un nouveau jour. Un nouvel ange vengeur. Un nouveau tas de plumes à jeter aux ordures. »—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7299c541-5492-42fb-aaf2-72601898df6d\', \'multiverseId\': 401523}, \'multiverseid\': 401523}, {\'name\': \'Polverizzare la Carne\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerata.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un altro giorno. Un altro angelo vendicatore. Un altro pugno di piume da gettare tra i rifiuti."—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd74bf9-13e1-47c8-b44e-0c0854c60735\', \'multiverseId\': 401539}, \'multiverseid\': 401539}, {\'name\': \'肉は塵に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「新たな日。新たな復讐する天使。新たな羽根の塊がゴミ箱へ。」――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b747c31-cfe0-4b1f-83de-bac7a3c3b823\', \'multiverseId\': 401555}, \'multiverseid\': 401555}, {\'name\': \'살을 먼지로\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 그 생물은 재생될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"흥, 복수의 천사가 또 납시었군. 지겨운 녀석들이야. 그래봐야 깃털 더미로 변하겠지만."—릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6c99d2-c1e0-4dbb-a38a-8c33b28e8f0a\', \'multiverseId\': 401571}, \'multiverseid\': 401571}, {\'name\': \'Da Carne ao Pó\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Ela não pode ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Mais um dia. Mais um anjo vingador. Mais um amontoado de penas para jogar no lixo."— Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3fb98c-ce25-46fe-b8ac-d1da3ba57529\', \'multiverseId\': 401587}, \'multiverseid\': 401587}, {\'name\': \'Плоть в Прах\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Оно не может быть регенерировано.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Очередной день. Очередной мстящий ангел. Очередная груда перьев отправляется в выгребную яму».— Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2317992c-c1c7-4b94-85ca-214672c64029\', \'multiverseId\': 401603}, \'multiverseid\': 401603}, {\'name\': \'肉身化尘\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。它不能重生。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「又是一天。又来一个天使要复仇，又多一团羽毛得扔掉。」～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5de14f73-a7fa-4ee6-9dc6-110b3687c598\', \'multiverseId\': 401475}, \'multiverseid\': 401475}, {\'name\': \'肉身化塵\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物。它不能重生。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「又是一天，又來一個天使要復仇，又多一團羽毛得扔掉。」～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244f0c4a-3d9f-4936-b387-c7a466cb614f\', \'multiverseId\': 401491}, \'multiverseid\': 401491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnismagier\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges -2/-2 erhalten lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Fleisch ist für meine Gaben nicht bereit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399449&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b33ff4f6-912f-4652-9d53-35a00dd66843\', \'multiverseId\': 399449}, \'multiverseid\': 399449}, {\'name\': \'Lanzaruina\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, puedes hacer que la criatura objetivo obtenga -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu carne no está preparada para mi don".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bb302f4-0ae9-47ab-adaf-11ea6d5057e8\', \'multiverseId\': 401388}, \'multiverseid\': 401388}, {\'name\': \'Lancefléau\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, vous pouvez faire qu\'une créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Ta chair est trop tendre pour recevoir mes faveurs. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ff2a311-3b97-474e-ad3f-60d28ddf2851\', \'multiverseId\': 399726}, \'multiverseid\': 399726}, {\'name\': \'Lanciadevastazione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, puoi far prendere -2/-2 a una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua carne non è pronta per i miei doni."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b33bb3-072d-4fcd-a7d2-c9d2bbe2f323\', \'multiverseId\': 400003}, \'multiverseid\': 400003}, {\'name\': \'荒廃唱え\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の肉体では私の贈り物を受け止められんな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04f493b-89a4-458d-a956-f84186f37cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 400280}, \'multiverseid\': 400280}, {\'name\': \'질병술사\', \'text\': \'당신이 부여마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물이 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받도록 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"네 몸은 아직 내 선물을 받을 준비가 안 됐어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99f36a8c-a0f3-4249-ac9b-bb3633cddb87\', \'multiverseId\': 400557}, \'multiverseid\': 400557}, {\'name\': \'Conjurador de Desgraça\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica de encantamento, você pode fazer com que a criatura alvo receba -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua carne não está preparada para minhas dádivas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95afef69-e37f-445d-b7b2-84ad4a0a4b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 400834}, \'multiverseid\': 400834}, {\'name\': \'Колдун Злоключений\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание чар, вы можете дать целевому существу -2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Твоя плоть еще не готова получить мои дары».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30190000-9f18-410c-ab0e-0fa544a98958\', \'multiverseId\': 401111}, \'multiverseid\': 401111}, {\'name\': \'枯灵法师\', \'text\': \'每当你施放结界咒语时，你可以使目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你的肉身还没准备好接受我的赠礼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6efcd465-2aa6-4097-b1e5-1e6d39bde616\', \'multiverseId\': 398895}, \'multiverseid\': 398895}, {\'name\': \'枯靈法師\', \'text\': \'每當你施放結界咒語時，你可以使目標生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「你的肉身還沒準備好接受我的贈禮。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b902c4b-1ec3-4494-a8a1-d3c012f5348f\', \'multiverseId\': 399172}, \'multiverseid\': 399172}]', "[{'name': 'Gaeas Rache', 'text': 'Gaeas Rache kann nicht neutralisiert werden.EileGaeas Rache kann nicht das Ziel von nichtgrünen Zaubersprüchen oder von Fähigkeiten aus nichtgrünen Quellen sein.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399332&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5476bb89-7551-4948-9fff-d884985bff4e', 'multiverseId': 399332}, 'multiverseid': 399332}, {'name': 'Venganza de Gaia', 'text': 'La Venganza de Gaia no puede ser contrarrestada.Prisa.La Venganza de Gaia no puede ser objetivo de hechizos que no sean verdes o de habilidades de fuentes que no sean verdes.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=401271&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09dc706f-8cfc-4ed5-bd51-bad5daf32d6a', 'multiverseId': 401271}, 'multiverseid': 401271}, {'name': 'Vengeance de Gaia', 'text': 'La Vengeance de Gaia ne peut pas être contrecarrée.CéléritéLa Vengeance de Gaia ne peut pas être la cible de sorts non-verts ou de capacités de sources non-vertes.', 'type': 'Créature : élémental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399609&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '849feff0-9584-4e3f-ab02-df9405355314', 'multiverseId': 399609}, 'multiverseid': 399609}, {'name': 'Vendetta di Gea', 'text': 'La Vendetta di Gea non può essere neutralizzata.RapiditàLa Vendetta di Gea non può essere bersaglio di magie non verdi o abilità da fonti non verdi.', 'type': 'Creatura — Elementale', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399886&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '331af8e1-3c0f-4419-b3f7-1a33360e4010', 'multiverseId': 399886}, 'multiverseid': 399886}, {'name': 'ガイアの復讐者', 'text': 'ガイアの復讐者は打ち消されない。速攻ガイアの復讐者は、緑でない呪文や緑でない発生源の能力の対象にならない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400163&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '423a20a3-e8c0-4d7e-adb3-7d22e6b17371', 'multiverseId': 400163}, 'multiverseid': 400163}, {'name': '가이아의 보복', 'text': '가이아의 보복은 무효화될 수 없다.신속가이아의 보복은 녹색이 아닌 주문이나 녹색이 아닌 원천에서 나온 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.', 'type': '생물 — 정령', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400440&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29d435a4-014d-42f0-b981-f5ea14d0339f', 'multiverseId': 400440}, 'multiverseid': 400440}, {'name': 'Vingança de Gaia', 'text': 'Vingança de Gaia não pode ser anulado.ÍmpetoVingança de Gaia não pode ser alvo de mágicas que não sejam verdes ou de habilidades que não sejam de fontes verdes.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400717&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15f3a24e-3ea9-4589-a898-c0600f97d51c', 'multiverseId': 400717}, 'multiverseid': 400717}, {'name': 'Месть Геи', 'text': 'Месть Геи не может быть отменена.УскорениеМесть Геи не может быть целью незеленых заклинаний или способностей от незеленых источников.', 'type': 'Существо — Элементаль', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=400994&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2524460d-da5f-40ae-90f4-58f94db3d20b', 'multiverseId': 400994}, 'multiverseid': 400994}, {'name': '盖亚复仇灵', 'text': '盖亚复仇灵不能被反击。敏捷盖亚复仇灵不能成为非绿色咒语或非绿色来源的异能之目标。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=398778&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df5bbbdc-90c3-4990-893b-e21995269f78', 'multiverseId': 398778}, 'multiverseid': 398778}, {'name': '蓋亞復仇靈', 'text': '蓋亞復仇靈不能被反擊。敏捷蓋亞復仇靈不能成為非綠色咒語或非綠色來源的異能之目標。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399055&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ef6b80b-23ae-4930-8398-d680a4389141', 'multiverseId': 399055}, 'multiverseid': 399055}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=399243&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8843ba72-f6e1-44e