a creature: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Put that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', '{R}, Discard a land card: Molten Vortex deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', '{R}: Fiery Hellhound gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} to your mana pool. Spend this mana only to cast an Elf creature spell.{T}: Target attacking Elf you control gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Mage-Ring Network.{T}, Remove X storage counters from Mage-Ring Network: Add {X} to your mana pool.', "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Foundry of the Consuls: Put two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying onto the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{T}: Add {B} or {G} to your mana pool. Llanowar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{T}: Add {G} or {U} to your mana pool. Yavimaya Coast deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{T}: Add {R} or {W} to your mana pool. Battlefield Forge deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{T}: Add {U} or {R} to your mana pool. Shivan Reef deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.{T}: Add {W} or {B} to your mana pool. Caves of Koilos deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {R} to your mana pool. When that mana is spent to cast a red instant or sorcery spell, copy that spell and you may choose new targets for the copy.', "{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card. If there are five or more cards in your graveyard, exile Jace, Vryn's Prodigy, then return him to the battlefield transformed under his owner's control.", '{T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{T}: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{U}: Watercourser gets +1/-1 until end of turn.']
